  <para style="h">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matiyu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matiyu</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu Kirisiti əbye ofye</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Dəye nu zhni Yeisu əbye Masifu, Dawuda nugwnu, Ibrahim nugwnu:<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Ibrahim nu ɓə zhni Ishakwu dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:2">Ishakwu nu ɓə zhni Yakwuɓwu dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:2">Yakwuɓwu nu ɓə zhni Yahuda dada n əwo azajei,<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yahuda nu ɓə zhni Perez dada n Zerai, n a ɓə zhni ai yi əwo əya nge Tamari nyi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">Perez nu ɓə zhni Hezron dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:3">Hezron nu ɓə zhni Ram dada,<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Ram nu ɓə zhni Aminadab dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminadab nu ɓə zhni Nahshon dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:4">Nashon nu ɓə zhni Salmon dada,<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salmon nu ɓə zhni Bowaz dada, n a ɓə zhni ai yi əwo əya nge Raham nyi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">Bowaz nu ɓə zhni Obedi dada əwo əya ai yi nge Rutu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:5">Obedi nu ɓə zhni Jesse dada,<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />jesnu Jesse nu ɓə zhni Əsu Dawuda dada.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 1:6" />
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:6">Dawuda nu ɓə zhni Sulemanu dada, ń əwo əya ɓə zhni Uriya nyikwo nyi,<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Sulemanu nu ɓə zhni Rehobwowam dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:7">Rehobwowam nu ɓə zhni Abyija dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:7">Abyija nu ɓə zhni Asa dada,<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa nu ɓə zhni Jehoshafat dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">Jehoshafat nu ɓə zhni Jehoram dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:8">Johoram nu ɓə zhni Uziya dada. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uziya nu ɓə zhni Jotam dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">Jotam nu ɓə zhni Ahaz dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahaz nu ɓə zhni Hezekiya dada,<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekiya nu ɓə zhni Manase dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:10">Manase nu ɓə zhni Amon dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:10">Amon nu ɓə zhni Josiya dada,<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />jesnu Josiya nu ɓə zhni Jekwoninya dada n əwo azajei əsa ń ɓa ɓə lo okwnula ń Babyila nyi.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Ń Babyila okwnula avnu:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:12">Jekwoninya nu ɓə zhni Shetiya dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:12">Shetiya nu ɓə zhni Zerubabel dada,<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zerubabel nu ɓə zhni Abyihud dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:13">Abyihud nu ɓə zhni Eliyakim dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliyakim nu ɓə zhni Azor dada,<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azor nu ɓə zhni Zadok dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">Zadok nu ɓə zhni Akim dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:14">Akim nu ɓə zhni Elihud dada,<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Elihud nu ɓə zhni Eliyaza dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">Eliyaza nu ɓə zhni Mattan dada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 1:15">Mattan nu ɓə zhni Yakwuɓwu dada,<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />jesnu Yakwuɓwu nu ɓə zhni Yusufu dada, Mariyamwu əɓa, jesnu Mariyamwu nu ɓə zhni Yeisu əya n a yi Kirisiti nyi.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Nlonu acala ɓə nyi awoceanyi nu vnyanya ń kwo laka n Ibrahim kwoi lo Dawuda, awoceanyi n kwo laka n Dawuda kwoi lo okwnula lo Babyila, jesnu awoceanyi ənya ń kwo laka n okwnula kwoi lo Kirisiti əsa.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu Masifu mama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Yeisu Kirisiti mama əɓo ɓə wu nlanyi nu: Yusufu ɓəə la Mariyamwu, Yeisu əya, dù, ama to ɓai yeɓədo m, a gye wo gnyi ń nubwoi Zafnu Gyigyiyi nya. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Ntuge Yusufu, əwo əɓa, ɓə zhni gbenuyi nu ń owa vyi, dudulonu, to wa ye wa dna wo vnyinkwo ń bəgyé m, wo ɓə ncei dna n bwugba wa ya wo fyaa nu.<verse eid="MAT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ama woi kwu nubwozhni nlonu, maləka Dagayi nya wa kpəya da wo dna n ənanu wa gna, “Yusufu Dawuda nugwnu, to wodna ha la Mariyamwu lo apyi ncei waa zè əho nyikwo m, ntuge nubwo ń wo gnyi ń əkwoi nyi, kwo gbmi n Zafnu Gyigyiyi nu. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Wo ɓə ma nugwnu, hoi tu wo əye ge Yeisu, ntuge wo ɓə gnyi əwo aza ń əɓa leifyi.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Aɓo ye vnyanya ɓə zhni nabai kwa nu ənya nu ń Dagayi ɓə kwu da ń sheɓəgwognayi əgbe: <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Ɓyinyikwoyi kwului ɓə la nubwo woi ma əɓyinugbai, a ɓə yi wo əye Immanuwe” (n kwo nu gyi, “Shekwoyi kwnusnu lo n yii”).<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />She Yusufu ɓə kwnu-agyewyi, wa zhni shi maləka Dagayi nya ɓə tu wo əgbe, wa la Mariyamwu lo ncei ń apyi n zhni əwo nyikwo. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Ama to wa wnagye n woi m, nya əsa n wo ɓə la əɓyinugbai ma, wa tu wo əye ge Yeisu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Awyemwayi lo Masifu gnaɓyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Shi a ɓə la Yeisu ma dna n Baitalamyi n Yahuda əknyi, dna ń əsu Hiridusu əbəgyisa, Awyemwayi ɓai kwnu n kpəkwó ɓa ɓe Urishelima <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />ɓa nyaɓo, “Əza yi dna n nanu ń a la ma Ayahudiyi əsu nyi a? Ya gye əwo kpasi əsa n kwa kpe tu nyi, jesnu yi kwu ɓe ya ga wo mwamwa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />She əsu Hiridusu ɓə wo ce, kwa wnu wo bwugba ɓədo n Urishelima əknyii vnyanya. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />She wo ɓə la apirisiti atukwoda n owa anyawuyii yezhi vnyanya n aba gbmanyi, wa nya ɓa abaayi ɓo ń a ɓə ma Kirisiti. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Ɓa gna, “Dna ń Baitalamyi n Yahuda əknyi. Ntuge əɓo nyi n sheɓəgwognayi ncei kafyilo:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“ ‘Ama əho, Baitalamyi, n Yahuda əknyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ho to zhni əzhi wyegbaciyi nu ń Yahuda abegyiyi m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">ntuge əza ɓə gbmiɓe ń əho nu ń wo ɓə kna Israila əmi aza.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Nsayi Hiridusu wa yì Awyemwayi zhi fyaa, wa nya ɓa əsa ɓo n kpasi ɓə kpeyawu ncei. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Wa tnu n ɓai n Baitalamyi, wa gna, “Fye lo fye zna əɓyi yi shni pəceye. N əwo wyegyegyei, fye ɓe fya gna mi, nabai ma lo mi ga wo mwamwa ce.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Shi ɓa ɓə kwu əsu ɓəda wo, ɓa wna zokwo, kpasi ń ɓa ɓə gyewye əsa ń kwo ɓə kpeyawu nyi, ɓa gye kwoi lo ń əɓa abye jesnu ɓa vyi kwo lo nya əsa ń kwo ɓə kpetu n aba ń əɓyi ɓə dna nyi. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />She ɓa ɓə gye kpasi yi, bwugba kwa da ɓa n mwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Ǹ əɓa pwuwa loloí, ɓa gye əɓyi n əwo əyai Mariyamwu, ɓa yazhi ɓa ga wo mwamwa. Ɓa gwu əɓa anyaɓwa ya ɓa ga wo anyaga zinali nya, frakisensi n myirii. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Əsa ń ɓa ɓə jezelo əɓa əknyi, to ɓa lo Urishelima ɓa ga əsu Hiridusu anabagyi m, ntuge Shekwoyi ɓə la əɓo kpma ɓa dna ənanu nge ɓa lo n zokwo doi.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wyiwyiya lo Masar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />She ɓa ɓə kwu lo, maləka Dagayi nya wa ɓe Yusufu aba dna ənanu, wa gna wo, “Laka ha la əɓyi n əwo əyai ha wyiya lo Masar. Ho la dna n ɓwaayi, nya əsa n mi ɓə gna ho nge ho jezeɓe, ntuge əsu Hiridusu ye wa zna əɓyi ye shni nu nabai wa wu wo.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Dna n sukwo yi, wa laka wa la əɓyi n əwo əyai ɓa lo Masar, <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />aba ń wo ɓə dna, nya Hiridusu əfyi sa. Ntulonu əɓo n Dagayi ɓəə kwu da n sheɓəgwognayi əgbe, kwa kwu nu: “Ń Masar nu ń ma yi əmi nugwnu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />She Hiridusu ɓə kpe nge awyemwayi n la zè n əwo avnu, wa gyi minagyi napyei, wa ga əgbe nge a wu aɓyi azanugbai vnyanya ń ɓa ɓəi n ayei ngwnu-aba kwoi lo snuta ń Baitalamyi n əkwo azhigbai, woi vyi əsa ń awyemwayi ɓə da wo ncei. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Nsayi, ənya ń a ɓə da ń sheɓəgwognayi Irimyiya əgbe, kwa kwu nu:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“A kwu bəgye wo dna n Rama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">ɓwuci nya n bwugbawnu yaakwoi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Rahila woi ciɓwi woi zhe awyenyi ntu n əwo aɓyi ɓo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">to woi wo atnazhni m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">ntuge ɓa to ye lo m.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jejeze lo Nazereti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Shi Hiridusu ɓə la fyí, maləka Dagayi nya wa kpeya da Yusufu dna n ənanu n Masar, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />wa gna, “Laka, la əɓyi ye n əwo əyai fya jezelo Israila əknyi, ntuge aza yi n ɓa ɓə zna əɓyi wyewyeyi znashni nyi, ɓa kwu fyí.”<verse eid="MAT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Ntulonu wa laka, wa la əɓyi n əwo əyai ɓa lo Israila əknyi. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Ama she ɓa ɓə wo nge Arkelas nu tú woi gyibe tu n Yahuda ń əwo dada Hiridusu apita, ədna kwa wo wo ń wo ɓa lo n ɓo. Ai la kpma wo ń ənanu, wa pmyiya lo Gəlili əknyi, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />wa lo waa dna ń əzhi ai yi Nazereti. Ntulonu ɓəda ń sheɓəgwognayi ɓə da kwa kwu nu, nge a ɓə yi wo nge Nazeretiyi.<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yohana batizimazhniyi zhni zokwo aba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Dna ń anyipyei yi, Yohana Batizimazhniyi wa ɓe, woi zhni waazi dna n zhabwikawu Yahuda nya <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />woi gna, “Fye yeabwi, ntuge əshebemi kwo la wo vyivyiwyi.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Əza nu nyi n a ɓə da əwo ɓo n sheɓəgwognayi Ishaya əgbe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Əza bəgye dnawyi lo ń zhabwikawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Zhni zokwo aba ga Dagayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">la awogye tacé cewo ntu n əwo ɓo.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />A ɓə zhni Yohana aje n lakwnumi əyii nu, jesnu əwo əshnipanya ɓə zhni əpa nu. Əwo nyagyi ɓə zhni àɓo nu ɓədo əsugbmai. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Aza ɓa kwnu n Urishelima n Yahudai vnyanya n Urudu əknyii, ɓa lo da wo. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Ɓai da əɓa aleifyi, wa zhni ɓa batizima dna n Urudu əlà.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Ama she wo ɓə gye Afarisiyi bəgyé ɓədo na Asadusiyii ɓai ɓe əwo batizima zhni aba, wa gna ɓa: “Əfye agbezhi aɓyi! Nyika nu na kwnù fye nge fye bwusi n Shekwoyi minagyi napyei n kwo ɓe lo nyi a? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Fye wu alu abwiye nya. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Jesnu fye to zhninubwo nge fye ɓa gna əfyehni, ‘Yi n Ibrahimii lo n zhni əyi dada m.’ Mi gna fye nge Shekwoyi ɓa myi wa kwu aɓyi kala zhi ga Ibrahim n akwuta ye. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />A la gbakwnu lu la tu ń ashnuwna gbegye, shnuwna dəhodəhoi ń kwo to ga gyigyi manai m, a ɓə znu kwo ya shi jesnu ai la kwo sheya dna n əná.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />“Mi zhni fye batizima n nuwnai nu ntu n abwiye ɓo. Ama ń əmi avnu əza ɓe lo n wo du mi lo n kalá, əwo abwada, mi to kwnuce lo ma shi m. Wo ɓə zhni fye batizima n Zafnu Gyigyiyii ɓədo ənái. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Əwo fnyitala àpmana pyeya nya dnalo ń əwo akwnu, jesnu wo ɓə fnyi əwo əvye ya, woi ye əwo alikama fyi n dobwi jesnu woi dna əsní əná n ənái n kwo ta wnu m.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu batizima zhni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gbmiɓe n Gəlili wa lo Urudu nabai Yohana wo zhni wo batizima. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Ama Yohana wa yì əwohni wa kpma wo ce, woi gna, “Əmi nu gwo ha zhni mi batizima, ho nyi ɓe da mi?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fa kwaa zè nlonu nsaiye; kwo bmyalo nabai ya nú ɓəfyecezhni vnyanya.” Nlonu, Yohana waa ye.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Shi a ɓə zè n Yeisu batizimazhniyi, wa gbmiɓe n nuwna. Nsayisayii, əshemi kwa gwuya, wa gye Shekwoyi Zafnu kwoi shnizhi ɓe ngye lukpe kwoi yatu n əwo. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Njesnu bəgye kwa gbmi n əshemi kwoi gna, “Əmi Nugwnu nu nyi, n mi ye; ǹ woi nu n mi ɓwa bwugbada dəidəi.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s1">A mwi Yeisu n zhabwikawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Nlonu Zafnu wa lo n Yeisui n zhabwikawu, ntuge Shetam wo mwu wo. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Ń əgbewna avnu anyipyei shiinyi n asukwoi shiinyi nya, myikwnu kwaa wo gwnu. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Əzamwuyi wa ɓe da əwo wa gna, “Ngye ho zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu nu, gna akwuta ye ɓa kwu zè biledi.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Kwo kafyilo: ‘Zanyikwoci taa gyianyì n nyagyii nu gbmanyi m, ama n ɓədagbma dəhodəhoi ń kwo gbmi n Shekwoyi əgbe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Nlonu Shetam wa la wo lo ncei n əzhiyaakwo gyigyiyi, waa wo gnyiagnyi tu n Dagayipwuwa àsna duduyi shé.<verse eid="MAT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Wa gna wo, “Ngye ho zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu nù, she əhohni yashi ń əknyi. Ntuge a ncei kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“ ‘Wo ɓa ga əwo amaləka ɓəgbetu tu ń əho tukwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">jesnu ɓa ɓá kna ho n əɓa aɓwadai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">nabai to ha znu əho pita n kwuta m.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yeisu wa dna wo ɓəgbe, “A kafyilo ce ge: To dna Dagayi əho Shekwoyi n mwumwu m”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Njesnu Shetam wa la wo lo ncei ń əpe àsnada, wa wu wo abemi vnyanya anyì nya n əɓa bmyabmyai. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Wa gna, “Anya ye vnyanya mi ɓa kwu ɓa ga ho, ngye ho ɓa yashi, ha ga mi mwamwa.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yeisu wa gna wo, “Laka ń əmi aba, Shetam! Ntuge a cei kafyilo: ‘Mwa Dagayi əho Shekwoyi, jesnu əwo nu ɓwasnu n ho ɓa zhni wo tnutnu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Nlonu Shetam wa fa wo, amaləka ɓa ɓe ɓa bma wo zhni.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ya waazizhni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />She Yeisu ɓə wo nge a la Yohana gwudna n zhalu, wa gbmiya lo Gəlili. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Wa gbmi n Nazereti, wa lo waa dna n Kapanam, ń kwo ɓə ma ń Zebwulum nuwna-znudna gbe n Naftali nyai nyi, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />nabai kwa nu ənya ń a ɓə kwu da n sheɓəgwognayi Ishaya əgbe:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Zebwulum əknyi ɓədo n Naftali nyai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Zokwo shikwo nya, n Urudu əkpmai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Gəlili Abyedo nya,<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />aza n ɓa sase fyi n wyegbma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">ɓa kwu bwuznagna yaakwo gyewye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">aza yi n ɓa sase fyi ń əfyi jejelukwo nyi, bwuznagna kwo la yakpe ɓa.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Ənya n kwo laka n əsa yii, Yeisu wa ya waazizhni, “Fye yeabwi, ntuge əshebemi kwo la wo vyivyiwyi.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu yi amwutuyi kpmisnuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Shi Yeisu ɓə lo woi znazna ma ń Gəlili shikwo əgbe, wa gye əza n əwodoi, Sima ń a yi Byitusu nyi n əwodoi Anduru. Ɓa ɓə fyi ɓai she əsa nu n nuwna-znudna, ntuge ɓa ɓə zhni abmyawnayi nu. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yeisu wa gna, “Fye ɓe, fya vyi mi, jesnu mi ɓə tnu n fyei, fya wna aza ngye abmya.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />N əsagbmanyii ɓa ya əɓa asa zhi, jesnu ɓa vyi wo.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Wa laka ń abaayi lo abye, wa gye əza ń əwodoi, Jemyis Zebədi nugwnu n kwnusnu n əwodoi Yohana. Ɓa ɓə fyi n əya nuwnanya nu ɓədo n əɓa dadai Zebədi, ɓai zhni əɓa asa aba. Yeisu wa yì ɓa, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />jesnu nsayisayii, ɓa fa əya nuwnanya n əɓa dadai ɓa vyi wo.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ká anyasnai gna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yeisu wa zna laɓa n Gəlili vnyanya, woi wunya n əɓa Ayahudiyibwokwnu, woi zhni waazi nabagyi manai əbemi nya jesnu woi ká anyasnayi dəhodəhoi gna n agwnumai. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Əwo nabagyi kwaa gnamyi fyi n Siriya vnyanya, a ɓe wo n azai vnyanya ń ɓa ɓə n anyasnai gbowogbowo, aza yi n ɓa ɓə n anyasna anapyei, ase nyasnada, aza yi ń ɓa ɓə anyasna fyipyiipyii, ɓədo anayi fyifyiyi dai, wa ka ɓa gna vnyanya. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Deeji yaakwo kwoi kwnu n Gəlili, Dekapolis, Urishelima, Yahuda ɓədo ń səpai n Urudu piyatu, ɓa vyi wo.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Waazizhni tu ń əpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />She Yeisu ɓə gye deeji, wa gwnutu lo n əpe səpa waa sase. Əwo amwutuyi ɓa ɓe da wo, <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />wa ya ɓa nyawu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MAT 5:2">Anabəlika aduduyi</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 5:2">Wa gna:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Anabəlikada nu n awyekwoyii fyi n zafnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">ntuge Shekwoyi əbemi zhni əɓa nya nu.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Anabəlikada nu n aza yii ń ɓa wnubwugba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">ntuge a ɓə zhni ɓa atna.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Anabəlikada nu ń atukwogbayii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">ntuge anyi ɓaa zè əɓa əgwú.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Anabəlikada nu n aza yii n ɓa wo myikwnu n nuwna myikwnui ntu ɓəfyecezhni ɓo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">ntuge a ɓə fwú ɓa nubwo.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Anabəlikada nu ń asnusnugyeyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">ntuge a ɓə wu ɓa snusnugye.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Anabəlikada nu ń aza yii ń əɓa ədu n tnadodnai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">ntuge ɓa ɓə gye Shekwoyi əwye.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Anabəlikada nu n aza yii ń ɓa wna aɓəzhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">ntuge a ɓə yi ɓa ge Shekwoyi aɓyi.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Anabəlikada nu n aza yii ń a wna ɓa əsnu ntu ń ɓəfyecezhni ɓo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">ntuge əshebemi zhni əɓa nya nu.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Anabəlikada nu n fyei əsa ń aza knyi fye akpmi, ɓai wu fye awyesnugbegye ɓo jesnu ɓai kpe fye aɓənukwoi dəhodəhoi akatá nya ntu ń əmi ɓo. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Fye zhni bwugbabwui, fya dagbma ntuge əfye gyiba zhni yaakwo nu dna ń əshemi, ntuge nlonu nu n ɓa ɓə wú sheaɓəgwognayi awyesnugbegye ɓo ń ɓa ɓə gyi n əfye abye nyi.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Snakpegye n bwuznagnai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />“Əfye nu zhni snakpegye anyì nya. Ama ń snakpegye kwo lá əkwo apmanya kwnuya, kwo ɓa je əkwo dada ɓwa ń wunanu a? Kwo to ye n apmai lo ntu nyahonyahoi ɓo m, akpəge a zè kwo ya zhi jesnu a dna kwo n apitai.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Əfye nu zhni bwuznagna anyì nya. Əzhi n kwo mi kpe ń əpe, a taa myi a so kwo m. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />A ta wna pyitila əná aa kwo kwnu papa m. N əkwoɓwi, a tukwo n əkwo kwnuyi nu jesnu kwa ga zahozahoyi bwuznagna dna n pwuwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Nlonu cè, fa əfye bwuznagna kwa fnu n aza vnyanya aba, nabai ɓa gye əfye atnutnu amanai ɓa la əfye Dada tu n wo dna ń əshemi nyi.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Owa nunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Fye to zhninubwo nge ma ɓe ma wnu Owa ya nu m, kwo Sheaɓəgwognayi ɓəda m; mi to ɓe ma wnu ɓa ya nu m, ama ma nu ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Mi gna fye ɓəhnihni nu, əshemi ń əknyii ɓa ɓə la duya, ama nyaka byegye gnagbagbai to lo n kwo ɓə ɓwuwye m, owa dəhodəhoi ɓa gyiabye lo nú kwoi nu əɓo n a ye ncei. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Ntucenu zahozahoyi n waa ɓəgbetu gnagbagbai pmyishi, wa wu azaje lonu, a ɓə yi wo gnagbagbai n əshebemi. Ama zahozahoyi n wa vyi waa wu aɓəgbetu ye, a ɓə yi wo nge əza yaakwo dna n əshebemi. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Ntuge mi gna əfye nge akpe əfye aɓəfyecezhni ɓa kwu du Afarisiyii nya n owa anyawuyii, fye to ɓə lofyi n əshebemi m nanyinanyi.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Əzawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />“Fye kwu wo nge a ɓə kwu da aza n sapai, ‘Fye taa wu əza m, jesnu zahozahoyi ń wa wu əza, a ɓa da wo owa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Ama mi gna fye nge zahozahoyi n wa gyi minagyi n wo əzadoi kwo mapwii, a ɓa da wo owa. Njesnu, zahozahoyi n wa knyi əwodo kwo mapwii akpmi nge, ‘Raka,’ wo ɓa yeayi ń owada bwokwnu. Jesnu zahozahoyi n wa gna, ‘Əho mama!’ Wo ɓə dna ń azhnìgye anápyi nya.<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />“Ntucenu, ń ha ga nyaga gnyi n bəgədi, ha pa nge əhozado kwo əho mapwi n ɓəhoi dnalo ń hoi, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />la əho nyaga fa shi ń bəgədi abye. Kpmisnuyi, lo fyei la aɓo kwnuya najei; ńsayi ha ɓe ha ga əho nyaga.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Kwnu aɓəya n pyepyei n əho nuwnuyii n wo lo ń hoi n owada bwokwnu. Zhni ce fyei kwnu lo n zokwo, nabai to əho nuwnuyii wa ta ho ya dna ń owadayi akwnu m, jesnu owadayi woi dna ho n bwusiɓyiyida akwnu, ɓa she ho ya dna n zhalu m. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Ɓəhnihni mi gna ho, ho to ɓə gbmiya m, akpəge ho kwu sisinkəɓwo kpmacei zo gba.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anagbái</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Fye kwu wo nge a ɓə kwu da, ‘Fye taa zhni anagbái m.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Ama mi gna fye nge, zahozahoyi n wa shi nyikwoza awye n shakpei wo kwu anagbái luzhni n woi ń əwo bwugba. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ngye əho əwyekwnunu ɓwaizhe nya ɓa zhni ho ha cebwonyi, la kwo gbmiya, haa kwo sheya. Kwo n hoi dulo hoi ɓwu əho nayi əga gbmanyi nuwna, a fa ədo ń a ɓa she əho nayi vnyanya ya dna n anápyi nyi. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Jesnu ngye əho ɓwaizhe ɓa zhni ho ha cebwonyi, znu kwo ya haa kwo sheya. Kwo n hoi dulo hoi ɓwu əga gbmanyi nuwna ń əho nayi, a fa ədo n a ɓə she əho nayi vnyanya ya dna n anápyi nyi.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwulawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“A kwu gna, ‘Əza n wa gbmi əwo nyikwo ya, ɓəshishinu wa ga wo nyakaɓəgbmi mwulawu nya.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Ama mi gna fye nge, zahozahoyi n wa wu mwula n əwo nyikwoi, akpəge ntu asisiɓozhni ɓo, wo la wo nyikwo dna anagbáizhni, jesnu zahozahoyi n wa la nyikwo n a kwu mwulawu kwo, wo zhni anagbái nu.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anasni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Njesnu, fye kwu wo nge a ɓə kwu gna aza n sapai, ‘To bma əho ana ya m, ama la əho anasni shiɓwa n ho kwu sni ga Dagayi nyi.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Ama mi gna fye, fye to si nyasí m nanyinanyi: kwo n əshemii, ntuge kwo zhni Shekwoyi əbeshnikpegye nu; <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />kwo ǹ anyìi, ntuge kwo zhni əwo apitakpeba nu; kwo n Urishelimai m, ntuge kwo zhni əzhiyaakwo Əsu Yaakwo nya nu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Jesnu to sí nyasi n əho tukwoi m, ntuge ho taa myi ha zhni kwo tukwoyi gbmanyi kwaa zè bwuibwuii kwo zhiizhiyii m. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Ənya vnyanya ń ho ɓa da ntna ɓədnai, əkwo nu, ‘Əə’ kwo ‘Aawo’; ənya n kwo ɓaa du dəye, kwo gbmi n əzanukwoyi aba nu.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyawu ntu əɓotagba ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Fye kwu wo nge a kwu gna, ‘Əwye ntu n əwye ɓo, jesnu nyikna ntu n nyikna ɓo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Ama mi gna fye, fye to na əzanukwoyi aɓo m. Ń əzaho wa ce ho agnaipmi n ɓwaizhe ɓwa, pmyi agnai dəyi wu wo ce. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Ngye əzaho ncei pmalo wa lo n hoi n owada bwokwnu jesnu wa gwo əho jekpe əmìnya, ha kwu əho əje əbmyi nya ya ga wo ɓədo. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />N əzaho wa gyi ho ce nge ho lo n woi myilu gbmanyi, ha lo n woi amyalu ngwnu-aba. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Ga əza ənya n wa ɓa ho, jesnu to pmyiavnu wu əza n wo ye nyamwi n ho m.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeyewu ga anuwnuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Fye kwu wo nge a kwu gna, ‘Wu əho kwnuzhiyi yeye, jesnu ha wnu əho nuwnuyi ənu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Ama mi gna fye, fye ye n əfye anuwnuyii, jesnu fya zhniaduwa ntu ń aza yi ɓo ń ɓa wu fye awyesnugbegye ɓo nyi. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />N fya zhni nlonu, fye ɓa kwu zè əfye Dada əshemi nya aɓyi. Wo zhni əwo nyipyei kwa kpé tu ń aza anukwoi ń aza amanayii, wa je tnu n əgbmai kpe ń aɓəfyeceyi n atnaɓəfyeceyii. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ngye fye ye aza yi nu n ɓa ye fye nyi, knyi gyibai nu n fye ɓə ɓwa a? Agədu gwoyi ta ɓwa cenu zhni m? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Njesnu n fya ɓwa əfye aza nu gnaɓyi, knyiɓei nu n fye zhni n kwo du azaje a? Kwo ashnagbayi ta zhni nlonu nu m? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Ntucenu fye kwu zè anunui, ngye shi əfye Dada əshemi nya ń zhni nunui nyi.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Nyaga ga awyekwoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />“Fye zhni pəceye to fya wú əfye ɓəfyecezhnizhni ń aza abye nabai ɓa gyewye m. N fya zhni lonu, fye to ɓə ɓwa gyiba ń əfye Dada aba n wo dna n əshemi nyi m.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Ntulonu she fye ga awyekwoyi ənya, fye to dna kwo əwyi n knaknacii m, ngye shi akwocednayi zhni fyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu jesnu kpe ń adnadna, nabai aza ga ɓa mwamwa m. Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, ɓa la əɓa gyiba gwo n nunui. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Ama she fye ga awyekwoyi ənya, fye to ye ɓwaipmi kwa kpe ənya n əfye ɓwaizhe gnyi kwoi zhni m, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />nabai əfye nyaga kwaa zè fyaa. Nlonu əfye Dada ń wo gye əɓo əwye ń a zhni fyaa nyi, wo ɓa ga fye gyiba.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aduwazhni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Əsa ń fya zhniaduwa, fye to kwu wu ngye akwocednayi m, ntuge ɓa ye ɓa zhniaduwa fyi ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu jesnu kpe n azokwo bma aba, nabai aza ɓa gye ɓa. Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, ɓa la əɓa gyiba gwo ń nunui. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Ama əsa ń ha zhniaduwa, lodna n əho nyakwnumi, haa kpakwo gwu, jesnu ha zhniaduwa ga əho Dada, ń a ta gye wo nyi m. Nlonu əho Dada, n wo gye əɓo ń a zhni dna n ɓwuɓwu nyi, wo ɓa ga ho gyiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Njesnu əsa ń ha zhniaduwa, to da əɓo gbmanyigbmanyi ngye ashnagbayi m, ntuge ɓa zhninubwo nge a ɓa wo ɓa ntu ń əɓa aɓədagbma bəgyé ɓo nu. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />To la zè ngye əɓa m, ntuge əho Dada kpe ənya əye lo ń ho n əkwo apmai, to hoi nya wo m.<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />“Nlai nu ń fye ɓa zhniaduwa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“ ‘Əyi Dada dna ń əshemi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">əho əye zhni gyigyiyi nu,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />əho əbemi kwo ɓe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">a zhni əho ɓəye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">dna ń anyì ngye shikwonyi ń əshemi nyi.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Ga yi n naiye əyi nyagyi nya wyizo.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Jesnu ha zo yi əyi aleifyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">shi əyihni kwu abwizo aza ń ɓa bwu yi nyi.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />To ha lofyi n yii ń mwumwu m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">ama ha gnyi yi ya n əzanukwoyi.’<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Ntuge n ha zo azaje abwi əsa n ɓa bwi ho ncei, əho Dada əshemi nya ɓa zo əhohni aleifyi ce. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Ama ń ho to zo əho azaje abwi m, əho Dada taa zo əho aleifyi ce m.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Əgbewna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“She ho dna n gbewna, to wnuwyedna ngye akwocednayi m, ntuge ɓa zhni ɓa wnuwyedna nabai ɓa wu aza nge ɓa wnagbe lo. Ɓəhnihni ɓa la əɓa gyiba pmagwo n nunui. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Ama əsa ń ha wnagbe ncei, ha kwu omi pmya ń ho tukwo jesnu ha əho awyewnu, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />nabai n kwo taa wu aza pəipəi nge ho dna lo n əgbewna m, akpəge əho Dada; n a ta gye wo nyi m, jesnu əho Dada n wo gye ɓo n a zhni kwo dna n ɓwuɓwu nyi, wo ɓa ga ho gyiba.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyaɓwayezhi n əshemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />“Fye to kwu nyaɓwa sofyi əfyehni n əknyi m, aba ń anyìmana n odnai zhni ɓa agbma m, jesnu aba ń avyì lofyi ɓa wyi ɓa m. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Ama fye kwu əfye nyaɓwa sofyi əfyehni n əshemi, aba ń anyìmana n odnai taa wnu ɓa ya m, jesnu aba n avyì taa lofyi ɓa wyi ɓa m. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Ntuge aba ń əho nyaɓwayezhi nyi, ń abaayi nu ń əho ədu ɓa shi cè.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Əwye nu zhni pyitila nayi nya. Ngye əho awye n laafyiyai lo, əho nayi vnyanya kwo ɓaa nu n bwuznagnai. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Ama n əho awye to n laafyiyai lo m, əho nayi vnyanya kwo ɓaa nu n wyegbmai. Ntulonu ngye bwuznagna n kwo fyi n əho nayi nyi kwo zhni wyegbma nu, a gye kwo zhni wyegbma yaakwo nu!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />“Əzaho to lo ń wo ɓa myi wa zhni adagayi ngwnu-aba tnutnu m. Kwo wo wnu gbmanyi ənu jesnu wa ye n zadəyii, kwo wo ɓa əwohni ga ń gbmanyi tnutnuzhni jesnu wa ci zadəyi wyegba. Ho taa myi ha zhni Shekwoyi tnutnu hoi gwo gyiwye tnutnu zhni m.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To saaɓo m</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Ntucenu mi gna fye, fye to wnubwugba tu n əfye awyewyeyi ɓo m, ənya n fye ɓa gyi kwo n fye ɓa sni m; kwo ntu n fye anayi ɓo, ənya n fye ɓa kpe m. Wyewyeyi to du nyagyi lo, jesnu anayi to du aje lo m? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Fye shi alú afugyeyi awye; ɓa ta bye, kwo ɓa dò m, kwo ɓa yefyi n adobwi m, dudulonu əfye Dada əshemi nya kpá ɓa. Fye to du ɓa lo n apma m? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Nyika nu dnalo n fye n wo ɓa ɓe əwohni wyewyeyi snukna gbmanyi ntu n bwugba wnu ɓo a?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Njesnu knyiyi nu zhni bwugba kwoi wnu fye ntu n ajekpe ɓo a? Fye gye shi amamawyí bmana nya mwa; ɓa ta zhni tnutnu kwo ɓa she lulu m. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Dudulonu əmi nu gna fye, kwo Sulemanu dna n əwohni bmyabmya vnyanya, wo to ɓə kpe aje ngye mamawyi ho gbmanyi n ɓa m. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Ngye Shekwoyi kpe agbegbe bmana nya aje ń lai nu, n ɓa nyi n naiye, əfye kwa gyi a sheɓaya fyi n əná nyi, wo taa gna əfye nu ajekpekpe m, əfye agaiciyaganunui agbagbaida? <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Ntucenu fye to lofyi ń bwugbawnu m, fyei gna, ‘Yi ɓa gyi knyiyi nu a?’ kwo ‘Yi ɓa sni knyiyi nu a?’ kwo ‘Yi ɓa kpe knyiyi nu a?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Ntuge ashnagbayi zna anya ye nu shni vnyanya, ama əfye Dada dna n əshemi kpəlo nge fye n əɓa apmai lo. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ama əɓo kpmisnui, fye zna əwo əbemi nu shni n əwo ɓəfyecezhnii, jesnu anya ye vnyanya a ɓə kwu ɓa ga fye ɓədo cè. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Ntucenu fye to saaɓo ntu nsu ɓo m, ntuge nsu ɓə saaɓo ntu n əkwohni ɓo. Nyipyei dəhodəhoi ǹ əkwo aɓoi lo ń kwnukwnuí.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Owada tu n azaje tukwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Fye to da aza owa m, ntolonu m əfyehni ce, a ɓa da fye owa. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Ntuge shi fya da aza owa n wú, a ɓə da əfyehni nlonu, jesnu nyamwinya n fya zhni apma ncei, əkwo nu n a ɓə mwu ga fye ncei.<verse eid="MAT 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />“Knyiyi nu zhni hoi gye shnuwna pisəloi n kwo dna ń əhozado əwye ama to hoi zewye ń shnuwna kwnunù n kwo dna ń əhohni əwye ma a? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Ho ɓa gna əhozado n wunanu, ‘Fa mi ma gbmi ho pisəloi ya n əho əwye,’ honyi n shnuwna kwnunùi ɓwadna lo n əhohni əwye a? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Əho kwocednayi, kpmisnuyi la shnuwna kwnunù gbmiya n əhohni əwye kpa, nlonu n ho ɓa gyewyeba dəidəi ha gbmi pisəloi ya n əhozado əwye.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“To ga amwi ənya gyigyiyi m; to she əho anya amanai ya zhi abwulutu m. Ń ha zhni lonu, ɓa ɓá dna ɓa ya n apitai, jesnu ɓa pmyi ɓa sa ho ya wyiwowyiwo.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyaɓo, Znashni, Jeaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />“Fye nyaɓo, a ɓa ga fye; fye znashni, fye ɓa ɓwa; fye jeaba, jesnu a ɓa gwu kpakwo ya ga fye. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Ntuge zahozahoyi ń wo nyaɓo, wo gwo; əza ń wo znashni, wo ɓwa; jesnu əza ń wo jeaba, a ɓa gwu aba ya ga wo.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />“Nyika nu lo n fye, n əwo nugwnu ɓa nya wo biledi ɓo, wa ga wo kwuta a? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Kwo n wa nya wo əbmya ɓo, n wo ɓa ga wo owa a? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Nlonu, ngye əfye, kwo shikwonyi, fye zhni aɓənukwoizhniyi nu, fye kpəlo shi fye ɓa ga əfye aɓyi anya amanai, fye kwu gna kpekpe nge, əfye Dada n wo dna n əshemi nyi, wo ɓa gna aza yi anya amanai gaga nu n ɓa nya wo əɓo nyi!” <verse eid="MAT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Ntulonu dna ń ɓəhoɓəhoi, zhni ga aza, aɓo n ho ye ɓa zhni ga ho, ntuge əkwo nu zhni ɓəwu vnyanya owa nya n sheaɓəgwognayi aɓədai.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abwokwnumi wogyeí n palalayii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Fye lofyi ń aduba pmapmai. Ntuge aduba patai, n zokwo palalayii ɓa lo aɓwi aba nu; jesnu aza bəgyé lofyi n əkwo nu. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Ama abwokwnumi nawyii n zokwo wogyeí əɓa nu lo wyewyeyi, jesnu aza fyewyi nu ɓwasnu n ɓa ɓwa əkwo.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sheaɓəgwognayi hnihnii n akatayii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Fye zhni pəceye ń sheaɓəgwognayi katái nyai. Ɓa ɓe da fye ǹ aknyi ajei nu kpe, ama fyi ń əɓa mi ɓa zhni acamcam anapyei nu. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Fye ɓa kpe ɓa aye n əɓa gyigyiga nu. Aza zhni ɓa ka anam gyigyi n knawui shnuwna kwo əgbà n lagbaii? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />N ɓwasnu lonu, shnuwna manai dəhodəhoi ga gyigyi manai, ama shnuwna nukwoi ga gyigyi nukwoi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Shnuwna manai taa ga gyigyi nukwoi m, jesnu shnuwna nukwoi taa ga gyigyi manai m. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Shnuwna dəhodəhoi n kwo to ga gyigyi manai m, a znu kwo yashi jesnu aa kwo sheya dna n əná. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Ntuge, fye ɓa kpe ɓa aye n əɓa gyigyiga nu.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amwutuyi hnihnii n akatayii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Əzahozahoyi nu to n wo yi mi, ‘Dagayi, Dagayi,’ n wo ɓə lodna n əshebemi m, ama əza nu ɓwasnu n wo zhni əmi Dada ɓəye n wo dna n əshemi nyi. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Bəgyé ɓə gna mi n əwyi yi, ‘Dagayi, Dagayi, yi to ɓə kwu sheɓəgwognada dna n əho əye jesnu dna n əho əye ya kwnu ase nukwoi ya, dna n əho əye ya zhni aɓəwowoi n bəgyei m?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Nlonu nu ń mi ɓə gna ɓa pəipəi, ‘Mi ta kpe fye əye lo m, kpeekpe. Fye la kwu mi kala, əfye aɓənukwoizhniyi!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyakwnu miyi aceceyi n amamai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />“Ntucenu zahozahoyi ń wo wo əmi aɓədagbma ye jesnu waa zhni apma n ɓai, wo wu ngye əza ceceyi nu n wo mi əwo nyakwnu tu n apmá. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Əgbma kwa zhi, adna ɓa kwnu-akpma, jesnu ase ɓa ci kpe n nyakwnu yi; dudulonu to kwa myiya m, ntuge əkwo shnipa ɓə shi tu ń apmá nu. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Ama zahozahoyi n wo wo əmi aɓədagbma ye, to woi shi ɓa ɓwa m, wo wu lo ngye mama nu n wo ɓə mi əwo nyakwnu tu n amwi. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Əgbma kwa zhi, adna ɓa kwnu-akpma, jesnu ase ɓa ci, ɓai ci kpe n nyakwnu yi, kwaa vyiya vnyanya.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />She Yeisu ɓəə la pwo aɓəda ye da ɓo, ca wo deeji ntu n əwo nyawu ɓo, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />ntuge wo ɓə wunya ngye əza nu n wo ɓə n ikwoi toge ngye əɓa owa anyawuyi m.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ká nayiwnuyi gna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />She Yeisu ɓə shniɓe n əpe ɓe əknyi, deeji yaakwo kwa vyi wo. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Əzaho n nayiwnu nyasnai wa ɓe wa ceakwokwo shi ń əwo abye wa gna, “Dagayi, ngye əho ɓəye nu, ho ɓa myi ha ga mi kágna.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yeisu wa ta əwo əɓwa ya wa to wo əɓwa. Wa gna, “Əmi ɓəye nu, gwo kágna!” Nsayisayii wa ɓwa kágna n əwo nayiwnu nyasna. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna wo, “To gna zahozahoyi ɓəye m. Ama, lo ho wu əhohni tukwo n pirisiti aba, jesnu ha ga nyaga n Mwusa owa ɓə tugbe nyi, ngye ɓəgbmi ga ɓa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bəzhetagyida gaiciyaganunui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />She Yeisu ɓə lo Kapanam, Roma bəzhetagyida ho wa ɓe da wo, woi nya wo bmazhni ɓo. <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />Wa gna, “Dagayi, əmi tnutnuyi shilo n apyi n nayii fyífyii, woi gyeazhnì n mwa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yeisu wa gna wo, “Mi ɓe ma ka wo gna nuu?”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Roma bəzhetagyida wa dnaɓəgbe, “Dagayi, mi to kwnuce lo ha ɓe əmi pwuwa m. Ama da ɓədagbma, əmi tnutnuyi ɓa ɓwa kágna. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Ntuge əmi n mihni mi zhni ikwoda nu, n akwnuyii fyi n əmi akwnu. Mi gna əza ye, ‘Lo,’ wa lo; əza yi, ‘Ɓe,’ wa ɓe. Mi gna əmi tnutnuyi, ‘Zhni ɓəye,’ wa zhni kwo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />She Yeisu ɓə wo əɓo ye, ca wo wo, wa gna aza n ɓa vyi wo nyi, “Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, mi too ɓwa əzaho dna ń Israila n gaiciyaganunui yaakwo ye pyai m. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Mi gna fye nge bəgyé ɓə kwnuɓe ń kpəkwó n shnikwó, jesnu ɓai ɓe ɓa kwu sase kpe ń agbmada nyagyigyi awyefna aba n kwnusnu n Ibrahim, Ishakwu n Yakwuɓwui ń əshebemi. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Ama a ɓə la aza n ɓa zhni əbemi nya kwnuya zhi n əbmyi fyi n wyegbma, aba n a ciɓwi ai gyi anyikna.”<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna Roma bəzhetagyida, “Lo! Fa kwa zhni n ɓwasnu shi ho la gaiciyaga nge kwo ɓa zhni nyi.” Njesnu əwo tnutnuyi waa kágna ɓwa nsayii.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga aza bəgyé kágna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />She Yeisu ɓə lodna n Byitusu pwuwa, wa gye Byitusu yezhi nyikwozada n yatu n gədo n nayi-nagwnui. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Wa to wo əɓwa jesnu nayi-nagwnu kwa fa wo, wa laka gnyiagnyi, wa ya wo ɓəvyi.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />She wyeshe ɓə she, a ɓe wo n bəgyéi n ɓa ɓə n asei fyi, wa kwnu azafnu nukwoi ya n ɓədagbmai, wa ká anyasnayi gna vnyanya. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Dəye ɓə ye kwa nu əɓo nu ń a ɓəə kwu da dna n sheɓəgwognayi Ishaya əgbe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">“Wo ɓə la əyi akalágba kwu shi jesnu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">wa gwo əyi anyasna kpe əwohni.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu vyivyi əkwo nákwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />She Yeisu ɓə gye deeji n shegwnu wo zhi, wa ga əgbe nge ɓa piyalo nuwna-znudna əkpma dəyi. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Nlonu owa nyawuyi ho wa ɓe da wo wa gna, “Nyawuyi, mi ɓa vyi ho abahobahoi n ha lo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Acamcam n aɓwoi lo jesnu alú n amai kpəlo, ama Əza Nugwnu too n abai lo n wo ɓa ya əwo tukwo shi m.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Mwutuyi dəho wa gna wo, “Dagayi, fa, ma lo mii la əmi dada byi kpa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Ama Yeisu wa gna wo, “Vyi mi, fa azafyí ɓa byi əɓa aza afyífyiyi.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu la agbmaase nazhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Nlonu wa lodna n əya nuwnanya jesnu əwo amwutuyi ɓa vyi wo. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Ntna əsagyii agbmaase nukwoi ɓa ɓe kpe n nuwna-znudna, ntulonu nuwna-adokwo ɓa shefyi n əya nuwnanya. Ama Yeisu ɓə dna woi wnagye. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Amwutuyi ɓa lo ɓa kwnu wo agyewyiya, ɓai gna, “Dagayi, gnyi yi! Yi ye ya ɓwunuwna nu!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əfye agaiciyaganunui agbagbaida, knyiyi nu zhni fyei wodna nsnu nlai a?” Nlonu wa laka gnyi wa gnaknyi ase n nuwna-adokwoi, ɓaa nazhi vnyanya.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Ca wo aza jesnu ɓa nyaɓo, “Nyika pya nu gnyi n əza yei a? Kwo ase n nuwna-adokwoi ɓai vyi əwo ɓəgbetu!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu la ase nukwoi kwnuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />She wo ɓə si Gadara əkpma dəyi, aza ngwnu-aba n nunui n ase nukwoi ɓai kwnu n avnyigwo ɓa shegwnu wo. Ɓa ɓəə zhni aɓəgala zhniyi nu to aza ɓai myi n zokwo yi wna m. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Ɓa fyiakwu, “Shekwoyi Nugwnu, ho ye knyiyi nu n əyi a? Ha ɓe n ya ha kpe yi azhnì nu, to əkwo əsa kwoi si m?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />N tagnyi fyewyi, abwulutu gəluce yaakwo ɓə fyi ɓai gyi anyagyi. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Ase nukwoi ɓa ɓa Yeisu, “N ho ɓa kwnu yi ya, tnu n yii fyi n abwulutu gəluce.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Wa gna ɓa, “Fye lo!” Nlonu ɓa kwnuya ɓa lo ɓa lofyi n abwulutu, gəluce yi vnyanya ɓa bwusi shnilo n agəgyigəgyii ɓaa kaya fyi n nuwna-znudna ɓa kwu fyí fyi n nuwna. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Abwulutu knayi ɓa bwusi, ɓa lofyi n əzhimi ɓa wu aɓo ye anabagyi vnyanya, ɓədo she a ɓə kwnu aza yi ase nukwoi ya. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Nlonu əzhi vnyanya kwa kwnu lo kwa shegwnu Yeisu. Njesnu she ɓa ɓə gye wo əwye, ɓa ɓa wo nge wo la əɓa əknyi fa.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Nayifyifyiida gwo kágna n Yeisu aba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yeisu wa lodna n əya nuwnanya, wa piyatu wa ɓe əwo əzhi. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Azaho ɓa ɓe wo n nayifyifyiyidai, n yatu n pəce. She Yeisu ɓə gye əɓa gaiciyaganunui, wa gna əza yi, “La bwugba dnakalá, əmi nugwnu; a kwu əho aleifyi zo ho.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />N ɓəda yei, azaho n owa anyawuyi ɓa gna əɓahni, “Əza ye gnyi woi zhni atukwopmi əɓo nu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yeisu woi kpe əɓa ɓənubwozhni əye, wa gna, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei gwo aɓonubwozhni nukwoi fyi n əfye adu a? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Knyidei nu gna wo lo faafaa: a gna, ‘A kwu əho aleifyi zo ho,’ kwo a gna, ‘Laka gnyi ha znazna a’? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Ama mi ncei pmalo fya kwu kpe nge Əza Nugwnu n ikwoi lo dna ń anyì wa zo aleifyi.” Ntulonu wa gna əza ń nayi ɓə n woi fyifyiyi nyi, “Laka gnyi, kwu əho pəce ha lo əho pwuwa.” <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Nlonu əza yi, wa laka, wa lo apyi. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Shi deeji ɓə gye dəye, ɓa kwu nu zhi n ɓəwowoi; jesnu ɓa ci Shekwoyi, n wo ɓəə la ikwo yi pya ga zanyikwoci nyi.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matiyu yiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Shi Yeisu ɓə laka n ɓo, wa gye əza ai yi wo ge Matiyu n sasetu ń agədu gwoyi lubwi, wa gna wo, “Vyi mi.” Matiyu wa laka wa vyi wo.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Əsa ń Yeisu ɓə tu woi gyi wyeshenyagyi dna n Matiyu pwuwa, agədu gwoyi bəgyé n aleifyidai ɓa ɓe ɓa gyi nyagyi n kwnusnu n woi ɓədo n əwo amwutuyii. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />She Afarisiyi ɓə gye dəye, ɓa nya əwo amwutuyi əɓo, “Knyiyi nu zhni əfye nyawuyi woi gyi nyagyi n agədu gwoyii n aleifyidai a?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Shi Yeisu ɓə wo ɓəye wa gna, “Lafyiyada ta zna shigbeda shni m, akpəge nyasnayi. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Ama fye lo fye zna ɓəye awyega shni: ‘Mi ye snusnugye nu, toge nyagbmi m.’ Ntuge mi to ɓe ma yi aɓəfyeceyi nu m, ama aleifyida.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓənya ntu əgbewna ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Nlonu Yohana amwutuyi ɓa ɓe ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Kwo zè n wunanu əyi n Afarisiyii yii wnagbe ciici, ama əho amwutuyi to ɓai wnagbe m ma?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Kwo ɓa yezhni n wunanu mwulaɓa azhiɓeyi ɓa wnubwugba woi ye kwnusnu n əɓai a? Əsa ɓəlo n a ɓə la mwulaɓa la ń əɓa aba; nsayii nu n ɓa ɓə wnagbe.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“Əzaho to lo n wo gwu əje-kwokwoi əta ǹ əje-woiwoyi m, ntuge əjetagwugwui ɓə kpeya n əje-kwokwoi, kwoi zhni əkwo sasaya kwoi la gna wu. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Aza ta ze anamnuwna woiwoi fyi n anamnuwna əpa-pwakwnu kwokwoi m. N ɓa zhni lonu, əpa-pwakwnu yi ɓə cepwo, anamnuwna kwa zeya; jesnu anamnuwna apa-pwakwnu ɓə la wnuya. Aawo, a fyi anamnuwna woiwoyi ń anamnuwna əpa-pwakwnu woiwoyi nù jesnu əɓa vnyanya ɓa ɓə kwu mwasa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu lá ɓyinyikwoyi kala ń əfyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />She wo ɓə gnyi woi da ɓəye, Ayahudiyibwokwnu tukwoda wa ɓe wa ceakwokwo shì n əwo abye, wa gna, “Əmi nyigwnu ye ɓwa fyi nu. Ama ɓe ha lo ho to wo əɓwa, wo ɓa ɓwa wyewyeyi.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yeisu wa laka wa kwnulo n woi, jesnu əwo amwutuyi ɓa vyi wo.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Nlonu nyikwoza ho n wo ɓə gnyi n amizheya nyasnai woi kwu aye ɓwa ngwnu-awoceaba, wa gnyi n əwo avnu wa to əwo əjegbe əɓwa. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Wa gna əwohni, “Ngye n mi ɓa shni əwo əjegbe ɓwa toto, mi ɓa ɓwa kágna.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yeisu wa pmyi, wa gye wo. Wa gna, “la bwugba dnakalá əmi nyigwnu, əho gaiciyaganunui kwo la ho kágna.” Njesnu nyikwoza yi waa kágna ɓwa n əsayii.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Shi Yeisu ɓə lodna n Ayahudiyibwokwnu tukwoda pwuwa, wa gye deeji awyiɓei jesnu azai zhi ɓai bye amwayi, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />wa gna, “Fye la kwnuya. Ɓyinyikwoi ye to fyí m, ama wo wnagye nu.” Ama ɓa ma wo asna. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Shi a ɓə la deeji kwnuya zhi əbmyi, wa lodna wa taɓwashi ɓyinyikwoyi ń əɓwa, ɓyinyikwoyi wa laka gnyiagnyi. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Nabagyi ye kwaa gnamyi fyi laɓa n səpayi vnyanya.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga awyebwayi n takpeɓədayi kágna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Shi Yeisu ɓə laka n ɓo, awyebwayi ngwnu-aba ɓa vyi wo, ɓai gyiwye, “Gye yi snusnu, Dawuda Nugwnu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />She wo ɓə la lodna ń pwuwa mi, awyebwayi ɓa ɓe da wo, jesnu wa nya ɓa ɓo, “Fye kwu gaiciyaga nge mi ɓa myi ma zhni ɓəye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Əə, Dagayi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Nlonu wa to əɓa awye əɓwa jesnu wa gna, “Kwo la zè n əfye aba shi əfye gaiciyaganunui lo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Jesnu ɓa je wyebagye. Yeisu wa kwnù ɓa n əwyei bmyibmyii, “Fye to ye zahozahoyi wa kpe ɓəye ye m.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Ama ɓa kwnuya ɓa lo ɓai gná əwo nabagyi myi laɓa n səpayi vnyanya.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Ɓa ye zhi ɓai kwnuya lo, a ɓe Yeisu n əzai n wo ɓə n ase nukwoii fyi, to woi myi n ɓəda m. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />She a ɓə la əse nukwoi gbmiya, əza n wo to ɓə zhni woi daɓo nyi m, wa daɓo. Ca wo deeji, ɓa gna, “A too shni ɓəye pya gye n Israila m.”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Ama Afarisiyi ɓa gna, “Wo kwnu ase nukwoi ye ya n ase nukwoi tukwodai nu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atnutnuyi to mwabəgyé lo m.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yeisu wa zna laɓa n azhimi n azhigbai vnyanya, woi wunya n əɓa Ayahudiyibwokwnu, woi zhni waazi nabagyi manai əbemi nya, jesnu woi ká anyasnayi dəhodəhoi gna n agwnumai. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />She wo ɓə gye deeji, wa wna ɓa snusnu, ntuge a ɓə la əɓa awye zègbmiaje ntna bmazhniyi, ngye aknyi ntna knayi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Nlonu wa gna əwo amwutuyi, “Nyagyiyezhi n mwakwokwo lo, ama atnutnuyi n ɓwasnu lo fyewyi nu. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Nya Dagayi nyagyiyezhi nya əɓo, wa tnu n atnutnuyii fyi ń əwo ofwa nyagyiyezhi nya.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu tnu Awoceaba tnutnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yeisu wa yì əwo amwutuyi ngwnu-awoceaba zhi əwohni, jesnu wa ga ɓa ikwo ɓa lo ɓəə kwnu azafnu ajegbmii ya, jesnu ɓa ga agwnùyi n anyasna dəhodəhoi pyai kágna.<verse eid="MAT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Atnutnuyi awoceaba aye nu nyi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 10:2" />
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:2">Kpmisnuyi, Sima (əza n a yi ge Byitusu nyi) n əwodoi Anduru;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:2">Jemyis Zebədi nugwnu, n əwodoi Yohana;<verse eid="MAT 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Fyilibwus n Batolomyii;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:3">Toma n Matiyui gədu gwoyi;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 10:3">Jemyis Alfyis nugwnu, n Tadiyosii;<verse eid="MAT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Sima Ziloti n Yahuda Iskariyotii, n wo ɓə kwnu Yeisu Kirisiti nyi.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Ngwnu-awoceaba ye, Yeisu wa tnu n ɓai n aɓəgbega yei: “Fye to lofyi ń Abyedo aba kwo fya lo ń Asamariyayi əzhimi dəhodəhoi m. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ama fye ɓwa Israila aknyi aɓwuɓwuyi aba nu lo. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Shi fye lo, fye da ɓəda ye: ‘Əshebemi kwo la ɓe vyivyiwyi.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Fye ga anyasnayi kágna, fye kwu azafyí kala, fye ga anayiwnuyi kágna, fya kwnu ase nukwoi ya. Fya gwo ń adaada nu; fye ga ń adaada.<verse eid="MAT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />“Fye to la zinali kwo azulufa kwo gyiwye ho pya dna ń əfye ashnipa nya m, <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />fye to la lagyiita əzna nya m, kwo əjekpe baayi kwo abwada kwo bwusi, ntuge tnutnuyi kwnuce lo a shi wo əɓwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Əzhimi dəhodəhoi kwo əzhigba ń fya lofyi, fye zna əza shni ń wo kwnuce lo fya fyi ń əwo pwuwa nya əsa ń fye ɓə fa abaayi. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Shi fye lofyi ń pwuwa, fya ga kwo əfye gnaɓyi. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Ngye pwuwa yi kwnuce lo, fya fa əfye anabəlika bwugbafu nya kwa shnikpe ń kwo; ń kwo to kwnuce lo m, fya fa əfye anabəlika bwugbafu nya kwa jezeɓe da fye. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Ń əzaho to gwo fye m, kwo wa wo ɓədagbma ye m, fya fa pwuwa yi kwo əzhi yi, fya lu aɓwutukwnu ya ń əfye apita fya kwnu n ɓo. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, kwo ɓə la Sodom n Gwomworai gna wo faafa dna ń owada əwyii a fa əzhi yi.<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Mi tnu n fyei ngye aknyi nu fyi ń acamcam atasni. Ntucenu fye la ce ngye awa, ntnaɓətu ngye alukpe. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Fye kwu zhigwu, a ɓə kwu fye ga fyi ń azhi atukwoda akwnu, jesnu a ɓə la fye ɓyeya fyi n Ayahudiyibwokwnu. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Ntu əmi ɓo a ɓə kwu fye lo ncei n agwomna abye ɓədo n asui ngye aɓəkwnuyi ga əɓa jesnu ń Abyedoi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ama she a wna fye, ce to wo fye m, ntu ənya ɓo ń fye ɓa da m, kwo shi fye ɓa da kwo m. N əsayii, a ɓə gna fye əɓo ń fye ɓa da, <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />ntuge əfye nu to ɓə daɓo m, ama Zafnu əfye Dada nya nu ɓə daɓo ń əfye agbe.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Əza ɓə ɓwu əwodo nya əfyi, jesnu əda ɓə ɓwu əwo nugwnu; aɓyi ɓə zhni tukwognanakwo kpe əɓa azamayi ɓai zhni ai kwu ɓa wu. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Aza vnyanya ɓə wnunu n fyei ntu əmi ɓo, ama əza ń wa myignyi nya azoba, wo ɓə la pwo. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />She a zhni fye awyesnugbegye ɓo ń aba gbmanyi, fya bwusi lo abado. Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, fye to ɓə zo azhi lo vnyanya ń Israila m; Əza Nugwnu woi ɓe.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Mwutuyi to du əwo nyawuyi lo m, kwo fyenu n du əwo Dagayi m. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Kwo kwnuce lo amwutuyi ɓa kwu wu ngye əɓa anyawuyi, jesnu atnutnuyi ɓa wu ngye əɓa adagayi. Ń a la pwuwa tukwoda ye yì nge Byelzebwulu, a ɓa yi apwuwada aje nge na a!<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Ntulonu fye to wo ɓa ədna m, ntuge nyaho to lo ń kwo pwuanya n a taa kpe kwo anya ya m, kwo ń ɓwudna ń a taa kpekwoya wu pəipəi m. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Ənya ń mi gna fye dna ń wyegbma, fye da kwo n nyipyei pəipəi; ənya ń a da kwo snaanyá dna ń əho tnubwa, da kwo tu ń anyakwnusni. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Fye to wo aza yi ədna n ɓa wu nayi, ama n ɓa taa myi n ɓa wu wyewyeyi m. Ama, fye wo əza ədna ń wo ɓa wu wyewyeyi ń nayii jesnu wa sheɓaya fyi ń anápyi. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />A ta kwnú agbakwolowyi ngwnu-aba kəɓwo gbmanyi nu m? Dudulonu dəho to lo n kwo kaya shi ń əknyi ntna əfye Dada akpe m. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Jesnu kwo əfye atukwoyi vnyanya a ncei babai lo. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Nlonu fye to wodna m; fye du agbakwolowyi bəgyé lo n apmaɓwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Əza n wa ye əmi əyekpé ɓo gnyi ń aza abye, mi ɓə ye əwo yekpé ɓo gnyi n əmi Dada abye ń əshemi. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Ama əza n wa na əmi əɓo gnyi ń aza abye, mi ɓə na əwohni ɓo gnyi n əmi Dada abye ń əshemi.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Fye to gye nge ma ɓe n bwugbafui nu ń anyì m. Mi to ɓe ń bwugbafui nu m, ama ma ɓe n əbeyaakwoi nu. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Ntuge mi la ɓe ma pmyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">“ ‘əza tu ń əwo dada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">nyigwnu tu ń əwo əya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">tnáyi tu ń əwo əvya,<verse eid="MAT 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />əza anuwnuyi ɓa kwnu ń əwo pwuwa nu.’<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Əza ń wo ye əwo dada kwo əwo əya n du əmi, wo to kwnuce lo waa zhni əmi nya m; əza ń wo ye əwo nugwnu kwo nyigwnu ń du əmi, wo to kwnuce lo waa zhni əmi nya m. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Əza ń wo to lá əwohni znudu shi, waa vyi mi m, wo to kwnuce lo waa zhni əmi nya m. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Əza ń wa ye wa gnyi əwo wyewyeyi, wo ɓə ɓwu kwo nuwna, jesnu əza ń wa ɓwu əwo wyewyeyi nuwna ntu ń əmi ɓo, wo ɓə ɓwa kwo.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“Əza ń wa gwo əfye, wo la mi gwo, jesnu əza n wa gwo əmi, wo la əza gwo, ń wo ɓə tnú n mii nyi. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Əza ń wa gwo sheɓəgwognayi ngye sheɓəgwognayi, wo ɓə gwo sheɓəgwognayi gyiba, jesnu əza n wa gwo ɓəfyeceyi ngye ɓəfyeceyi, wo ɓə gwo ɓəfyece gyiba. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Njesnu, əza ń wa ga əza gnagbayi ń ɓa zhni əmi amwutuyi nyi nuwnafui, ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, əza yi to ɓə ɓwu əwo gyiba nuwna m.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu n Yohana batizimazhniyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Shi Yeisu ɓə la pwo əwo amwutuyi awoceaba nyawu ɓo, wa laka n abaayi ntuge wa lo wo zhni waazi ń Gəlili azhimi.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />She Yohana, ń wo ɓə dna ń zhalu nyi, ɓə wo aɓo n Masifu zhni lo, wa tnu n əwo amwutuyii, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />ɓə nya wo əɓo, “Əho nu zhni əza n wo ɓəlo nyi, kwo yi tuwye n əzado nu gbowo a?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye jezelo fye gna Yohana aɓo ń fye kwu wo jesnu fyei gyewye: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Awyebwayi gwo wyebagye, azabmazhi ɓai znazna, anayiwnu anyasnayi ɓai ɓwa kágna, atnubwagwunayi ɓai wo atnubwaɓə, ai kwu azafyí kala, jesnu ai da nabagyi manai ga asnayi. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Anabəlikada nu n zahozahoyii ń wo to cebwonyi ntu əmi ɓo m.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Shi Yohana amwutuyi ɓə zhi ɓai kwuka, Yeisu wa ya ɓəda n deejii ntu Yohana ɓo: “Fye ɓə lo zhabwikawu fye gye knyiyi nu a? Anuwnaje nu ń əse pmyi ɓa laɓa nyi? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Ngye nlonu to m, fye ɓə kwnuya lo fyei gye knyiyi nu a? Əza nu n aje amanai kpe? Aawo, aza ń ɓa n aje amanai kpe nyi, ɓa fyilo ń asu agalukwo nu. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ama knyiyi nu n fye ɓə kwnuya lo fyei gyewye a? Sheɓəgwognayi nuu? Əə, əmi nu gna fye, jesnu n du sheɓəgwognayi. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Əza nu nyi ń aa n ənyai kafyilo tu ń əwo tukwo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">“ ‘Mi ɓə tnú n əmi tnutnudayii, woi la gyilo ń əho abye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">əwo nu ɓə zhni əho zokwo aba hoi ɓe ɓo.’<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, fyi ń aza yi ń anyikwoza ɓə ma nyi, əzaho to lo ń wo la gbmignyi n du Yohana Batizimazhniyi m; dudulonu, əza n wo gnagbagbai lo dna n əshe əbemi, wo du wo lo. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Ənya n kwo laka ń Yohana Batizimazhniyi anyipyei kwoi ɓe nsaiye, əshebemi gnyi kwoi shnizhi ń akalái nu jesnu aza akaláda nu gnyì kwo shnizhi ncei. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Ntuge sheaɓəgwognayi vnyanya n owai ɓa ɓə kwu sheɓəgwogna da kwa nya Yohana əsa. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Ngye fye ncei pmalo fya gwo kwo, əwo nu zhni Iliya ń wo ɓə ye wa ɓe nyi. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Zahozahoyi ń wo n atnubwai lo, akpəge wo wo.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Mi ɓa mwi cala ye ədo n knyiyi nu a? Ɓa wulo ngye aɓyi nu ń ɓa sase kpe ń adubayaakwo ɓai yi aje:<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“ ‘Yi kwu mwayí bye ga fye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">to fya nyanya m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">ya kwo aka-anyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">to fya zhni bwugbazhii m.’<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Ntuge Yohana ɓə ɓe to woi gyi kwo woi sni m, ɓa gna, ‘Wo n asei lo.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Əza Nugwnu ɓə ɓe woi gyi woi sni, ɓa gna, ‘fnana nu gnyi n nyasniyi, agədu gwoyi nugwnudo n aleifyizhniyii.’ Ama a kpe wyemwa bmyabmya ye n əkwo atnutnu nu.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Owii kpe n azhi tna-abwuyei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Nlonu Yeisu wa ya woi lace azhi n wo ɓəə kwu əwo aɓo awowoyi zhni fyi n du nyi, ntuge ɓa to ɓə yeabwi m. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Owii n hoi, Korazin! Owii n hoi, Betsaida! Ntuge ngye aɓəwowoi n a ɓə zhni ɓa fyi n əfye nyi, a ɓə gna a zhni ɓa fyi ń Taya nu n Sidonii, əsa ye la mwalo shi ɓa ɓə ɓa yeabwi fyi n ajekwokwoi n ətnui. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Ama mi gna fye, n owada əwyii, kwo ɓə la Taya n Sidonii gna wo faafa a fa əfye. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Njesnu əho, Kapanam, a ɓə la ho latu n ashebmana nu? Aawo, ho ɓə shnilo Akwu nu. Ntuge aɓəwowoi ń a ɓə zhni ɓa fyi n əho nyi, a ɓə gna a zhni ɓa fyi n Sodom nu, kwo ɓəi ye lo nnaiye. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Ama mi gna fye nge n owada əwyii kwo ɓə la Sodom gna wo faafa a fa əfye.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A la Dada kpeyawu dna n Nugwnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Dna nsayi Yeisu wa gna, “Mi ci ho lo Dada, Dagayi əshemi nya n əknyii, ntuge ho kwu aɓo ye so aza aceceyi n aɓəyekpeyii, jesnu honyii la ɓa kpmiyawu aɓyi anawyi nu. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Əə, Dada, ntuge ənya nu nyi n kwa da ho ha zhni.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Əmi Dada wo kwu aɓo vnyanya fa fyi ń əmi akwnu. Əzaho to lo n wo kpe Əza ń Nugwnu n zhni m akpəge Dada, jesnu əzaho to lo n wo kpe əza ń Dada n zhni m, akpəge Nugwnu, jesnu ń aza yii n Nugwnu la ɓa knyí waa əwohni kpeyawu ɓa.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Fye ɓe əmi aba, əfye vnyanya ń a kwu fye ɓe jesnu n akaya ashnawoi kpe, mi ɓa ga fye snusnu. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Fye kwu əmi korogbma fyi əfyehni jesnu fya tumwi ń mi, ntuge mi zhni tukwownashiyi nu jesnu n tukwogbai n ədu, jesnu fye ɓa ɓwa snusnu ntu əfye awyewyeyi ɓo. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Ntuge əmi korogbma n wu lo faafa jesnu əmi akaya ntna shnawoi.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu zhni Dagayi Sibyiwyi nya nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />N əsayii Yeisu wa duya dnalo n alikamazhni n Sibyiwyii. Myikwnu kwoi kwu əwo amwutuyi gwnu, ɓa ya alikama tukwo bma ɓai gyi. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />She Afarisiyi ɓə gye nlonu, ɓa gna wo, “Shiawye! Əho amwutuyi zhni əɓo lo n kwo zhni owa gnanaznu nu n Sibyiwyii.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye too ba ənya n Dawuda n əwo anugwnudoi ɓə zhni əsa ń myikwnu ɓə gwnu ɓa nyi m? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Wo ɓə lodna ń Shekwoyi pwuwa, əwo n əwo anugwnudoi ɓa gyi biledi pmyapmyayi ń kwo zhni owa gnanaznu nu n əɓa aba nyi m; ntuge kwo ɓə ɓwasnu ntu apirisiti ɓo nu. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Kwo fye too ba dna ń Owa nge, apirisiti fyi ń əɓa tnutnuzhni n Sibyiwyii, dna ń Dagayipwuwa ɓa kwu Sibyiwyi tucegye, ama dudulonu, to a tu ɓa ɓo m? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Mi gna fye nge ənya ń kwo du Dagayipwuwa, kwo gnyilo ń ya. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Fye ɓəə gna fye kpe ɓədagbma ye gənyi lo, ‘Mi ye snusnugye nu toge nyagbmi m,’ fye to ɓəə ɓa znu tnaɓətuyi əknyi m. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Ntuge Əza Nugwnu nu zhni Dagayi Sibyiwyi nya.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />She wo ɓə laka ń abaayi, wa lodna ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu, <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />əzaho ɓə dna ń ɓo n əɓwai sháshái. Ɓai zna əɓo shni n ɓa ɓá tu Yeisu, ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Owa ncei ye lo nge a əza ye wo gwo kágna n Sibyiwyii?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Wa gna ɓa, “Ndəi n əzaho n əfye n əknyii lo, kwaa kaya dna n ɓwokwnu n Sibyiwyii, wo taa taɓwa shi kwo, wa gbmi kwo ya m? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Əza apma du əknyi nyalo shaasha! Ntucenu, owa ncei ye lo nge a zhni əɓo manai n Sibyiwyi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Nlonu wa gna əza yi, “Ta əho əɓwa ya.” Ntulonu wa ta kwo ya, kwaa zhishni vnyanya, kwaa kalá ɓwa ngye baayi. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Ama Afarisiyi ɓa kwnuya lo, ɓəə pyì she ɓa ɓá myi ɓá wu Yeisu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi tnutnuyi knyiknyiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Shi Yeisu ɓə kwu əɓəye kpeye, waa wyiya n abaayi. Deeji yaakwo kwa vyi wo, wa ga aza vnyanya kágna n ɓa ɓə n anyasnai. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Wa kwnù ɓa nge ɓa to gna azaje əwo əɓo m. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Dəye ɓə ye kwa nu ɓəda nu ń kwo ɓə gbmi n sheɓəgwognayi Ishaya əgbe nyi:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />“Əmi tnutnuyi nu gnyi nyi əza ń mi la knyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">əza n mi ye, ń a da mi agbma n woi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Mi ɓa kwu əmi Zafnu pwu wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">jesnu wo ɓa da abye owa gaiciya nya.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Wo to ɓə wuanya kwo wa ɓəwyi m;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">əzaho to ɓə wo əwo bəgye tu n dnadna m.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Wo taa bma nuwnaaje citui ya m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">jesnu wo taa wnu əná tna-kaláda m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">sai əsa n wo ɓə la ɓe n owada gaiciya nyai kwa gyi nasalagyi.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />N əwo əye nu n abye ɓə ɓwa awyetu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu n Belzebwuyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Nlonu ɓa ɓe wo n əzai n wo ɓə n asei fyi, n awye ɓə n woi bwabwai jesnu takpeɓəda; Yeisu wa ka wo gna, ntulonu wa myi woi daɓo jesnu woi gyewyeba. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Ca wo aza vnyanya ɓa gna, “Kwo a ɓa gna Dawuda Nugwnu nu gnyi nyii?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ama she Afarisiyi ɓə wo ce, ɓa gna, “N ɓwasnu n Byelzebwului nu, azafnu nukwoi tukwoda, ń wo kwnu azafnu nukwoi ya.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yeisu ɓə kpé əɓa ɓənubwozhni əye, wa gna ɓa, “Əbemi dəhodəhoi n kwo la əkwohni gnaje, kwo ɓa kwu zhniagbma, jesnu əzhiyaakwo kwo pwuwa dəhodəhoi ń kwo la əkwohni gnaje kwo taa myignyi m. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />N Shetam ɓa nya Shetam ya, wo la əwohni gnajeya nuu. Kwo ɓa kpezhni n wunanu əwo əbemi kwa gnyiagnyi a? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Ngye mi nyá ase ya n Byelzebwulu kalái nu, n nyikai nu n əfye aza kwnu ɓa ya ncei a? Ntulonu əɓa nu ɓə kwu zè əfye awadayi. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Ama ngye n Zafnu Shekwoyi nyai nu n mi kwnu ase ya ncei, a gye Shekwoyi əbemi kwo la ɓe əfye aba.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Njesnu kwo ɓa yezhni n wunanu əza wa lodna n kaláda pwuwa, wa kwu əwo akaya, akpəge, n kpmisnu, wo lá əza kaláda pashi nu kpa. Nlonu n wo ɓa myi wa kwu akaya n əwo pwuwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“Zahozahoyi n wo to kwnusnu lo n mii m, wo gnyiapaapa nu n mii, jesnu zahozahoyi n wo ta yezhi lo n kwnusnu n mii m, wo gná anya myi nu. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Ntucenu, mi gna fye ge, a ɓa zo əza aleifyi dəhodəhoi pya n əyewnuya tu n əzado, ama əza ń wa da atukwopmi ɓəda tu n Zafnu Gyigyiyi a taa zo əwo leifyi m. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Zahozahoyi ń wa da ɓəda nukwoi tu n Əza Nugwnu tukwo, a ɓa zo wo leifyi, ama zahozahoyi ń wa da ɓəda nukwoi tu n Zafnu Gyigyiyi tukwo a taa zo əwo leifyi m; kwo dna n anyì ye kwo dna n anyìdo n ɓa ɓe lo nyi.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“La shnuwna zè manai, əkwo gyigyii ɓaa zè manai, kwo la shnuwna zè nukwoi əkwo gyigyii ɓaa zè nukwoi; ntuge a kpe shnuwna dəhodəhoi əye ń əkwo gyigyii nu. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Əfye agbezhi aɓyi, kwo ɓa zè n wunanu əfye aɓənukwoizhniyi fya da əɓo ho manai a? Ntuge əgbe da ənya nu n kwo nu fyilo n ədu. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Əza manai kwnu anya amanai ɓe ncei ń anya manai nu ń wo ncei sofyi ń əwohni nyi, əza nukwoi kwnu anya anukwoi ɓe ncei ń anya nukwoi nu n wo ncei sofyi n əwohni nyi. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Ama mi gna fye nge zahozahoyi ɓə ga nyadokwu n owadawyii ntu n ɓədagbma gbəloi dəhodəhoi ɓo n wo kwu da. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Ntuge n əho aɓədagbmai nu n ho ɓə pwo, jesnu n əho aɓədagbmai nu n a ɓə znu ho əknyi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yunana əznù</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Nsayi Afarisiyi ho n owa anyawuyii ɓa gna wo, “Nyawuyi, yi ye ha wu yi əznù.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Cala akpí nya n anagbáizhni nyai nyá əznù ɓo lo! Ama a taa ga kwo dəho m, akpəge əznù sheɓəgwognayi Yunana nya. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Ngye shi Yunana ɓə dna anyipyei ngwnu-ata jesnu asukwo ngwnu-ata n əbmya yaakwo nubwo nyi, ntulonu n Əza Nugwnu ɓə ɓwa anyipyei ngwnu-ata jesnu asukwo ngwnu-ata dna n əknyi nubwo. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Aninivayi ɓə kwukazhi n owadawyii n cala yei, jesnu ɓai znu kwo knyi; ntuge ɓa ɓə kwu yeabwi ntu Yunana waazi ɓo, jesnu nsaiye ənya n kwo du Yunana kwo gnyilo n ya. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Əsu nyikwozada Snutakwo nya, ɓə laka gnyi n owadawyii n cala yei, woi znu kwo knyi; ntuge wo ɓə gbmi n anyiceshiba wa ɓe wa wo Sulemanu wyemwa; ama nsaiye ənya n kwo du Sulemanu gnyilo n ya.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“She zafnu nukwoi gbmiya n əza, kwo zna laɓa ń zhabwikawu nu, kwoi zna ashnita aba shní, ama n kwo to ɓwa m; <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />nlonu kwa gna, ‘Mi ɓa jezelo pwuwa ń mi ɓə gbmi nyi.’ She kwo ɓə si, kwa gye pwuwa to n əzai dna lo m, n fnyifnyiiya shi ń anyai wnakna. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Nlonu kwa lo kwa kwu azafnu anukwoi aje ɓe ncei ngwnu-tnaaba n ɓa du əkwohni lo n əkpí, ɓa lofyi ɓa kwu fyi n ɓo. Əza yi anyìgyi kwaa gna kpmisnui wnuya. Nlai nu n cala əkpizhniyi ɓə la wu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu əya n əwo amajei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yeisu woi ye gnyi woi daɓo n deejii, əwo əya n əwo amajei ɓa kwu zhi n əbmyi, ɓai pmi wo ɓa daɓo n woi. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Əzaho wa gna wo, “Əho əya n əho amajei zhi lo ń əbmyi, ɓa ncei pmalo ɓa daɓo n hoi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Wa dna wo ɓəgbe, “Nyika nu zhni əmi əya, jesnu anyika nu zhni əmi azaje a?”<verse eid="MAT 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Wa wu əwo amwutuyi əɓwa, wa gna, “Əmi əya n əmi azajei nu zhi nyi. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Ntuge zahozahoyi ń wo zhni əmi Dada ɓəmwi ń wo dna n əshemi nyi, əwo nu zhni əmido n əmi mapwii jesnu əmi əyai.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi nyabyeyi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Dna ń əwyi yi, Yeisu wa gbmiya ń apyi wa lo waa sase ma n nuwna-znudna əgbe. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Deeji yaakwo kwokwo kwa yezhi n shekna wo, kwa zhni wo wa lodna ń əya nuwnanya, waa sase dna ń kwo, n azai gnyiagnyi zhi n nuwna əgbe. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Nlonu wa gna ɓa aɓo bəgyé fyi ń aɓəsisi, woi gna, “Fwanuyi ɓə gbmiya lo wo bye əwo nyabye. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Shi wo ɓə lo woi she nyabye, adəho ɓa kaya zhi n zokwo, alú ɓa ɓe ɓa kwu ɓa gyi. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Adəho ɓa kaya kpe ń apmatala, aba ń ɓa to ɓə n amwii kpe n mwa m. Ɓa pa n pyeepye, ntuge amwii to ɓə loloi m. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Ama she nyipyei ɓə kpeɓe əkwo wowo kwa zhni ɓa kwu ɓwaa, ntuge ɓa to ɓə n agbegyei sasayii m. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Nyabye dəho kwa kaya fyi ń aknawui, aknawui ɓa mwa ɓaa kwo gyice. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Dudulonu, nyabye dəho kwa kaya fyi ń əknyi manai, aba ń kwo ɓə ga gyigyi n mwa; dəho tagyi, dəho shiitnanyi, dəho shiita. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Zahozahoyi ń wo n atnubwai lo, akpəge wo wo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Amwutuyi ɓa ɓe əwo aba ɓa nyaɓo, “Knyiyi nu zhni hoi daɓo ń azai n aɓəsisi nu a?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ntuge ɓəyekpe aɓo aɓwuɓwui əshebemi nya, a kwu ɓa ga fye, ama toge əɓa m. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Zahozahoyi ń wo ncei lo a ɓə ɓe wo, nabai wa kwu ɓwa ɓwoye. Zahozahoyi ń wo to ncei lo m, kwo ədo ń wo ncei lo nyi, a ɓə la kwo gwo wo. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Cenuzhni mii daɓo n ɓai n aɓəsisii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:13">“Kwo shikwonyi ɓa shiawye lo, ɓa ta gyewye lo m;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:13">kwo shikwonyi ɓa knatnubwa lo, ɓa ta wo lo m, jesnu ɓa ta ɓwa əkwo awyega lo m.<verse eid="MAT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Sheɓəgwogna Ishaya nya kwo kwu nu kpe ń ɓa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“ ‘Fye ɓa gwodu fyei wo, ama fye taa kpəgənyi m kpeekpe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">fye ɓa gwodu fyei shiawye, ama fye taa kpe ɓəho gənyi m kpeekpe!<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Ntuge aza ye ədu kwo la shni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">kwo dnaɓo lo ɓa wo n əɓa atnubwai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">jesnu ɓa kwu əɓa awye kpe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Ntolonu m ɓa ɓá gye n əɓa awyei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ɓa wo n əɓa atnubwai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ɓa kpəgənyi fyi n əɓa adu ɓa pmyiɓe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">jesnu ma ka ɓa gna.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Ama əfye awye ń zhni anabəlika nya nu, ntuge ɓa gye əɓo əwye lo, jesnu n əfye atnubwai ntuge ɓa wo əɓo lo. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Nlonu ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, sheaɓəgwognayi ń aɓəfyeceyi mwa bəgyé lo ń ɓa ɓə ncei pma ɓa gye anya ń fye gyewye nyi, ama to ɓa gye əkwo m, jesnu ɓa wo aɓo ń fye wo nyi ama to ɓa wo əkwo m.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />“Knatnubwa nsayi fya kpe nyabye ɓəsisi awyega: <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />She əza wo nabagyi ntu əshebemi ɓo, to wa ɓwa əkwo gənyikpe m, əzanukwoyi wa ɓe wa fna ənya n a kwu bye fyi n əwo ədu. Nyabye nyi n kwo kaya zhi n zokwo. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Nyabye n kwo ɓə kaya kpe n apmatala nyi, kwo wu ngye əza pya nu n wo wo ɓədagbma jesnu wa gwo kwo n əsagbmanyii n bwugbadai. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Ama shikwonyi wo to n agbegyei lo m, kwo ta mwasa m. She azhnìgye kwo awyesnugbegye ɓo ɓe ntu ɓədagbma ɓo, waa pye n myiyai. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Nyabye ń kwo ɓə kaya fyi ń aknawui nyi, əkwo nu zhni əza ń wo wo ɓədagbma, ama aɓəsa anyìgyi nya n akwocedna nyaɓwa nyai ɓa gyi ɓədagbma yi ce, kwa zhni kwo to kwa ga gyigyi m. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Ama nyabye n kwo kaya fyi n əknyi manai nyi, əkwo nu wu əza n wo wo ɓədagbma jesnu wa ɓwa kwo awyega. Əza nyi n wo ga gyigyi, adəho aɓwa tagyi, kwo shiitnanyi, kwo aɓwa shiita she a ɓə bye.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agbegbe nabagyi ɓəsisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yeisu wa je ɓa ɓəsisi ədo gna: “Əshebemi wulo ngye əza nu n wo ɓə bye nyabye manai n əwo ofwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Ama n sukwoi, zahozahoyi dna woi wnagye, əwo nuwnuyi wa ɓe wa bye agbegbe fyi n alikama ofwa yi wa lo wo nya. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />She alikama ɓə pa ɓa ya atukwofyi nlonu agbegbe ce ɓa kpmiyawu.<verse eid="MAT 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />“Ofwada atnutnuyi ɓa ɓe da wo ɓa gna, ‘Zadnagbmai, ho to ɓə bye nyabye manai nu n əho ofwa m? Agbegbe ɓa kwnu nsayi n nanu a?’<verse eid="MAT 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />“Wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Nuwnuyi ho nu na zhni ɓəye.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:28">“Atnutnuyi ɓa nya wo, ‘Ho ɓa ye nge yi lo yii shi ɓa ya?’<verse eid="MAT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />“Wa gna, ‘Aawo, ntuge əsa n fye ɓa shi agbegbe ya nyi, kpəsnu fya gye fyei shi alikama ya ɓədo. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Fye fa ɓa kwnú mwa n aba gbmanyi nya afwanyakwu sa. N əsayii nu, n mi ɓə gna afwanyakwuyi: Fye la agbegbe gbezhi fya pa ɓa na akwui, a gyi ɓa əná; fya ye alikama zhi fya kwu ɓa fyi n əmi dobwi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aɓəsisi musta byegye nya n yistii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Wa da ɓa ɓəsisi dəho: “Əshebemi wulo ngye musta byegye nu, ədo n əza ɓə la wa bye dna n əwo ofwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Kwo shikwonyi əkwo nu gnagbagbai n anyabye vnyanya, dudulonu shi kwo mwa, kwaa zè shnuwna duduyi n alú ɓe ɓa kpe ama n əkwo aɓwala.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Wa je ɓa ɓəsisi dəho gna: “Əshebemi wu ngye yisti nu n nyikwoza n wo zhni biledi ɓə la wa gbmiaje n biledi wyilukwui, əkwo shnawo ɓə lo ngye kyilo shiitnanyi, nya əsa n yisti yi ɓə la nyagbmi vnyanya.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yeisu wa gna deeji aɓo ye vnyanya n aɓəsisii; wo to ɓə da ɓəhoɓəhoi n ɓai ntna apmazhni n ɓəsisii m. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Ntulonu ɓəda n sheɓəgwognayi ɓə ncei da zhi kwa kwu nu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Mi ɓa gwú əmi əgbe ya dna n aɓəsisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">mi ɓa da aɓo aɓwuɓwui n ɓa ɓəə nyi tunyi n anyì zhni əsai.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agbegbe ɓəsisi awyega</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Nlonu wa laka n deeji aba wa lodna n pwuwa. Əwo amwutuyi ɓa ɓe da wo ɓa gna, “Wu yi awyega agbegbe ɓəsisi nya fyi n ofwa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əza n wo ɓə bye nyabye manai nyi, əwo nu zhni Əza Nugwnu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Ofwa nu zhni anyì, jesnu nyabye manai nu zhni aza əshebemi nya. Agbegbe nu zhni əzanukwoyi aza, <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />jesnu nuwnuyi n wo ɓə bye agbegbe nyi, əwo nu zhni shetam. Afwanyakwu sa nu zhni anyìzo sa, jesnu amaləka nu zhni afwanyakwuyi.<verse eid="MAT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />“Ngye shi a shi agbegbe ya a kpe ɓa əná nyi, nlonu n a ɓəi zhni n anyìzo əsai. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Əza Nugwnu ɓə tnú n əwo amaləkai, ɓai fa agbegbe ya n əwo əbemi, nyahonyahoi n kwo ɓə ɓe n leifyii n azai vnyanya n ɓa zhni ɓənukwoi nyi. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />A ɓə sheɓaya fyi ń əná-gwogwoi, aba n a ɓə ciɓwi ai gyi anyikna. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Nlonu, aɓəfyeceyi ɓə shenaya ngye nyipyei n əɓa Dada əbemi. Əza n wo n atnubwai lo, akpəge wo wo.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aɓəsisi nyaɓwayezhi sosoi nya n kwuta nakwoii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Əshebemi wulo ngye nyaɓwayezhi nu n kwo sodna n ofwa. She əza ɓə gye kwo əwye, wa kwu kwo je anya pwi, nlonu dna n əwo bwugbada wa lo wa kwnú anya vnyanya n wo ɓə ncei wa si ofwa yi.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Njesnu, əshebemi wulo ngye ɓwazeyi yaakwo nu, n wo zna kwuta nakwoi manai shni. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />She wo ɓə gye gbmanyi gyiba yaakwo nya, wa lo wa kwu nyahonyahoi kwnu n wo ɓə ncei wa si kwo.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Əssá ɓəsisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Njesnu, əshebemi wu ngye əssá nu, n a ɓə she kwo ya fyi n nuwna-znudna kwa wna abmya dəhodəhoi pya. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />She kwo ɓə la nu, abmyawnayi ɓa gnyì kwo ɓe ncei kpe n əkpma. Nlonu ɓa sase zhi ɓa tnu amanai fyi n cekwnu, ama ɓa kwu anukwoi sheya. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Nlonu n kwo ɓə ze ń anyìzo əsa. Amaləka ɓə ɓe ɓa tnu akpizhniyi ya ń aɓəfyeceyi <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />jesnu ɓai sheɓaya fyi ń əná-gwogwoi, aba n a ɓə ciɓwi ai gyi anyikna.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yeisu wa nyaɓo, “Fye kwu aɓo ye kpəgənyi vnyanya a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Əə.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Wa gna ɓa, “Ntucenu owa nyawuyi dəhodəhoi n wo la zè mwutuyi n əshebemi, wo wu ngye pwuwada nu, n wo kwnu anya yazhi n nyaɓwayezhii nyakwnu; awoiwoyi n akwokwoyii.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sheɓəgwognayi ntna mwamwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />She Yeisu ɓə kwu aɓəsisi ye zo da, wa laka ń ɓo. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Shi wo ɓə ɓe əwo əzhi, wa ya aza nyawu fyi n əɓa Ayahudiyibwokwnu, jesnu ca wo ɓa. Ɓa nyaɓo, “Əza ye wa ɓwa wyemwa n kalá aɓəwowoi nya yei ń nanu a? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Əza ye nu to zhni kafyinta nugwnu m? A ta yi əwo əya nu ge Mariyamwu m, jesnu əwo azaje nu to n Jemyisii, Yusufu, Sima n Yahudai m? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Əwo amapwi vnyanya to kwnusnu lo əyi m? Nsaiye, n nanu n əza ye wo ɓwa aɓo ye vnyanya a?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Əwo əɓo kwa sna ɓa. Ama Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Sheɓəgwognayi to lo ntna mwamwa m akpəge n əwo əzhi jesnu dna n əwo pwuwa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Ntucenu to wa zhni atuzè bəgyé ń ɓo m, ntu n əɓa tnagaiciyaganunui ɓo.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">A la Yohana batizimazhniyi kpe tukwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Dna nsayi, əsu Hiridusu wa wo Yeisu anabagyi, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />wa gna əwo atnutnuyi, “Yohana Batizimazhniyi nu gnyi, wo la laka nu ń əfyi! Cenuzhni ikwo aɓəwowoi nya ɓai zhni tnutnu n wo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Nsayii Hiridusu ɓəə la Yohana wna waa wo dna ń zhalu ntu n Hiriduya ɓo, əwodo Fyilibwus nyikwo, <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />ntuge Yohana ɓə zhni woi gna wo: “Kwo to dnalo ń owa əfye ha la wo m.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Hiridusu ɓə ncei pma wa wu Yohana, ama wo ɓə zhni woi wo aza ədna ntuge aza ɓə n Yohanai la ge wo zhni sheɓəgwognayi nu.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />N Hiridusu mama əye shegwnudo awyefna əwyii, Hiriduya nyigwnu wa nyanya ń azhiɓeyi abye kwa kwu Hiridusu dagbma n mwa, <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />kwa zhni wo waa ɓəgbeshi shi n nyasíi nge wo ɓə ga wo nyahonyahoii n wa nyaɓo.<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Əwo əya wa wu wo ənya n wo ɓa nyaɓo, wa gna, “Ga mi tu ń fnyitala Yohana Batizimazhniyi tukwo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Bwugba kwaa əsu wnuya, ama ntu n əwo nyasí ɓo ɓədo n əwo wyeshenyagyi azhiɓeyii, wa ga əgbe nge a la ənya ga Hiriduya nyigwnu n wa nyaɓo tu n kwo nyi, <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />nlonu a lo zhalu a kpe Yohana tukwo, a ɓe ncei. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />A loɓe n əwo tukwoi tu n fnyitala, aa kwo ga əɓyinyikwoi yi, wa la wa lo əwo əya ncei. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Yohana amwutuyi ɓa ɓe ɓa la əwo nayi ɓaa kwo byi. Nlonu ɓa lo ɓa gna Yeisu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga aza dugwu-atnu nyagyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />She Yeisu ɓə wo əɓo n kwo kwu zhni nyi, wa laka ń əya nuwnanyaí əwo gbmanyi wa lo aba ń kwo ɓə gnyi pyipyipyi. Shi adeeji ɓə wo lonu ɓa kwnu n azhimi n apitai ɓa vyi wo lo. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />She Yeisu ɓə gbmishi wa gye deeji yaakwo, wa gye ɓa snusnu wa ka anyasnayi gna.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Shi wyeshe ɓə ya she, amwutuyi ɓa ɓe da wo ɓa gna, “Zhabwi nu gnyi n ya, wyeshe la ya kwoi she, gna deeji ami, ɓa lo azhigba ɓəə si nyagyi ga əɓahni.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ɓa to gwo ɓa lo ɓwaho m. Fye ga ɓa nyaho ɓa gyi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Yi n biledii n ɓwashi lo n ya ngwnu-atnu nu n abmyai ngwnu-aba.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Wa gna, “Fye ɓe mi n ɓai ń ya.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Wa ga aza əgbe nge ɓa kwu sase zhi n agbegbe. Shi wo ɓə gwo biledi aknana ngwnu-atnu n abmyai ngwnu-aba yii, wa kpe awye wu n əshe, wa sa Shekwoyi ami, jesnu wa sa biledi aknana yii ya. Nlonu wa ga əwo amwutuyi, ɓa gnaya ga aza. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓa gyi jesnu nubwo kwa kwu ɓa fwu, amwutuyi ɓa kwu awyiwoi n ɓa ɓə ce nyí, ɓa kwu nu acekwnu ngwnu-awoceaba. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Aza bəgyé n ɓa ɓə gyi nyagyi yi nyi, ɓa ɓə nyi ngye azanugbai adugwu-atnu nu gbowo n anyikwozai n aɓyii.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu znazna tu n nuwna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Nsayisayii Yeisu wa zhni əwo amwutuyi ɓa lofyi ń əya nuwnanya, ɓa piya kpe n əkpma dəyi n gyilo n əwo abye, wo ɓəye cegnyi woi gna deeji ami. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Woi kwu ɓa gnami, wa gwnulo əpe, əwo gbmanyi, woo zhniaduwa; dna n sukwo yi waa tu n ɓo, əwo gbmanyi. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Njesnu əya nuwnanya kwoi la lu tagnyi n kpaai n əkpmai, anuwnadokwo ɓa ɓe ɓai sheknyi kwo, ntuge əse ɓə ci ɓe n awyei ce n əya nuwnanya nu.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />N fyegyi ɓwai Yeisu wa gbmi lo da ɓa woi znazna tu ń nuwna-znudna. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />She amwutuyi ɓə gye wo woi znazna tu ń nuwna-znudna, ədna kwa wo ɓa, ɓa fyiakwu. Ɓa gna, “Gye nyasnuɓwui nu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Ama Yeisu nsayisayii wa gna ɓa: “Fye kwu agwumyizhi! Əmi nu. Ədna to wo fye m.”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Byitusu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Dagayi ngye əho nu, gna mi ge mi ɓe da ho tu n nuwna.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Wa gna, “Ɓe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Nlonu Byitusu wa gbmi ń əya nunwanya, wa znazna tu ń nuwna woi lo da Yeisu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Ama shi wo ɓə gye əse, ədna kwa wo wo, jesnu shi wo ɓə ya woi shni, wa gbmi əɓwi ya, “Dagayi, gnyi mi!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Nsayisayii Yeisu wa ta əwo əɓwa ya, wa wna wo. Wa gna, “Əho gaiciyaganunui gbagbaida, knyiyi nu naa zhni hoi bmabwugba ya?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />She ɓa ɓə lofyi n əya nuwnanya, əse kwaa cepyi. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Nlonu aza yi n ɓa ɓə fyi n əya nuwnanya nyi, ɓa ga wo mwamwa, ɓa gna, “Ɓəhnihni ho zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu nu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />She ɓa ɓə la piya, ɓa kwnukpe n Genezareti əknyi. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />She aza ń ɓa ɓə fyi n əzhi yi nyi ɓə kwu kpe nge Yeisu nu, ɓa fyi atnutnu lo azhi ń ɓa shegwnu ɓa vnyanya nyi. Aza ɓa ɓe wo n əɓa anyasnayii vnyanya, <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />ɓa ɓa wo nge wo fa anyasnayi ɓa ɓwa əwo əjegbe əɓwa nu to, jesnu aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə la kwo toɓwa nyi, ɓa kwu kágna ɓwa.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Anya ń ɓa tu əza cegye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Nlonu Afarisiyi ho ɓədo n owa anyawuyii ɓa kwnu ń Urishelima ɓa ɓe da Yeisu ɓa nya wo əɓo, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Knyiyi nu zhni əho amwutuyi ɓai znu azakwoi kwnunu gnana a? Ɓa ta na aɓwa lo, ɓa kpe nyagyi gyi m!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei znu Shekwoyi ɓəgbetu gnana ntu ń əfye akwnunu ɓo a? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Ntuge Shekwoyi ɓə kwu gna, ‘Ga əho dada n əho əyai mwamwa,’ jesnu, ‘Əza n wa knyi əwo əya kwo əwo dada akpmi, a ɓaa wo wu.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Ama fya gna nge ənya n zahozahoyi ɓə ɓa zhniapma ncei wa bma əwo dada zhni kwo əwo əya, ‘wó la kwo gbmishi ga Shekwoyi’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />wo taa ‘mwa əwo dada n əwo əyai n əkwoi m.’ N zokwo ye nu n fye wnu Shekwoyi ɓədagbma ya n ɓwasnu ntu ń əfye kwnunu ɓo. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Əfye akwocednayi! Ishaya ɓə da gaiciya nu əsa ń wo ɓə da sheɓəgwogna tu ń əfye ɓo nyi, wa gna:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />“ ‘Aza ye ga mi mwamwa n əɓa agbei nu ɓwasnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">ama əɓa adu mwakpa lo n mii.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Ɓa ga mi mwamwa gbəloi nu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">əɓa nyawu ɓwa azanyikwoci aɓəgbekpe nu zhni.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Yeisu wa yì deeji zhi ga əwohni jesnu wa gna, “Fye kwu Atnubwakna, fya ɓwa awyega. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ənya n kwo lodna ń əza əgbe nyi, əkwo nu ta tu wo cegye m, ama ənya n kwo gbmiɓe ń əza əgbe, əkwo nu tu wo cegye.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Nsayi amwutuyi ɓa ɓe da wo ɓa nyaɓo, “Ho kpəlo nge ho ɓə la Afarisiyi bwi əsa ń ɓa ɓə wo ɓəye nyi?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Nyabye dəhodəhoi ń əmi Dada əshemi nya nu to bye kwo m, a ɓaa kwo shiya ɓədo n əkwo agbegyei. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Fa ɓa; ɓa zhni azokwowúyi awyebwayi nu. N wyebwayi wa wu wyebwayi ədo zokwo, əɓa ngwnu-aba ɓa ɓaa kaya fyi ń ɓwokwnu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Byitusu wa gna, “Wu yi əɓo ń ɓəsisi ye da.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yeisu wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Fye ye fyilo ntna gənyikpe nu? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Fye ta gyewye lo nge nyahonyahoi ń kwo lo əgbe kwo lo nubwo nu jesnu nlonu kwa gbmiya ń nayi m? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Ama anya n ɓa kwnuɓe n əza əgbe ɓa kwnuɓe ń əwo ədu nu, əɓa nu tu wo cegye. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Ntuge dna n ədu nu ń aɓənubwozhni nukwoi kwnuɓe: əzawu, anagbái, asisiɓozhni, əvyiwyi, ɓəgbmi katá nya, əyewnuya. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Aɓo ye pya nu tu əza cegye; ama nyagyi gyi ntna aɓwana, ta tu əza cegye m.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaanayi nyikwoza gaiciyaganunui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />She Yeisu ɓə fa abaayi, wa lo Taya n Sidonii. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Kaanayi nyikwoza woi gbmi n səpa yi wa ɓe da wo, woi ciɓwi, “Dagayi, Dawuda Nugwnu, gye mi snusnu! Ase nukwoi kwu wna əmi nyigwnu jesnu wo gyeazhnì lo ń mwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />To Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe m. Nlonu əwo amwutuyi ɓa ɓe da wo jesnu ɓa zhni n woi, “Nya wo ya, ntuge wo gna yi gnagna lo n ɓwucii.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “A ɓə tnu ń mii n ɓwasnu ntu Israila aknyi aɓwuɓwui ɓo nu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Nyikwoza ye wa ɓe wa ceakwokwo shi ń əwo abye. Wa gna “Dagayi, bma mi zhni!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Kwo to bmyalo a kwu aɓyi biledi a sheyazhi amwi m.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Wa gna, “Əə kwo wo lo nlonu, Dagayi. Ama kwo amwi ɓa gyi awyiwoi n ɓa kaya zhi n əɓa dagayi tebwul nyi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna wo, “Nyikwoza, ho n gaiciyaganunui yaakwoi lo! Ənya n ha nyaɓo tu n kwo nyi, a la ga ho.” Njesnu əwo nyigwnu wa gwo kágna n əsayii.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga aza dugwu-anyi nyagyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yeisu wa laka n abaayi, wa lo n Gəlili shikwo ɓwai. Nlonu, wa gwnutu n əpe waa sasetu n ɓo. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Deeji yaakwo kwa ɓe da wo, ɓai ɓe n azabmazhii, awyebwayi, anayiwnuyi, atákpeɓəda n azajei n mwa bəgyé, jesnu ɓa ya ɓa zhi n əwo apitabwada aba; jesnu ɓa gwo kágna. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Ca wo aza əsa n ɓa ɓə gye atákpeɓəda ɓai daɓo, azabmazhi ɓai ɓwa lafyiya, apita shásháida ɓai znazna jesnu awyebwayi ɓai gyewyeba. Njesnu ɓa ci Shekwoyi Israila nya.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yeisu wa yì əwo amwutuyi zhi wa gna, “Aza ye snusnu wna mi lo, ɓa kwu kwnusnu n əmii anyipyei ngwnu-ata nu ntna nyagyi. Mi to ncei pmalo ma gna ɓa ami n myikwnui m, sakwnú ɓa lo ɓai myiya ń zokwo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Əwo amwutuyi ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Yi ye ya ɓwa biledi ń nanu ń zhabwi ye, kwa kwnu deeji ye a?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yeisu wa nyaɓo, “Fye n biledi aknanai shilo ngwnu aknyiyi nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Ngwnu-tnaaba, ɓədo n abmya aɓyii fyewyi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Wa gna deeji nge ɓa kwu sase zhi n əknyi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Nlonu wa kwu biledi aknana ngwnu-tnaaba n abmyai, wa sa Shekwoyi ami, wa sa ɓa ya, wa ga əwo amwutuyi, əɓahni ce ɓa ga aza. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Əɓa vnyanya ɓa kwu gyi, nubwo kwa kwu ɓa fwu. N dəye avnu, amwutuyi ɓa kwu awyiwoi n ɓa ɓə ce nyi, acekwnu n nunui, ngwnu-tnaaba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Aza bəgyé n ɓa ɓə gyi nyagyi nyi, ɓa ɓə nyi azanugbai adugwu-anyi nu, gbowo n anyikwozai n aɓyii. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Shi Yeisu ɓə kwu deeji gnami, wa lodna ń əya nuwnanya wa lo Magadan səpa.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">A zna əznù shni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Afarisiyi n Asadusiyii ɓa ɓe Yeisu aba ɓa tu wo mwi, ɓai nya wo nge wo wu ɓa əznù n kwo gbmi n əshemi.<verse eid="MAT 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “She wyeshe she, fya gna, ‘Anyì ɓə wu nsu bmagyii, ntuge anyìbmana wulo n byeibyeii,’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />jesnu n labmii, fya gna, ‘N naiye ogbma ɓa zhi n asei ntuge anyìbmana wulo byeibyeii, jesnu n tnutnui.’ Fye kpəlo shi fye ɓa ɓwa awyeknaya da anyìbmana ɓo she fya gye ɓa wu, ama fye ta myilo fyei da əznù cala ye nya ɓo m. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Cala akpizhniyi n anagbáizhniyi nyai kwo zna əznù shni, ama a taa ga kwo dəho m, akpəge əznù Yunana nya.” Nlonu Yeisu wa laka n əɓa aba wa lo wo nya.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afarisiyi yisti n Asadusiyi nyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />She ɓa ɓə pi nuwna-znudna ya, amwutuyi ɓa kwu zamwi to ɓa la biledi shi m. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Fye zhni pəceye. Fye la əwyewna ntu n yisti Afarisiyi nya ɓo n Asadusiyii.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Ɓa da ɓəda n ajei əɓahniɓahni, ɓa gna, “Ntuge yi to ɓe n biledi shi nu m.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Woi kpe əɓo n ɓa da, Yeisu wa nyaɓo, “Əfye agaiciyaganunui gbagbaida, knyiyi nu zhni fyei da aɓo fyehnifyehni nge fye to biledi shilo nu ma a? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Fye too du fye ɓwa awyega m? Fye ta pá biledi ngwnu-atnu əɓo lo n aza dugwu-atnu ɓo gyi nyi m, jesnu acekwnu ngwnu aknyiyi nu n nunui n awyiwoii ń fye ɓə yezhi a? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Kwo biledi ngwnu-tnaaba ntu aza dugwu ngwnu-anyi ɓo jesnu acekwnu ngwnu aknyiyi nu n nunui n awyiwoi ń fye ɓə yezhi a? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Kwo ze n wunanu to fyei ɓwa awyega nge mi to ɓə daɓo n fyei ntu ń biledi ɓo nu ma a? Ama fye zhni pəceye ntu Afarisiyi yisti ɓo n Asadusiyii.”<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Nlonu ɓa kwu awyega ɓwa nge wo to ɓə gnyi woi daɓo nge ɓa zhni pəceye n yisti yi nu n a fyi n biledi nyi m, ama ntu ń nyawu Afarisiyi nya ɓo n Asadusiyii.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byitusu gbmiɓo ge Yeisu zhni Masifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />She Yeisu ɓə ɓe Kaisariya Fyilibyi əknyi, wa nya əwo amwutuyi əɓo, “Aza gna nge Əza Nugwnu zhni nyika nu a?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Azaho gna Yohana Batizimazhniyi nu; azaje gna nge Iliya; dudulonu azaje gna Irimyiya nu, kwo sheɓəgwognayi ho.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Wa nyaɓo, “Ama əfye ma a? Fye gna ge mi zhni nyika nu a?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Sima Byitusu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ho zhni Masifu nu, Shekwoyi wyewyeyida Nugwnu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Anabəlikada nu ń hoi, Sima Jona nugwnu, ntuge nayi n amii nu to wu ho əɓəye m, ama əmi Dada nu ń wo dna ń əshemi nyi. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Mi gna ho nge əho nu zhni Byitusu, jesnu tu ń apma ye nu n mi ɓa mi əmi ikilisiya, abwokwnumi Akwu nya taa gnyiapaapa n əkwoi m. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Mi ɓə ga ho anyagwunya əshebemi nya; nyahonyahoi ń a kwo pa dna ń anyì a ɓa kwo pa dna ń əshemi, jesnu nyahonyahoi ń aa kwo loya dna ń anyì a ɓaa kwo loya dna ń əshemi.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Nlonu wa ga əwo amwutuyi əgbe nge ɓa to gna zahozahoyi nge əwo nu zhni Kirisiti m.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu pma əwo əfyi ɓo da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Ənya n kwo laka nsayii Yeisu wa ya woi ga əwo amwutuyi awyega nge ɓəshishinu wa lo Urishelima jesnu woi gyeazhnì n mwa ń abyeda akwnu, apirisiti atukwoda ɓədo n owa anyawuyii, ntuge ɓəshishinu a ɓə la wo wu jesnu n nyipyei tayii ai la wo kala ń wyewyeyi.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Byitusu wa pmyi wo gnyi n gnagna, wa ya woi gnaknyi wo. Wa gna, “Nanyi, Dagayi! Əɓəye taa snu ho m kpeekpe!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Yeisu wa pmyiawye wa gna Byitusu, “Pmyiyagnyi ń əmi avnu, Shetam! Ho zhni bwonyice nya nu ń əmi aba; ho to n nubwozhni Shekwoyi nyai dnalo n bwugba m, ama zanyikwoci azanga nya nu n ɓwasnu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna əwo amwutuyi, “Zahozahoyi ń wo ncei pmalo waa zhni əmi mwutuyi, ɓəshishinu waa əwohni aɓəna jesnu wa la əwohni znudu wa vyi mi. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Ntuge əza ń wo ncei pmalo wa gnyi əwohni wyewyeyi wo ɓa ɓwu kwo nuwna, ama əza ń wa ɓwu əwohni wyewyeyi nuwna ntu əmi ɓo wo ɓa ɓwa kwo. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Knyi əɓo manai nu lo ń əza ɓa ɓwa ń anyì vnyanya, ama waa ɓwu əwo wyewyeyi nuwna a? Kwo knyiyi nu n əza ɓa ga dna n doshna ntu əwo wyewyeyi ɓo a? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Ntuge Əza Nugwnu ɓəə ɓé dna ń əwo Dada latu ń əwo amaləkai woi ga zahozahoyi gyiba vyi ɓəhoɓəhoi shi wo ɓə zhni.<verse eid="MAT 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />“Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, azaho gnyiagnyi zhilo n ya n ɓa taa to əfyi wo m akpəge ɓa kwu gye Əza Nugwnu woi kashi shnizhi ɓe dna n əwo əbemi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu bmaznuznu dna n Zafnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />N anyipyei tnaanyi avnu, Yeisu wa kwu Byitusu, Jemyis ɓədo n Yohanai, Jemyis ədo, wa gwnutu lo n ɓai ń əpe asnada ɓahniɓahni. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Tu n abaayi, waa znubma dna ń zafnu n əɓa awyeba. Əwo awyeba ɓa bmyana ngye nyipyei, jesnu əwo aje ɓa kwu fna palilii ngye bwuznagna. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Əsa fyewyi Mwusa n Iliyai ɓa kpmiyazhi n amwutuyi awyeba ɓai daɓo ń Yeisui.<verse eid="MAT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Byitusu wa gna Yeisu, “Dagayi, kwo bmyalo shi yi kpəlo ń abaye. Ń ho ɓa ye, mi ɓa kpe alubwi ngwnu-ata; gbmanyi əho nya, gbmanyi Mwusa nya jesnu gbmanyi Iliya nya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Woi ye gnyi woi daɓo, ənyì fnafnai kwa pwu ɓa, jesnu bəgye kwa gbmi ń ənyì kwa gna, “Əza ye nu zhni əmi Nugwnu, n mi ye wo, a da mi lo n woi zam. Fye kna wo tnubwa!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />She amwutuyi ɓə wo dəye, ɓa yazhi ń awyebai wu n əknyi n zhi n ədnai. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Ama Yeisu wa ɓe wa to ɓa əɓwa, wa gna, “Fye la kwukazhi, fye to zhni ədna wo m.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />She ɓa ɓə kpmiawye shi wo, to ɓa gye Mwusa n Iliyai ye zhi m, akpəge Yeisu.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Shi ɓa ɓə ɓe ɓai kazhi shnizhi ń əpe, Yeisu wa ga ɓa ɓəgbetu, “Fye to gna zahozahoyi əɓo ń fye kwu gyewye nyi m, sai əsa n a ɓə la Əza Nugwnu laka n əfyi.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Amwutuyi ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Ngye nlonu, knyiyi nu zhni owa anyawuyi ɓai gna nge ɓəshishi nu Iliya waa ɓe n kpmisnu a?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ɓəhnihnii, Iliya ɓelo, jesnu wo ɓə la aɓo zhnizhi vnyanya. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Ama əmi nu gna fye, Iliya wo la luɓe, jesnu ɓa to ɓə kpe nge əwo nu m, ɓa zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi kpe wo ń kwo ɓə da ɓa. N ɓwasnu nlonu cè, Əza Nugwnu ɓə gyeazhnì dna ń əɓa akwnu.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Nlonu amwutuyi ɓa ɓwa awyega ge wo ɓə gnyi woi daɓo n ɓai ntu Yohana Batizimazhniyi əɓo nu.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu ga əɓyinugbai kágna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />She ɓa ɓə si deeji aba, əzaho wa ɓe da Yeisu wa ceakwokwo shi n əwo abye. <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />Wa gna, “Dagayi, gye əmi nugwnu snusnu, kpəkpə nyasna gna wo gnagna lo jesnu wo gyeazhnì lo n mwa. Kwo zhni wo wa myiya dna n əná kwo n nuwna ciici. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Ma ɓe n woi n əho amwutuyi aba, ama ɓa to myi ń əwo kágna m.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əfye cala tna-gaiciyagayi n aɓo ajegbmiyii, mi ɓa kwnusnu n fyei əsa ngwnu aknyiyi nu a? Mi ɓa ɓwa bwugba n fyei əsa ngwnu aknyiyi nu a? Ɓe mi n əɓyinugbai yii n ya.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yeisu wa gnaknyi əse yi, jesnu kwa gbmiya n əɓyi yi, wa ɓwa kágna n əsayii.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Nlonu amwutuyi ɓa ɓe da Yeisu fyaa ɓa nyaɓo, “Knyiyi nu na zhni to ya myi n kwo gbmiya ma a?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ntuge əfye gaiciyaganunui ɓwasnu lo cewyi nu. Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, ngye fye n gaiciyaganunui lo n ɓwasnu ngye fulu byegye, fye ɓa myi fya gna əpe ye, ‘La laka ń ya ho la shi ń ɓwaayi,’ jesnu kwo ɓa lo. Ɓəho to lo ń kwo ɓa shenu ń əfye ba m. [<verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Ama əse ye pya ta gbmiya m, akpəge dna n aduwazhni ɓədo n gbewnai.]”<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu da əwo əfyi ɓo əɓwa baayi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />She ɓa ɓə yezhi n abagbmanyi n Gəlili, wa gna ɓa, “A ɓə la Əza Nugwnu ga dna n aza akwnu. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Ɓa ɓə la wo wu, jesnu a ɓə la wo laka gnyi n wyewyeyi.” Nlonu, amwutuyi ɓa kwu nu zhi n bwugbawnui.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dagayipwuwa gədu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Əsa n Yeisu n əwo amwutuyii ɓə kwu si Kapanam, Dagayipwuwa agədu gwoyi shekel tokwnui nya, ɓa ɓe da Byitusu ɓa nyaɓo, “Əfye nyawuyi ta kwnu Dagayipwuwa gədu m?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əə, wo kwnu lo.” Əsa n Byitusu ɓə loɓe pwuwa, Yeisu nu ɓə kpmi ɓəda da. Wa nyaɓo, “Sima, ho zhninubwo ge nanu a? Asu anyì nya gwo gədu n anyika nu a; n əɓa aɓyi nu kwo n azaje a?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Byitusu wa dnaɓəgbe, “N azaje nu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yeisu wa gna wo, “A gye ɓa n əɓa aɓyi aɓwai kwnukwnuiya lo nuu. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Ama nabai to ya ɓe n abwii m, lo nuwna-znudna, hoi she əho əgwo ya fyi n kwo. Əbmya kpmisnui n ho ɓə wna; gwu əkwo əgbe ya, ho ɓa gye shekel gbmanyi dna n kwo. Gbmi kwo haa ga ɓa, əmi gədu ɓədo n əfye nyai.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Əza duduyi dna n əshebemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />N əsayii, amwutuyi ɓa ɓe da Yeisu ɓa nyaɓo, “Ngye nlonu, to, nyika nu zhni duduyi ń əshebemi a?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Wa yì əɓyi nawyi ɓe ncei, waa wo gnyiagnyi dna ń əɓa atasni. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Wa gna: “Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, akpəge fya shnado fya kwu zè ngye aɓyi anawyi, fye to ɓə lo əshebemi m kpeekpe. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Ntucenu, zahozahoyi ń wa gba əwohni tukwo ngye əɓyi ye, əwo nu zhni duduyi dna n əshebemi. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Njesnu əza dəhodəhoii ń wa gwo əɓyi ye pya dna n əmi əye, wo la mi gwo.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anya n ɓa zhni əza wa cebwonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“N zahozahoyi wa zhni zaknayi ń aɓyi anawyi ye; n ɓa ga gaiciya n mi nyi, waa cebwonyi, kwo ɓəi ɓa wo du aa wyigwokwuta dnagbmai gyidna wo ń bəgye, aa wo sheya dna n shikwo loloyi waa shnidna n kwo. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Owii ń anyì aba, ntu anya ɓo ń ɓa zhni aza ɓai knyiabwonyi nyi! Ɓəshishi nu, anya yi ɓa ɓe, ama owii n əza yii ń wo nu zhni zokwo ń anya yi ɓe ncei nyi! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Ngye əho əɓwa kwo əho pita ɓa zhni ho ha cebwonyi, la kwo znuya, haa kwo sheya. Kwo n hoi dulo hoi lodna n wyewyeyi n əɓwai gbmanyi kwo n pitai gbmanyi, a fa ədo n a ɓa she ho ya dna n əná nyalonyalo nya n aɓwai ngwnu-aba kwo n apitai ngwnu-aba nyi. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Ngye əho əwyekwnunu ɓa zhni ho ha cebwonyi, la kwo gbmiya, haa kwo sheya. Kwo n hoi dulo hoi lodna n wyewyeyi n əwyei gbmanyi, a fa ədo ń a ɓa she ho ya dna n anápyi n awyei ngwnu-aba nyi.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi tu n əknyi abaɓwuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Fye zhni pəceye to fya ci əɓyi nawyi ho wyegba m. Ntuge mi gna fye nge, əɓa amaləka fyi n əshemi, ɓa gye əmi Dada awyeba ciici.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 18:10">[<verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />“Ntuge Əza Nugwnu ɓə ɓe nabai wa zna ənya ɓwuɓwui nu shni jesnu wa gnyi kwo.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Fye zhni kwo nubwo lo ge na a? Ń əza ń wo aknyii lo ngwnu tagyi, gbmanyi n əɓa mi, kwa ɓwuaba, wo to ɓə fa shiiciwagbmanyi ncei ciwagbmanyi kpe n apekwulu, wa lo woi zna gbmanyi yii shni n kwo la ɓwuaba nyi m? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Njesnu n wa gye kwo, ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, a gna wo da lo ntu gbmanyi ɓo n du aknyi shiiciwagbmanyi ncei ciwagbmanyii n ɓa to ɓə ɓwuaba nyi m. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Nlonu ce, əfye Dada ń əshemi to ncei pmalo nge dəho ń aɓyi anawyi ye wa zhnagbma m.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shi a ɓa zhni n leifyii dna ń Ikilisiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />“Ngye əho əzado kwo mapwi wa zhni ho leifyi, lo hoi wu wo əwo leifyi, n ɓwasnu əfye ngwnu-aba. Ń wa kna ho tnubwa, ho la wo gbmi n abaɓwi. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Ama ń wo to kna ho tnubwa m, ha la zaknayi kwo ha kwu aza ngwnu-aba ń kwnusnu n hoi, nabai n a ɓaa ‘ɓəhoɓəhoi myishì n aseyedada ɓədai ngwnu-aba kwo ngwnu-ata.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Ngye ń wo to dudu wa kna əho ɓəda tnubwa m, ha gna ikilisiya; jesnu ń wo to kna ikilisiya tnubwa ce m, fye la wo zè ngye ashnagbayi kwo ngye gədu gwoyi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, nyahonyahoi ń a la kwo pa dna ń anyì, a ɓaa kwo pa dna ń əshemi, jesnu nyahonyahoi ń a la kwo loya dna ń anyì, a ɓaa kwo loya dna ń əshemi.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Njesnu, ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, ngye aza ngwnu-aba fyi ń anyì ɓa dnagbedo ɓa nya nyahonyahoi əɓo, əmi Dada ń wo dna n əshemi nyi, wo ɓa zhni kwo ga ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Ntuge aba ń aza ngwnu-aba kwo ngwnu-ata ɓa yezhi dna n əmi əye, mi kwnusnu lo n ɓai n abaayi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi tnutnuyi atnasnusnugyeyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Nlonu Byitusu wa ɓe Yeisu aba wa nyaɓo, “Dagayi, aɓwa ngwnu aknyiyi nu ń mi ɓa zo əmi ədo kwo mapwi abwi n ɓa zhni mi leifyi a? Kwo ɓaa lo aɓwa tnaaba nuu?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mi gna fye, toge aɓwa tnaaba m, ama shiitnaaba aɓwa ngwnu-tnaaba.<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />“Ntucenu, əshebemi ń wu ngye əsu nu n wo ɓə ncei pma wa gwo nyadokwu ń əwo atnutnuyi nyi. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Shi wo ɓə ya nyadokwu gwo, a ɓe wo ń əzai ń wo ɓə n zinali ətai shi wo agwnuma adugwu-awo. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Shikwonyi wo to ɓə myi n wo gba əta yi m, dagayi wa ga əgbe nge əwo, ɓədo n əwo nyikwoi, n əwo aɓyii, ń anyai vnyanya ń wo ɓə ncei, a kwu ɓa kwnu a gba əta yi.<verse eid="MAT 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />“Ama əwo tnutnuyi yi wa ceakwokwo shi ń əwo abye wa ɓa, ‘La bwugba ɓwa ń mii. Mi ɓa gba əta dəhodəhoi n mi ncei shilo.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Tnutnuyi yi dagayi, wa wna wo snusnu, waa əta yi fa ga wo, wa fa wo wa lo.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Ama she tnutnuyi yi ɓə gbmiya lo, wa gye əwo tnutnuyi ədo ń wo ɓə n ətai shi wo, denari tagyi-gbmanyi; wa taɓwashi wo, jesnu wa gyi wo əsha ce. Wa gna, ‘Gba əta ń ho ncei shi mi nyi!’<verse eid="MAT 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />“Əwo tnutnuyi ədo wa ceakwokwo shi wa ɓa wo, ‘La bwugba ɓwa ń mii. Mi ɓa gba ho əta yi.’<verse eid="MAT 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />“Ama to wa ye m. Ń əkwoɓwi, wa gbmiya lo wa zhni a əzaayi gwudna ń zhalu nya əsa ń wo ɓə zo əta gba. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />She atnutnuyi aje ɓə gye əɓo ń kwo kwu zhni nyi, ɓa gyi minagyi napyei, ɓa lo ɓa gna əɓa dagayi ɓəhoɓəhoi n kwo kwu zhni.<verse eid="MAT 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />“Nlonu, əwo dagayi wa yì tnutnuyi yi dna n mi. Wa gna wo, ‘Əho, tnutnuyi əkpizhniyi. Mi ɓə la əho əta yi fa ga ho vnyanya n ho ɓə ncei shi mi nyi, ntuge ho ɓə ɓe haa ɓa mi. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Kwo to ɓə kwnuce ha gye əho tnutnuyi ədo snusnu, n ɓwasnu shi mi ɓə gye ho snusnu nyi m?’<verse eid="MAT 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />“Dna n minagyi, əwo dagayi wa ta wo ya ga azhaluda nabai ɓa tu wo azhnìgye, nya əsa ń wo ɓə gba əta yi vnyanya ń wo ɓə ncei shi nyi.<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />“Nlai nu ń əmi Dada əshemi nya ɓə zhni zahozahoyi ń fye, akpəge ha zo əho əzado kwo mapwi abwi ń əho ədu.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Mwulawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />She Yeisu ɓə la pwo aɓəda ye da ɓo, wa fa Gəlili jesnu wa lo Yahudiya əknyi n Urudu əkpma dəyi. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Deeji yaakwo kwa vyi wo, jesnu wa ga ɓa kágna zhi n abaayi.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Afarisiyi ho ɓa ɓe da Yeisu nabai ɓa tu wo mwi. Ɓa nyaɓo, “Owa ncei ye lo nge zanugbai wo wu mwula n əwo nyikwoi ntu n nyahonyahoi kwo n ɓəhoɓəhoi ɓo o?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye too ba nge ń ayayaba Shekwoyi ɓə zhni ɓa ‘zanugbai n nyikwozai nu m?’ <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Njesnu wa gna, ‘Ntu dəye ɓo, zanugbai ɓa fa əwo dada n əwo əyai, waa nyima əwo nyikwo, jesnu əɓa ngwnu-aba ɓa ɓə kwu zè nayi gbmanyi.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Ntulonu, ɓa to ye zhni ngwnu-aba nu m, ama nayi gbmanyi. Ntucenu ənya ń Shekwoyi wo la kwo cigyido, zahozahoyi to gna kwo ajeya m.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Ɓa nyaɓo, “Knyiyi nu ɓə zhni Mwusa wa ga əgbetu nge əza wo ga əwo nyikwo nyakaɓəgbmi mwulawu nya, jesnu wa wo ya a?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mwusa ɓə ga fye əgbe nge fye wu mwula n əfye anyikwoi ntu n əfye adu akalákpe ɓo nu. Ama kwo to ɓə nyi lonu nu ń ayayaba m. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Mi gna fye nge zahozahoyi n wa wu mwula n əwo nyikwoi, akpəge ntu asisiɓozhni ɓo; waa la nyikwo ədo, wo kwu anagbái zhni.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Amwutuyi ɓa gna, “Ngye kwo lo nlonu n əza aba n əwo nyikwoi, a gye kwo bmyalo to əza wa la nyikwo m.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Zahozahoyi nu taa gwo ɓədagbma ye m, ama kwo ɓwasnu lo n aza aba nu n a la kwo ga ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Ntuge azaka lo n a ɓə ma ɓa n wu lo nu, jesnu aza lo n a ɓə zè ɓa azaka, jesnu azaho lo n ɓa kwu ɓahni zè azaka ntu n əshebemi ɓo. Əza n wo ɓa gwo ɓəda ye, wa gwo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aɓyi anawyii n Yeisui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Nlonu, aza ɓa ɓe n aɓyi anawyii n Yeisu aba nabai wa kpe ɓa əwo aɓwa jesnu wa zhniaduwa ga ɓa. Ama amwutuyi ɓa gnaknyi ɓa.<verse eid="MAT 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yeisu wa gna, “Fye fa aɓyi anawyii ɓa ɓe da mi, fye to nya ɓa ya m, ntuge əshebemi zhni əɓa pya nya nu.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />She wo ɓə kwu əwo aɓwa kpe ń əɓa atukwo, wa laka n abaayi.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gyiwyeda n Shekwoyi əbemii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />N ɓwasnu nsayii, əzaho wa ɓe da Yeisu wa nyaɓo, “Nyawuyi manai, knyi əɓo manai nu zhni ɓəshishi n mi ɓa zhni ma ɓwa wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya a?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Knyiyi nu zhni hoi yi mi nge əza manai a? Əza manai to lo m, akpəge Shekwoyi. Ń ho ye lo ha lodna n wyewyeyi, shi aɓəgbetu ɓwa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Wa nyaɓo, “Aknyidoi nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “ ‘Ho taa wu əza m, ho taa zhni anagbái m, ho taa wyivyi m, ho taa gbmi əɓo katá nya m, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />ga əho dada mwamwa n əho əyai,’ jesnu ‘wu əho kwnuzhiyi yeye ngye əhohni.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Əɓyikasa yi wa gna, “Aɓo ye vnyanya mi n ɓai shiɓwa lo. Knyiyi nu ye n mii celo a?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ngye ho ncei pmalo haa zè əza nunui, lo, ho kwu əho nyaɓwa kwnu vnyanya jesnu ha kwu ga awyekwoyi, ho ɓə ɓwa nyaɓwayezhi n əshemi. Nlonu hoi ɓe, ha vyi mi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />She əɓyikasa yi ɓə wo dəye, wa laka lo n bwugbawnui, ntuge wo ɓəi n nyaɓwai n mwa kwokwo.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna əwo amwutuyi, “Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, kwo dnaɓo lo gyiwyeda woi lodna n əshebemi. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Njesnu mi gna fye, kwo gna wo lo faafa lakwnumi kwa du n acibwa a fa əza n wo n nyaɓwai lo woi lodna n Shekwoyi əbemi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />She amwutuyi ɓə wo dəye, ca wo ɓa n mwa jesnu ɓa nyaɓo, “To, nyika nu ɓə pwo a?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yeisu wa shi ɓa awye wa gna, “N zanyikwoci aba, dəye taa yezhni m, ama aɓo vnyanya ɓa yezhni n Shekwoyii.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Byitusu wa dna wo ɓəgbe, “Yi kwu nyahonyahoi fa vnyanya nabai ya vyi ho! Knyiyi nu shilo ntu əyi ɓo a?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, n aɓo doshna sa vnyanya, əsa n Əza Nugwnu ɓə sasetu n əwo shnikpegye latuyi, əfye ń fye vyi mi nyi, fye ɓə sase kpe ce n abeshnikpegye awoceaba, fyei da Israila abye awoceaba owa. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Jesnu zahozahoyi n wo la əwo pwuwa fa, kwo əwo azaje kwo mapwii kwo əda kwo əya kwo nyikwo kwo aɓyi kwo afwa ntu əmi ɓo, wo ɓə gwo gyiba n mwa aɓwa tagyi jesnu wo ɓə ɓwa wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Ama aza bəgyé ń ɓa nu zhni akpmisnuyi, ɓa ɓə kwu zè akpmaknayi, jesnu aza bəgyé ń ɓa nu zhni akpmaknayi, ɓa ɓə kwu zè akpmisnuyi.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi atnutnuyi fyi n anamzhni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Ntuge əshebemi wulo ngye ofwada nu ń wo ɓə gbmiya lo n fyegyiɓwai, wo kwu atnutnuyi ntu ń əwo anamzhni ɓo. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Waa ye nge wo ɓə gba ɓa denari gbmanyi ń nyipyei ɓwugyi tnutnu, wa tnu n ɓai lo əwo anamzhni.<verse eid="MAT 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />“N labmii snukna ngwnu-ciwagbmanyi wa gbmiya lo wa gye azaje zhi ń gnyikwota ntna əɓo zhnizhnii. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Wa gna ɓa, ‘Əfyehni ce, fye lo fye zhni tnutnu ń əmi anamzhni, mi ɓə gba fye nyahonyahoi n kwo bmya.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Ntulonu ɓa lo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:5">“Wa je gbmiya lo n nyipyei tu n atukwo, ngye snukna ngwnu-ata, wa zhni əɓo gbmanyigbmanyi. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Ngye snukna ngwnu-atnu n wyesheɓwai, wa je gbmiya lo wa gye azaje ń yee zhi n ɓo. Wa nya ɓa əɓo, ‘Knyiyi nu zhni fyenyi zhi laɓa ń ya nya nyipyei zo ntna əɓo zhnizhnii a?’<verse eid="MAT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />“Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Ntuge əzaho too ga yi tnutnu m.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:7">“Wa gna ɓa, ‘Əfyehni ce fye lofyi fyee zhni tnutnu ń əmi anamzhni.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“She wyeshe ɓə she, anamzhni dagayi wa gna əwo atnutnuyi tukwoda, ‘Yi atnutnuyi zhi ha gba ɓa əɓa atnutnu gyiwye, ha ya n azai ń a ɓə kpmakwu, kwa lo aza n a ɓə kpmikwu nyi.’<verse eid="MAT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />“Atnutnuyi ń a ɓə kwu ɓa snukna ngwnu-atnu n wyesheɓwai nyi, ɓa ɓe, zahozahoyi wa gwo denari gbmanyi. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ntulonu she aza yi ń a ɓə kwu ɓa n kpmisnui nyi, ɓa ɓə n əwyei tu nge ɓa ɓá gwo n dutu nu. Ama zahozahoyi n ɓa ce, wa gwo denari gbmanyi. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Əsa n ɓa ɓə gwo kwo, ɓa ya awyice tu ń ofwada tukwo. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Ɓa gna, ‘Aza ye ń a kpma ɓa kwu nyi, ɓa ɓwa tnutnu zhni snukna gbmanyi nu, honyi gba ɓa dəidəi n yii ń ya zhni tnutnu dnagbmai jesnu nyipyei kwo kwu zo kpe n yi nyi.’<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Ama wa dna əzaknayi ɓəgbe n ɓa, wa gna, ‘Nugwnudo, mi too gyi fye fyi m. Fye to kwu ye nge fye ɓa zhni tnutnu denari gbmanyi m? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Gwo əho gyiwye ha lo. Mi ye ma ga əza ń ma kpma wo la nyi, ənya gbmanyigbmanyi nu shi ma ga fye nyi. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Mi to kwnuce lo ma zhni shi mi ncei pma n əmi gyiwyei m? Kwo ho wnunu n mii ntu n əmi ɓwaloya ɓo nu a?’<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />“Ntulonu əza kpmaknai wo ɓə la zè kpmisnuyi, jesnu əza kpmisnuyi wo ɓə la zè kpmaknai.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu da əwo əfyi ɓo əɓwa taayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Nsayii Yeisu ɓə gnyi woi gwnulo Urishelima nu. Woi lo ń zokwo, wa pmyi awoceaba zhi n gnagna wa gna ɓa, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Yi zhi yii gwnulo Urishelima nu, jesnu a ɓə la Əza Nugwnu taya ga apirisiti tukwoda n owa anyawuyii. Ɓa ɓə la əfyi owa znutu wo <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />jesnu ɓa ɓə la wo taya dna n Abyedo akwnu ɓai kpe wo agyè, ɓai ɓyewoya ń knalufnyii jesnu ai znuwodu. N nyipyei taayii, a ɓə la wo laka gnyi n wyewyeyi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Əɓyiya wyegyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Nlonu Zebədi anugwnu əya wa ɓe da Yeisu n əwo anugwnui, wa ceakwokwo shi, wa zna bmyashi shni ń əwo aba.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Wa nyaɓo, “Ho ye knyiyi nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Wa gna, “La ye mi nge gbmanyi ń əmi anugwnu ye ɓə sasetu ń əho ɓwaizheɓwa jesnu əza baayi ń əho ɓwaipmiɓwa dna ń əho əbemi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Fye ta kpe ənya əye lo ń fye nya əkwo əɓo nyi m, fye ɓa myi fya sni bwoɓyi ń mi ye ma sni nyi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Yi ɓa myi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Ɓəhnihni fye ɓə sni bwoɓyi n mi ye ma sni nyi, ama fyei sase kpe ń əmi ɓwaizheɓwa kwo ń əmi ɓwaipmiɓwa, əmi nya nu to, ma ga fye m. Abaye zhni aza yi nya nu ń əmi Dada ɓə zhni ɓa ntu əɓa ɓo nu nyi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />She amwutuyi ngwnu-awo ɓə wo ce, ɓa kwu zhi n minagyii n aza ngwnu-aba yei. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Yeisu wa yì ɓa zhi n abagbmanyi wa gna, “Fye kpəlo nge Abyedo abegyiyi nya wna ɓa əsnu, jesnu əɓa atukwoda ayaakwo zhni ɓa wu ɓa ikwo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Ama ń əfye aba kwo taa wu nlonu m. Əzahozahoyi ń wo ye lo waa zè əza yaakwo ń əfye atasni, ɓəshishi nu waa zè əfye tnutnuyi, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />jesnu əza n wo ncei pmalo waa zhni kpmisnuyi, ɓəshishi nu waa zè əfye fyenu, <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />n ɓwasnu shi Əza Nugwnu to ɓə ɓe nabai a zhni wo tnutnu nu m, ama wa zhni aza tnutnu, jesnu wa ga əwo wyewyeyi kwaa zè tagbanya ntu bəgyé ɓo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awyebwayi ngwnu-aba gwo wyebagye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Shi Yeisu n əwo amwutuyii ɓə zhi ɓai kwnuya n Jerikwo, deeji yaakwo kwa vyi wo. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Awyebwayi ngwnu-aba ɓə sase zhi ń zokwogbe, jesnu she ɓa ɓə wo nge Yeisu duya lo; ɓa ɓəwyi, “Dagayi, Dawuda Nugwnu, gye yi snusnu!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Deeji kwa gnaknyi ɓa, jesnu ɓa gna ɓa nge, ɓa kwu cepyi, ama ɓa gná əwyi ɓeɓe nu, “Dagayi, Dawuda Nugwnu, gye yi snusnu!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yeisu wa kpegnyi, wa yì ɓa. Wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Fye ye ma zhni knyiɓei nu ga fye a?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Dagayi, yi ye ya gyewyeba.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yeisu wa gye ɓa snusnu, wa to əɓa awye ɓwa. Nsayisayii ɓa gwo əɓa wyebagye, ɓa vyi wo.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu loɓe Urishelima n zhni Əsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Shi ɓa ɓə wo vyivyiwyi n Urishelimai, ɓa ɓe Betifyeji ń Zaitu əpe, Yeisu wa tnu amwutuyi tnutnu əɓa ngwnu-aba, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />wa gna ɓa, “Fye lo əzhi n kwo zhi ń əfye abye nyi, shi fye lofyi n kwo, fye ɓə gye zhagawyi n gyignyi n ɓo, n əkwo əɓyii ma kwo. Fye lo ɓa, fya ɓe mi n ɓai. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Ń əzaho wa nya fye əɓo, fye gna ge Dagayi ń əɓa apmai lo jesnu wo ɓa je tnu n ɓai wolowolo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Dəye ɓə zhni nabai kwa nu əɓo nu ń a ɓə da dna n sheɓəgwognayi əgbe nyi:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Gna Siyona Nyigwnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">‘Gyewye, əho əsu ɓe da ho nyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">n tukwownashii n gwnutu n zhagawyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">jesnu tu ń zhagawyi snáyi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Amwutuyi ɓa lo ɓa zhni shi Yeisu ɓə ga ɓa əgbe nyi. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Ɓa ɓe n zhagawyii ɓədo n zhagawyi snáyii, jesnu ɓa kwu əɓa aje takpe n ɓa, nabai Yeisu wa sasetu. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Deeji yaakwo ɓa ta əɓa aje zhi ń zokwo, azaje ɓa bma ashnuwna aɓwala ɓa ta ɓa kpe lo ń zokwo. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Deeji n ɓa ɓə gyilo ń əwo abye nyi, jesnu ń aza yii ń ɓa ɓə vyi ń avnu nyi, ɓa ɓəwyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosana ga Dawuda Nugwnu!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Anabəlikada nu n əzai ń wo ɓe dna ń Dagayi əye!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosana dna ń əshemi duduyi!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />She Yeisu ɓə lodna n Urishelima, əzhiyaakwo vnyanya kwaa totu, jesnu ɓa nyaɓo, “Əza ye zhni nyika nu a?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Deeji kwa dnaɓəgbe, “Yeisu nu gnyi, sheɓəgwognayi ń wo gbmi n Nazereti nyi, ń Gəlili.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu dna n Dagayipwuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yeisu wa lodna n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, waa aza yí nyaya vnyanya, ń ɓa ɓə fyi ɓai kwnú anya, jesnu ɓai si anya ń abaayi nyi. Wa kwu agyiwye shnayí atebwul knyianyikwnu n alukpe kwnuyi asasekpebai. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Wa gna ɓa, “A ncei kafyilo, ‘A ɓa yi əmi pwuwa ge aduwazhni pwuwa nu,’ ama fye la kwo zè ‘avyì pwuwa.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Awyebwayi n azabmazhiyi ɓa ɓe da wo ń Dagayipwuwa, jesnu wa ká ɓa gna. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Ama she apirisiti tukwoda ń owa anyawuyii ɓə gye aɓo wowoi ń wo ɓə zhni, jesnu aɓyii ɓəwyi n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, “Hosana ga Dawuda Nugwnu,” ɓa gyi minagyi.<verse eid="MAT 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Ɓa nya wo əɓo, “Ho wo əɓo lo ń aɓyi ye zhi ɓai da nyi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əə, fye too shni kwo ba m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">“ ‘Ń aɓyi anawyii agbei nu, jesnu n aɓyipwutui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:16">n əho, Dagayi, ho la əho cici lashi m’?”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Wa laka ń əɓa aba, wa lo Byetani, əzhiyaakwo, aba ń wo ɓə wnagye.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu tu gbaayi shnuwna əknyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />N labmilabmii, Yeisu woi jezelo əzhiyaakwo, myikwnu kwoi la wo gwnu. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Shi wo ɓə gye gbaayi shnuwna ń zokwogbe, wa lo kwo aba ama to wa gye nyaho ń gyitu ń kwo m, akpəge afnyitolo. Nlonu wa gna kwo, “Ho taa je gyigyi ga m nanyinanyi!” N əsagbmanyii shnuwna yi kwa kwu ɓwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />She amwutuyi ɓə gye dəye, ca wo ɓa. Ɓa nyaɓo, “Knyiyi nu na zhni shnuwna ye kwoi ɓwa n pyepyei a?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, ń fye n gaiciyaganunui, jesnu to fya fyi abwugba-aba m, fye taa ɓwa gbaayi shnuwna ye nu əknyi tu m, ama fye ɓa myi fya gna əpe ye cè, ‘Lo, ho she əhohni ya dna ń shikwo,’ kwo ɓa zhni nlonu. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />N fya ga gaiciya, fye ɓa gwo nyahonyahoi ń fya nya əkwo əɓo dna ń aduwazhni.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A nya Yeisu ikwo əɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yeisu wa lodna n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, shi wo ɓə dna woi wunya, apirisiti atukwoda ń abyedai, ɓa ɓe da wo. Ɓa nyaɓo, “N knyi ikwoi nu ń ho zhni aɓo ye a? Jesnu nyika nu naa ga ho ikwo ye a?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Mi ɓa nya fye əɓo gbmanyi cè, n fya dna mi ɓəgbe, mi ɓa wu fye ikwo ń mi zhniapma ncei mii zhni aɓo ye. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Yohana batizimazhnizhni; kwo ɓə gbmi ń nanu a? Kwo ɓə gbmi n əshemi nu, kwo, əkwo əɓo ɓə pá n zanyikwoci nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Ɓa da kwo fyiaje ɓahniɓahni, ɓa gna, “N ya gna, ‘N əshemi nu,’ wo ɓa nyaɓo, ‘To knyiyi nu zhni to fyehni ga wo gaiciya m ma?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Ama ń ya gna, ‘Kwo gbmi n zanyikwoci nu,’ ədna wo yi lo ntu aza ɓo, ntuge əɓa vnyanya ɓa ɓə la Yohana la nge sheɓəgwognayi nu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Ntulonu ɓa dna Yeisu ɓəgbe, “Yi ta kpəlo m.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Nlonu wa gna, “Əmihni ce, mi taa gna fye n knyi ikwoi nu, n mi zhni aɓo ye ncei m.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi anugwnu ngwnu-aba nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Fye zhninubwo nge na a? Əzaho ɓə nyi ń anugwnui ngwnu-aba, wa lo da əɓyi kpmisnuyi wa gna wo, ‘Nugwnu, lo n naiye hoi zhni tnutnu ń anamzhni.’<verse eid="MAT 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />“Wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Mi taa lo m,’ ama əsa fyewyi, wa shna əwo bwugba do, waa lo.<verse eid="MAT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />“Nlonu əda wa lo da nugwnu baayi, wa gna wo əɓo gbmanyigbmanyi. Wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Əmi dada, mi ɓa lo,’ ama to wa lo m.<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />“Nyika nu n anugwnu aba ye ɓə zhni əwo dada ɓəye a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Kpmisnuyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, agədu gwoyi n akaluwayi ɓa ɓə kwu lofyi n Shekwoyi əbemi ń əfye abye. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Ntuge Yohana ɓə ɓe nabai wa wu fye ɓəfyece zokwo nu, to fya ga wo gaiciya m, ama agədu gwoyi n akaluwayi ɓa kwu gaiciyaga. Jesnu fye ɓə kwu əɓo ye gyewye, to fya yeabwi, jesnu to fya ga wo gaiciya m.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi afwaɓayi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />“Knatnubwa, ha wo nabagyi ɓəsisi nya ədo: Əknyida ho ɓə nyi ń wo ɓə n anamzhnii dna. Wa mi gəlu n shegwnu kwo, waa anamnuwnapyiba nyì dna ń kwo jesnu waa abagwuyi nyakwnu asnada mi. Nlonu waa kwo ga afwaɓayi ho ɓa ɓá, wa laka wa lo abado. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />She nyagyikwu əsa ɓə wo vyivyiwyi, wa tnu n əwo atnutnuyi ń afwaɓayi aba, ɓə gwo əwo anya gyigyii ga wo.<verse eid="MAT 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />“Afwaɓayi ɓa taɓwashi əwo atnutnuyi; ɓa lu zaknayi, ɓa wu əzaho, jesnu ɓa knyi əza taayi akwuta. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Nlonu wa tnu ɓa n atnutnuyi adoi, ń du akpmisnuyi, jesnu afwaɓayi ɓa zhni ɓa əɓo gbmanyigbmanyi. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />N kpmasnu, wa tnu ɓa n əwo nugwnui. Wa gna, ‘Ɓa ɓá ga əmi nugwnu mwamwa.’<verse eid="MAT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />“Ama she afwaɓayi ɓə gye əwo nugwnu, ɓa gna aje, ‘Əza ye nu zhni əgwúgyiyi. Fye ɓe, ya wu wo jesnu ya gwo əwo əgwú.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Ntulonu ɓa la wo, ɓaa wo sheyashi ń anamzhni əbmyi, jesnu ɓaa wo wu.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />“Ntucenu, she anamzhni da ɓə ɓe, wo ɓəi zhni n ɓai n wuna a?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Wo ɓei ɓe ń azagbəlo yei n zozo gbəloi nya aba, jesnu woi la anamzhni wa ga afwaɓayi ədo, ń ɓa ɓə ga wo əwo nyaɓwa ń anya gyigyi n nyagyikwu sai.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Fye too shni ba, dna ń Anyakazhi ge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“ ‘Kwuta ń anyamiyi ɓə la əkwo aɓo na nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">əkwo nu la zè ɓwakwonu kwuta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Dagayi nu kwu dəye zhni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">jesnu kwo zhni əɓo wowoi nu n əyi aba a?’<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Ntucenu mi gna fye nge a ɓə la Shekwoyi əbemi gwo n fye, ai la kwo ga aza n ɓa ga əkwo gyigyi. [<verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Əza ń wa myiya tu ń kwuta ye, wo ɓə la vyiya wyiwowyiwo; əza ń kwa myiya tu ń wo, wo ɓə la bwaya.”]<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />She apirisiti atukwoda ń Afarisiyii ɓə wo Yeisu ɓəsisi ye, ɓa kwu kpəge wo daɓo tu ń ɓa tukwo nu. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Ɓa zna zokwo shni nabai ɓa wna wo, ama ɓa wo deeji ədna, ntuge aza ɓə ń woi la ge wo zhni sheɓəgwognayi nu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi mwula awyefna nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yeisu wa je əɓo da ń ɓai n ɓəsisii, woi gna: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Əshebemi wulo ngye əsu nu ń wo ɓə shi mwula awyefna ntu ń əwo nugwnu ɓo. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Wa tnu əwo atnutnuyi ń aza yi aba ń wo ɓəə kwu awyefna pa ɓa nyi nge ɓa ɓe, ama to ɓa ye ɓe ɓo m.<verse eid="MAT 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />“Nlonu wa ɓe atnutnuyi, wa je tnu n ɓai woi gna, ‘Fye gna aza yi ń a ɓə kwu awyefna pa ɓa nyi nge mi kwu wyeshenyagyi zhnizhi: Mi kwu anakwonugbai wu, jesnu nyahonyahoi n zhi lo kwoi pmi. Fye ɓe amwula awyefna.’<verse eid="MAT 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />“Ama to ɓa zè əwye m, ɓaa gnamyi; gbmanyi wa lo əwo ofwa, əzado wa lo əwo aɓwaze. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Aza n ɓa ɓə ce nyi, ɓa wna əwo atnutnuyi, ɓa kpe ɓa azhnì jesnu ɓa wu ɓa. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Minagyi napyei kwa gyi əsu. Wa tnu n əwo akwnuyii ɓa zhni azawuyii agbma jesnu ɓa kwu əɓa əzhiyaakwo kpəna.<verse eid="MAT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />“Nlonu wa gna əwo atnutnuyi, ‘A kwú amwula awyefna ɓo zozhni, ama aza ń mi ɓə yi nyi, ɓa to kwnuce lo ɓa ɓe m. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Ntucenu fye lo adnadna ɓwakwonu n abofyefyéi fyei yi zahozahoyi n fya gyewye.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Ntulonu atnutnuyi ɓa kwnuya lo adnadna ɓwakwonu, ɓa yi aza vnyanya n ɓa ɓə gyewye; anukwoi ɓədo n amanaii, mwulapa aba kwaa nu gnyi n azhiɓeyii.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Ama əsa n əsu ɓə lo ɓe wá gye azhiɓeyi, wa gye əza dna ń ɓo, ń wo to ɓə n amwula ajei kpe m. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Wa nyaɓo, ‘Nugwnudo, ha lodna n abaye ń wunanu ntna amwula ajekpei a?’ Əza yi wa cegnyi pyi.<verse eid="MAT 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />“Nlonu, əsu wa gna atnutnuyi, ‘Fye pa wo n aɓwa n apitai, fya shewoya shi əbmyi, dna n wyegbma, aba ń a ɓə ciɓwi ai gyi anyikna.’<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />“Ntuge a la bəgyé yi, ama aknyiknyiyi ɓwasnu lo fyewyi nu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A gba Kaisa əbegyi gədu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Nlonu Afarisiyi ɓa kwnuya lo ɓəə pakwúlu nabai ɓa wna wo dna n əwo aɓədagbma. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ɓa tnu əɓa amwutuyi tnutnu lo wo aba n kwnusnu n Ahirudiyi. Ɓa gna, “Nyawuyi, yi kpəlo nge ho zhni əza gaiciyazhniyi nu, jesnu nge ho wu Shekwoyi zokwo nu ń kwo lodo lo n gaiciyanunui nyi. Aza ta myilo n ɓa pmyi ho awye m, ntuge ho ta shi əza awye lo kwo ɓa zhni anyika nu m. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Yi ye ha gna yi nsayi, knyiyi nu zhni əho ɓəmwi a? Kwo wulo ceewo a gba Kaisa begyi gədu, kwo a to gba ma a?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Ama Yeisu, woi kpe əɓa bwugba nukwoi ɓəmwi ye, wa gna, “Əfye akwocednayi, knyiyi nu zhni fyei pyi mi agbúlu a? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Fye wu mi gyiwye zhnana n fye gba gədu ncei nyi.” Ɓa ɓe wo n sisinkəɓwo yi, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Wa nya ɓa, “Nyika dogbe nu tu nyi a? Jesnu nyika əye nu kwnukpe n kwo a?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Kaisa nya nu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Nlonu wa gna ɓa, “Ntulonu fye ga Kaisa ənya n kwo zhni Kaisa nya, jesnu Shekwoyi ənya n kwo zhni Shekwoyi nya.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Əsa n ɓa ɓə wo lonu, ca wo ɓa. Ntucenu ɓa fa wo, ɓa wna əɓa zokwo.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amwulapa n əfyikalakwu əsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />N əwyi yii Asadusiyi, ń ɓa gna nge əfyikalakwu to lo nyi m, ɓa ɓe da wo n ɓənyai shi. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Ɓa gna, “Nyawuyi, Mwusa ɓə kwu gna yi nge ń zanugbai wa fyí ntna əɓyi, kwo zhni ɓəshishinu nge əwodo wa la nyigbayi yi, nabai wa ɓwa aɓyi ga wo. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Nsayii aza ɓə nyi ngwnu-tnaaba ɓai kwnu ń əyàmi gbmanyi fyi əyi atasni. Əza kpmisnuyi wa la nyikwo, waa fyí; shikwonyi wo to ɓəə ɓwa əɓyi m, waa əwo nyikwo yagnyi əwodo. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Əɓo gbmanyigbmanyi kwa ɓwa jezhni ń əzabaayii ń taayii, kwoi shnilo tnaaba yi. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />N kpmasnu, nyikwoyi waa fyi. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Nsayi, dna ń əfyikalakwu, wo ɓə zhni nyika nyikwo nu ń aza tnaaba ye a, shikwonyi əɓa vnyanya ɓə kwu mwulapa n woi nyi a?”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye fyilo ń abaɓwi ntuge fye ta kpe Nyakagyigyiyi ye lo kwo Shekwoyi kalá m. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />N əfyikalakwu wyii aza to ɓə pamwula kwo ɓai kna mwula m; ɓa ɓə wu ngye amaləka nu fyi ń əshemi. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ama ntu n afyífyiyi kalakwu ɓo, fye too ba ənya ń Shekwoyi ɓə gna fye, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Əmi nu zhni Shekwoyi Ibrahim nya, Shekwoyi Ishakwu nya, jesnu Shekwoyi Yakwuɓwu nya m’? Wo to zhni Shekwoyi azafyifyiyi nya nu m, ama awyewyeyi nya.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />She deeji ɓə wo dəye, əwo nyawu ɓo kwa wo ɓa.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəgbetu gnaduduyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Shi Afarisiyi ɓə wo nge Yeisu wo la Asadusiyi znu əgbe nya, ɓa yezhi n abagbmanyi. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Zaknayi ń ɓa, owa gnayekpeyi wa mwi wo n ɓənya yei: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Nyawuyi, knyidei nu zhni Owa ɓəgbetu duduyi a?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe: “ ‘Ye Dagayi əho Shekwoyi n əho bwugbai vnyanya jesnu n əho wyewyeyii vnyanya jesnu n əho ədui vnyanya.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Dəye nu zhni kpmisnuyi jesnu ɓəgbetu dudui. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Njesnu baayi wulo ngye əkwo nu: ‘Ye əho kwnuzhiyi ngye əhohni.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Owa vnyanya n Sheɓəgwognayi nyawui, ɓa kpəlo ń aɓəgbetu ngwnu-aba ye nu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓənya ntu əza ɓo n wo zhni Masifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Shi Afarisiyii ɓə la yezhi, Yeisu wa nya ɓa əɓo, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Fye zhni ɓənubwo lo nge nanu ntu Kirisiti ɓo a? Wo zhni nyika nugwnu nu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Dawuda nugwnu nu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Wa gna ɓa, “Knyiyi nu zhni Dawuda, woi daɓo dna n Zafnu, wa yì wo ‘Dagayi a’? Ntuge wo ɓə gna,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“ ‘Dagayi ɓə gna əmi Dagayi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">“La sasetu n əmi ɓwaizhe ɓwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">nya əsa ń mi ɓə kwu əho anuwnuyi fyi n əho apitabwada snuta.” ’<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Ngye Dawuda ɓə yi wo ‘Dagayi,’ kwo ɓa zè n wunanu waa zhni əwo nugwnu a?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Əzaho to ɓə dna wo ɓədagbma ɓəgbe m, tunyi n wyiyii kwoi lo abye, əzaho to ɓə shna myi wa je wo əɓəho nya m.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Kwnukwnù ntu n kwocedna ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna deeji ɓədo n əwo amwutuyii: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Owa anyawuyi n Afarisiyii ɓa sase kpe ń Mwusa shnikpegye nu. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Ntulonu kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu fya zhni pəceye, fya zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi ń ɓa gna fye. Ama fye to zhni əɓo ń ɓa zhni nyi m, ntuge ɓa ta zhni əɓo nu ń ɓa wu kwo nyi m. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Ɓa pa akaya adnagbmai ashnawoi kpe ń azaje aɓwapa, ama əɓahni ɓa ta ye ɓa la ɓwanyi wu ɓa ce kwo əɓwa m.<verse eid="MAT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />“Ɓəhoɓəhoi ń ɓa zhni, ɓa zhni kwo nge aza ɓa gye kwo əwye nu: ɓa ka owaɓəda aya fyi ń əpa, ɓa kwu kwo wna ń nyikwnumi jesnu ɓa zhni əɓa ajekpegbe ń mwakpa; <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />ɓa ye aseseba ayaakwo ń awyefnaba, jesnu aseseba dnagbmai ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu; <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />ɓa ye gnaɓyi n mwamwagai ń adubayaakwo jesnu aza ɓa yi ɓa nge, ‘Rabyi.’<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />“Ama əzaho to lo n əfye n a ɓa yi wo nge ‘Rabyi’ m, ntuge fye ń Nyawuyii ɓwasnu lo gbmanyi nu, jesnu əfye vnyanya fye zhni fyehnifyehni nu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Njesnu fye to yi zahozahoyi ń anyì nge, ‘dada’ m ntuge fye ń Dadai ɓwasnu lo gbmanyi nu; ń wo dna ń əshemi nyi. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Kwo ge a yi fye nge aɓəgbegayi m, ntuge Ɓəgbegayi ɓwasnu lo gbmanyi nu, Kirisiti. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Əza duduyi ń əfye atasni, wo ɓaa zè əfye tnutnuyi nu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Ntuge aza yi n ɓa mwa əɓahni tukwo nyi, a ɓə gbà ɓa, jesnu aza yi n ɓa gbà əɓahni tukwo nyi, a ɓə mwa ɓa.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Owii ngwnu-tnaaba kpe n owa anyawuyi n Afarisiyii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Owii ń əfye aba, owa anyawuyi ɓədo n Afarisiyii, əfye akwocednayi! Fye gwu əshebemi abwokwnumi ń aza awyeba. Əfye ń fyehni, fye too lofyi m, fye nyi ta fa azaje lo n ɓa ye ɓa lo nyi, nge ɓa lofyi m. [<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Owii ń əfye aba, owa anyawuyi n Afarisiyii, əfye akwocednayi! Fye losa anyigbayi n əɓa pwuwa fyei gyi ɓa ɓwakwolo jesnu fyei zhniaduwa n mwakpa nabai fya pwu aza awyeba. Ntucenu a ɓə ga fye tata n du azaje nya.]<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Owii ń əfye aba, owa anyawuyi ɓədo n Afarisiyii, əfye akwocednayi! Fye znazna n kpaayii lo əknyido jesnu fya piya n shikwo, nabai fya ɓwa abwuyeyi gbmanyi, shi fye la ɓwa, fya wo zè anápyi əɓyi n bmatu aɓwa aba ngye shi fye wu nyi.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Owii ń əfye aba, azokwowúyi awyebwayi! Fye gna, ‘N əzaho wa sí nyasi n Dagayipwuwai, kwo to zhni nyaho nu m; ama əzaho wa sí nyasi n zinali Dagayipwuwa nyai, wo la əwohni pa n nyasi yii.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Əfye awyebwayi amama! Knyidei nu zhni duduyi lo a: zinali nu, kwo Dagayipwuwa, ń əkwo nu n zinalii zè gyigyiyi nyi a? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Fye je gna, ‘Ngye əza wa sí nyasi n bəgədii, kwo to zhni nyaho nu m; ama əza n wa sí nyasi n nyagai ń kwo tu ń bəgədi nyi, wo papai lo n nyasi yii.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Əfye awyebwayi! Knyidei nu gnadu lo a: nyaga nu, kwo bəgədi ń kwo zhni nyaga kwa zè gyigyiyi nyi a? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Ntucenu, əza ń wa sí nyasi ń bəgədii, wo sí nyasi n əkwoi nu, jesnu n nyahonyahoii ń kwo tu lo ń əkwo. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Njesnu əza n wa sí nyasi n Dagayipwuwai, wo sí nyasi n əzai nu ń wo dna n kwo nyi. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Njesnu əza ń wa sí nyasi n əshemii, wo sí nyasi ń Shekwoyi əbeshnikpegyei nu ɓədo ń əza yii n wo sasetu ń kwo nyi.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Owii ń əfye aba, owa anyawuyi ɓədo n Afarisiyii, əfye akwocednayi! Fye ga zaka anyàgba nya: afnyitolo snidaí, dilli n kwumin nyai. Ama fye kwu aɓo gnadui owa nya ya: owafyecei, snusnugye n ɓəgbenui. Fye ɓə ɓa kwu kpmasnui nu zhni kpa, to fya ze akwokwoi amwi m. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Əfye azokwowúyi awyebwayi! Fye gwo papala ya, ama fya myi lakwnumi.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Owii ń əfye aba, owa anyawuyi ɓədo n Afarisiyii, əfye akwocednayi! Fye zhna bwoɓyi ya n shnapa ɓyiyii n əbmyi, ama əkwo əmì n nunui lo n fnanai ɓədo n nayi aɓəyezhnii. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Farisiyi wyebwayi! N kpmisnui, la bwoɓyi n shnapai zhnaya n əkwo əmì, nlonu ń əbmyi ɓaa gnyi n gyigyiyi ce.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Owii ń əfye aba, owa anyawuyi ɓədo n Afarisiyii! Əfye akwocednayi! Fye wulo ngye avnyigwo nu n ɓa n pyenti bwuibwuii pmya n bmyabmyai n əbmyi, ama ń əkwo əmi ń nunui n azafyí asnukwnui jesnu anya atnagyii dəhodəhoii. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />N ɓwasnu nlonu cè, fye wulo n əbmyi ngye aza aɓəfyeceyi nu ama ń əmi, fye nunui lo n kwocednai jesnu n əkpízhnii.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Owii ń əfye aba, owa anyawuyi ɓədo n Afarisiyii, əfye akwocednayi! Fye mi sheaɓəgwognayi avnyigwo, jesnu fya zhni aɓəfyeceyi avnyigwo aba. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Njesnu fyei gna, ‘Yi ɓə gna ya gyianyì ń əyi azakwoyi əsa nu, yi to ɓə ɓa dnaɓwado n əɓai, n ɓa ze sheaɓəgwognayi ami ya nyi m.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ntulonu, fye gbmiɓo tu əfyehni nu, nge fye zhni aza yi ayawyi nu ń ɓa ɓə wu sheaɓəgwognayi nyi. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Akpəge fye gwodu, fya zo əɓo ń əfye azakwoyi ɓə la ya nyi!<verse eid="MAT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />“Əfye awa! Əfye agbezhi aɓyi! Fye ɓə pwó knyiznu owa nya n wunanu dna n anápyi a? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Ntucenu mi tnu fye lo n sheaɓəgwognayii, jesnu n awyemwayi n anyawuyii. Azaho ń əɓa mi, fye ɓə kwú ɓa wu; jesnu fyei znu ɓa du; azaje fyei gyínaya fyi ń Ayahudiyibwokwnu jesnu fyei nya ɓa laɓa fyi n azhimi. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Ntulonu aɓəfyeceyi ami vnyanya, ń a la zeya kpe ń əknyi nyi, ɓa ɓə zo kpe ń əfye nu, ənya ń kwo laka ń Habyila ɓəfyeceyi ami kwoi lo Zakariya Berekiya nugwnu ami, ń fye ɓə wu wo dna ń dagayipwuwa atasni n bəgədii nyi. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, aɓo ye vnyanya ɓə ɓe kpe ń cala ye nu.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Urishelima, Urishelima, əho ń ho wu sheaɓəgwognayi jesnu hoi she aza yi akwuta, ń a tnu ho ncei nyi, aɓwá aknyii nu ń mi yi əmihni ma ye əho aɓyi zhi n aba gbmanyi, shi pise ye əkwo aɓyi fyi n əkwo aɓwase nyi, ama ho ta ye lo m. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Shiawye, a la əho pwuwa fa gnyi ho n gbəloii. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Ntuge əmi nu gna fye, fye taa je mi wyegye m, sai əsa n fye ɓə gna, ‘Anabəlikada nu n əwoi n wo ɓe dna n Dagayi əye nyi.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Aznù əsa kpmaknayi nya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yeisu wa fa Dagayipwuwa woi lo woi znazna, əwo amwutuyi ɓa ɓe da wo ntuge ɓa wu wo shi kwo n anyakwnui safyi lo. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Wa nyaɓo, “Fye gye anya ye əwye lo vnyanya? Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, kwuta gbmanyi ho to lo ń kwo ɓə ce tu ń ədo she m; a ɓə la dəhodəhoi shniya shi n əknyi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Shi Yeisu ɓə sasetu n Zaitu Əpe, amwutuyi ɓa ɓe da wo fyaa. Ɓa gna, “Gna yi, aɓo ye ɓə zhni n knyi əsai nu, jesnu knyiyi nu ɓə zhni əznù əho ɓeɓe nya ń anyìzo nyai a?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye la əwyewna nabai to əzaho wa dna fye kwoce m. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Ntuge bəgyé ɓə ɓe dna n əmi əye, ɓai gna, ‘Əmi nu zhni Kirisiti,’ jesnu ɓa ɓə dna bəgyé kwoce. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Fye ɓə wo okwnusnu nabagyi, jesnu ń okwnusnu aɓoi ń lìya, ama fye to ɓə ye dəye kwoi kwu əfye abwugbakala m. Ɓəshishi nu aɓo ye pya ɓai zhni, ama anyìzo ye ɓeɓelo. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Əbye ɓə laka da əbye, jesnu əbemi ɓə laka da əbemi. Myikwnu kəsnui ɓəə gwnu jesnu əknyi ɓəə jeashna kwoi sofyi n aba gbowogbowo. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Aɓo ye vnyanya nu zhni əɓyima nyasna yaya.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Nlonu a ɓə kwu fye ga fyi ń aza akwnu, ai she fye əwyena, ai wu fye, jesnu abye vnyanya ɓə wnu fye ənu ntu ń əmi ɓo. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />N əsayii nu ń bəgyé ɓə pmyiawyeya ń gaiciyaganunui, ɓai ɓwuaje jesnu ɓai wnunu n ajei. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Sheaɓəgwognayi katái n mwabəgyé ɓə kwnuɓe ɓai fyi aza bəgyé kwoce. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Ntu ń əkpízhni mwamwa ɓo, aza bəgyé əɓa yeyewu ɓə kwu fuse, <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />ama əza ń wa myignyi nyalo azoba wo ɓə la pwo. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Njesnu a ɓə zhni nabagyi manai əbemi nya ye waazi n anyì vnyanya ngye ɓəgbmi ga abye vnyanya, nlonu, anyìzozo əsa ɓəə si.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Ntulonu she fye ɓə gye ‘əɓokasa n kwo ɓe n abalayai nyi, ń gnyiagnyi dna ń aba gyigyiyi,’ ədo ń sheɓəgwognayi Daninya ɓə da nyi, fa nyabayi wa ɓwa awyega <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />nlonu, fa aza ń ɓa fyi n Yahuda ɓə bwusi lo ape. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Əza n wo ɓə tu n əwo nyakwnusni tukwo, wo to ɓə kashi wa la nyaho ń əwo pwuwa m. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Əza n wo dnalo n bmana wo to ɓə jezelo apyi wo kwu əwo əjekpe m. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Anyipyei yi ɓə zhni ədna nya nu ń anubwoda aba n aɓyiya dai! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Fye zhniaduwa nabai ge əfye əsibwi to ɓə ɓe dna ń vnyinyikwo nu kwo n Sibyiwyi m. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Ntuge nsayii gnyagwnugnya ɓə ɓe, ədo ń kwo to n dəmwii lo m, n anyì yaya əsa kwoi ɓe nsayi ye m; jesnu a taa je kwo pya wyegye m kpeekpe.<verse eid="MAT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />“Ngye a to ɓəə gna a ce anyipyei yi ceya m, zaho to ɓə ɓa pwo m, ama ntu n aknyiknyiyi ɓo, a ɓə la anyipyei yi ceya. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Dna əsayii ń əzaho wa gna fye, ‘Shiawye, Kirisiti gnyi nyi ń ya!’ kwo ‘Wo gnyi nu!’ fye to ga kwo gaiciya m. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Ntuge amasifu akatá nya ɓədo n sheaɓəgwognayi katáii ɓa ɓə kwukazhi ɓai wu aznù, ɓai zhni aɓo wowoi nabai ɓai dna aza kwoce, n kwa ye zhni, du n aknyiknyiyii. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Gyewye, mi kwu gna fye to əsai si m.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Ntulonu n əza wa gna fye, ‘Wo dna gnyi nu n zhabwikawu,’ fye to kwnuya lo m; kwo, ‘Wo dna nyi ń nyakwnumi,’ fye to ga kwo gaiciya m. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Ngye shi əgbma bmyana kwoi kwnu ń kpəkwó a gye kwo pəipəi ń shnikwó nyi, nlonu Əza Nugwnu ɓə ɓe. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Abahobahoi n ənya fyifyiyi shi, ń abaayi nu ń agwulu yezhi.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“She gnyagwnugnya anyipyei yi nya ɓə zo duduya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">“ ‘Nyipyei ɓə la dna wyegbma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">jesnu əpya to ɓə je əkwo bwuznagna ga m;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">akpasi ɓə kaya ń anyìbmana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">jesnu anya n ɓa kpe n anyìbmana ɓa ɓə jeashna.’<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />“Nlonu n əznù Əza Nugwnu nya ɓə gbmiɓe n əshemi. Nlonu aza vnyanya n anyì ɓa ɓə zhni bwugbazhiizhii əsa n ɓa ɓə gye Əza Nugwnu woi ɓe dna n ənyì əshebmana nya, n kalái jesnu n latu yaakwoi. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Wo ɓə tnu n əwo amaləkai ɓai bye knaknaci n əɓwi yaakwoi, jesnu ɓai ye əwo aza aknyiknyiyi zhi n anyì awyepmyi asəpa ngwnu-anyi, ənya n kwo laka n anyiceshiba gbmanyi kwoi lo anyiceshiba ədo.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Nsaiye fye tu əɓəye mwi n gbaayi shnuwna; əsa n fya gye kwoi kpmi akwo, jesnu kwoi ci afnyitolo, fya kwu kpe nge gbmama n la wo vyivyiwyi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Ntulonu, she fye ɓə gye aɓo ye vnyanya, fya kwu kpe nge əsa n la wo vyivyiwyi nu, n gnyi ń abwokwnumi əgbe. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, cala ye taa duya m akpəge aɓo ye vnyanya ɓa kwu zhni. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Əshe ń əknyii ɓa ɓə la duya, ama əmi aɓədagbma taa duya m nanyinanyi.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A ta kpé nyipyei əye lo n əsai m</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Ama ntu ń nyipyei yi ɓo kwo əsa, əzaho ta kpe əkwo əye lo m, kwo amaləka ń ɓa fyi n əshemi nyi, kwo Nugwnu m, akpəge Dada nu ɓwasnu gbmanyi. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Ngye shi kwo ɓə nyì ń Nuhu anyipyei, nlonu ń kwo ɓə snu n əwyii ń Əza Nugwnu ɓə jezeɓe nyi. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Ntuge fyi n anyipyei yi, to nuwnai kwnu-akpma m, aza ɓə laɓa ɓai gyi, ɓai sni, ɓai pa amwula jesnu ɓai kna amwula, nya nyipyei ń Nuhu ɓə lodna ncei n əya nuwnanya; <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />jesnu ɓa to ɓə kpe ɓəhoɓəhoi əye ń kwo ɓə ye kwa zhni m, nya əsa ń nuwna kpmakwnu ɓə ɓe kwaa ɓa kwuya vnyanya. Kwo ɓə ɓwa wu nlonu ń Əza Nugwnu ɓeɓe. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Aza ɓə kpe n ofwa ngwnu-aba; a ɓə knyí gbmanyi ai ce gbmanyi tu. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Anyikwoza ngwnu-aba ɓə fyi ɓai gwowyi ń tagwowyi; a ɓə la zaknayi ai fa gbmanyi dna.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />“Ntucenu fye kwu zhigwu, ntuge fye ta kpe nyipyei əye lo ń əfye Dagayi ɓə ɓe ncei m. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Ama fye ɓwa ɓəye awyega: Ngye pwuwada ɓəə gna wa kwu kpe əsa ń əvyì ɓa ɓe dna ń sukwo yi, wo ɓə ɓa gnyigwu to wa ye ge a lofyi m. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ntulonu əfyenyi ce, fye kwu zhi n əfyehnii yeyei, ntuge Əza Nugwnu ɓə ɓe n əsai nu ń fye to n əwo əɓoi dnalo m.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“To, nyikanu zhni tnutnuyi ceceyi n gbenuyi, n əwo dagayi wo kwu atnutnuyi əwo pwuwa nya fa fyi ń əwo akwnu wa ga ɓa nyagyi n əkwo əsai a? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Kwo ɓə la zhni əɓo manai nu n tnutnuyi aba ń əwo dagayi ɓə jezezhi wa gye wo gnyi woi vyi əwo əɓəgbetu. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Ɓəhnihni əmi nu gna fye, wo ɓə kwu əwo nyaɓwa vnyanya fyi n wo akwnu. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Ama ngye n tnutnuyi əkpizhniyi nu, wa gna əwohni, ‘Əmi dagayi ń kwu kalala zhni n jezezhii,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />nlonu wa ya woi lu əwo atnutnuyi aje jesnu woi gyi woi sni n ajesniyi. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Tnutnuyi dagayi ɓə jezeɓe n əwyii ń wo to n əwo əɓoi dnalo m, jesnu n əsai ń wo ta dnace lo m. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Wo ɓə ce wo ya wyiwowyiwo jesnu woi la wo yadna nkwnusnu n akwocednayi, aba ń a ɓə ciɓwi jesnu ai gyi anyikna.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi aɓyinyikwoi akwului ngwnu-awo nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Dna n əsa yi, əshebemi ɓə wu ngye aɓyinyikwoi akwului ngwnu-awo nu, ń ɓa ɓə kwú əɓa apyitila ɓa kwnuya lo ɓai shegwnu mwulaɓa. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Ngwnu-atnu fyi ń ɓa, ɓa ɓə zhni amama nu jesnu ngwnu-atnu aza aceceyi. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Amama ɓa kwú əɓa apyitila, ama to ɓa shna omi kwushi n aluúluú m. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Ama aza ceceyi, ɓa ɓə ń omii shi n aluúluúi n kwnusnu n əɓa apyitilai. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Mwulaɓa wa kwu kalala zhni n ɓei, əɓa vnyanya, ɓa kwu zhi n agyeawyei, jesnu ɓa kwu wnagye.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Dna n sukwo sadu, a dnawyi: ‘Gye mwulaɓa ɓe nyi! Fye kwnuɓe fya shegwnu wo!’<verse eid="MAT 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />“Nlonu aɓyinyikwoi akwului vnyanya ɓa kwnu-agyewyi ɓa ɓe əɓa apyitila əná. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Amama ɓa gna aceceyi, ‘Fye ce əfye omi ga yi; əyi apyitila wnuna lo.’<verse eid="MAT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />“Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Aawo. Kpesnu əmi taa kwnu əyi n kwnusnu ń fyei ɓe m. Ntucenu, fye lo da aza yi ń ɓa kwnú omi nyi, fye si ga əfyehni.’<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />“Ama əsa n ɓa ɓə lo n zokwo ɓə si omi, mwulaɓa wa ɓe. Aɓyinyikwoi n ɓa ɓə zhi n əɓahnii yeyei nyi, ɓa lofyi n kwnusnu n woi n mwula awyefna nyakwnu. Nlonu aa kpakwo gwu.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Əsa fyewyi aza yi ce ɓa ɓe. Ɓa gna, ‘Dagayi, Dagayi, gwu yi aba ya!’<verse eid="MAT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />“Ama wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Ɓəhnihnii, əmi nu gna fye, mi ta kpe fye əye lo m.’<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />“Ntucenu fye kwu zhigwu ń awyeiwna, ntuge fye ta kpe nyipyei əye lo kwo əsa m.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəsisi zinali agwnuma nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />“Njesnu, kwo ɓə wu ngye əza nu, ń wo ɓə gnyi woi lo əzna, wa yì əwo atnutnuyi, wa kwu əwo nyaɓwa fyi ń əɓa akwnu. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Wa ga zagbmanyi azinali agwnuma ngwnu-atnu, zagbmanyi wa ga agwnuma ngwnu-aba, jesnu əzado gwnuma gbmanyi; zahozahoyi ngye shi əwo kalá ɓá mi. Nlonu wa lo wo əzna. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Əza n wo ɓə gwo zinali agwnuma ngwnu-atnu nyi, wa laka n əsagbmanyi wa ya aɓwaze n əwo gyiwyei, jesnu wa gyi gyiba agwnuma ngwnu-atnu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Ntulonu, əza ń wo ɓə n agwnumai ngwnu-aba nyi, wa gyi gyiba agwnuma ngwnu-aba cè. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Ama əza n wo ɓə gwo gwnuma gbmanyi nyi, wa laka, wa nyi ɓwokwnu n əknyi, waa əwo dagayi gyiwye sodna.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Shi əsa ɓə la mwa, atnutnuyi yi dagayi, wa jezezhi wa gwo əɓa anyadokwu. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Əza ń wo ɓə gwo zinali agwnuma ngwnu-atnu nyi, wa ɓe n agwnuma ngwnu-atnu ajei. Wa gna, ‘Əmi dagayi, ho ɓə ga mi zinali agwnuma ngwnu-atnu. Gyewye, mi kwu gyiba gyi ɓe agwnuma ngwnu-atnu.’<verse eid="MAT 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />“Əwo dagayi wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Gəizha n mwa, tnutnuyi manai gbenuyi! Ho kwu əgbe nu ń anya fyewyi n a ɓə ga ho nyi; mi ɓa kwu anya bəgyé fyi n əho akwnu. Ɓe ha nya agbmada n kwnusnu n əho dagayii!’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Əza ń wo ɓə gwo zinali agwnuma ngwnu-aba nyi, wa ɓe ce, wa gna, ‘Əmi dagayi, ho ɓə ga mi zinali agwnuma ngwnu-aba nu; gyewye, mi kwu gyiba gyi ɓe agwnuma ngwnu-aba.’<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />“Əwo dagayi wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Gəizha n mwa, tnutnuyi manai gbenuyi! Ho kwu əgbe nu ń anya fyewyi n a ɓə ga ho nyi; mi ɓa kwu anya bəgyé fyi n əho akwnu. Ɓe ha nya agbmada n kwnusnu n əho dagayii!’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Nlonu əza ń wo ɓə gwo zinali gwnuma gbmanyi nyi, wa ɓe. Wa gna, ‘Dagayi, mi kpəlo nge əho əɓo dnaɓo. Ho kwu afwaakaya aba ń ho to ɓə bye m, jesnu hoi ye afwaakaya zhi aba ń ho to ɓə bye m. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Ntulonu ma wodna, ma lo maa əho zinali sodna ń əknyi. Gyewye, ənya nu nyi n kwo zhni əho nya.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Əwo dagayi wa dnaɓəgbe, ‘Əho tnutnuyi əkpizhniyi, ɓwatoyi! Ashee ho ɓə kpəlo nge mi kwu afwaakaya aba ń mi to ɓə bye m, jesnu ma ye afwaakaya zhi aba ń mi to ɓə bye m? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />She ho ɓə kpe nlonu nyi, ho ɓə ɓa kwu əmi gyiwye ga fyi n gyiwye aɓwazeyi akwnu nabai əsa n mi ɓə jezezhi, mii gwo kwo n gyibai tu.<verse eid="MAT 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />“ ‘Ntulonu fye la zinali gwnuma yi gwo ń əwo akwnu, fyaa kwo ga əza n wo n agwnumai lo ngwnu-awo nyi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Ntuge zahozahoyi n wo ncei lo, a ɓə la ɓe wo, nabai woi kwu ɓwa ɓwoye. Zahozahoyi ń wo to ncei lo m, kwo ədo ń wo ncei lo, a ɓə la kwo gwo wo. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Njesnu a ɓə la tnutnuyi tna-apmanyai shéya shi n əbmyi, dnalo ń wyegbma, aba ń a ɓə ciɓwi ai gyi anyikna.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aknyi n Abwui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“She Əza Nugwnu ɓə ɓe dna ń əwo latu n amaləkai vnyanya n kwnusnu ń woi, wo ɓə sasetu ń əwo əbeshnikpegye latuyi. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Abye vnyanya ɓə yezhi ń əwo abye, woi gnaɓaaje ngye shi naknayi tnu aknyi ya n abwui nyi. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Wo ɓə zhi aknyi n əwo ɓwaizhe jesnu abwui n əwo ɓwaipmi.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />“Nlonu Əsu ɓə gna aza yi n ɓa zhi n əwo ɓwaizhe nyi, ‘Fye ɓe, əfye ń əmi Dada wo kwu anabəlika kpe fye nyi; fye gwo əfye əgwú, əbemi n a ɓə zhni aba ga fye n anyì zhni əsa nyi. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Ntuge mi ɓə gnyi n myikwnui, fya ga mi nyagyi ma gyi, mi ɓə gnyi n nuwna myikwnui, fya ga mi nuwna ma sni, mi ɓə zhni zhiɓeyi jesnu fyaa mi gwo dna n əfye pwuwa, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />mi ɓə ye aje fya kwu aje kpe mi, nyasna kwa sna mi jesnu fya kwu mi wnakna, mi ɓə dna ń zhalu, fya kwu ɓe mi gnaɓyi.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Nlonu aɓəfyeceyi ɓə dna wo ɓəgbe, ‘Dagayi, yi ɓə gye ho n knyiwyii nu ń myikwnui ya ga ho nyagyi, kwo ń nuwna myikwnui ya ga ho nyaho ha sni a? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />N knyiwyii nu ń, yi ɓə gye ho n zhni zhiɓeyi ya gwo ho, kwo n gnyi ntna ajekpe jesnu ya ga ho ajekpe a? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />N knyiwyii nu ń yi ɓə gye ho gnyi n nyasnai kwo n dna ń zhalu ya ɓe ho gnaɓyi a?’<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />“Əsu ɓə dnaɓəgbe, ‘Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, nyahonyahoi n fye ɓə zhni ga əza gnagbai gbmanyi n əmi azaje ye n amapwii, fye ɓə zhni ga əmi nu.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Nlonu wo ɓə gna aza yi ń ɓa zhi n əwo ɓwaipmi nyi, ‘Fye la kwukala ń əmi aba, əfye aknyituyi, fye lofyi ń əná nyalonyalo nya n a ɓə zhni kwo ntu shetam ɓo n əwo amaləkai nyi. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Ntuge fye ɓə gye mi gnyi n myikwnui, to fya ga mi nyaho nge mi gyi m, mi ɓə gnyi n nuwna myikwnui, to fya ga mi nyaho nge mi sni m, <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />mi ɓə zhni zhiɓeyi, to fya gwo mi m, mi ɓə ye aje, to fya kpe mi aje m, mi ɓə dna n nyasnai, jesnu mi ɓə dna ń zhalu to fya ɓe mi gnaɓyi m.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Əɓa ce ɓa ɓə dnaɓəgbe, ‘Dagayi, n knyiwyii nu ń yi ɓə gye ho n gnyi n myikwnui kwo n nuwna myikwnui kwo n zhni zhiɓeyi kwo n aje əsnai kwo n nyasnai kwo ń dna n zhalu, to ya bma ho zhni ma a?’<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />“Wo ɓə dnaɓəgbe, ‘Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, ɓəhoɓəhoi ń fye to ɓə zhni ga zaknayi gnagbayi n aza ye m, fye to ɓə zhni kwo ga mi m.’<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />“Nlonu ɓa ɓə kwuka ɓa lo tata nyalonyalo nya, ama aɓəfyeceyi ɓa ɓə lo wyewyeyi nyalonyalo nya.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Kwúlupa tu n Yeisu tukwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />She Yeisu ɓə kwu aɓo ye zo da vnyanya, wa gna əwo amwutuyi, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Ngye shi fye kpəlo nyi, Gnanaznu awyefna kwo ɓwace anyipyei ngwnu-aba nu; jesnu a ɓə la Əza Nugwnu ga, ai la wo znudu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Nlonu apirisiti atukwoda n abyedai ɓa gwnudo zhi ń apirisiti dnagbmai galukwo, ń əwo əye nu ɓə nyi Kayafas nyi, <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />jesnu ɓa pa kwulu ɓa wna Yeisu fyaa ɓa wu wo. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Ɓa gna, “Ama toge dna ń awyefna sa ye m. Sakwnú gbuzui kwoi laka dna ń aza bəgyé.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A la Yeisu pmya n Byetani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yeisu woi ye dna n Byetani ń Sima Nayiwnuyi pwuwa, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />nyikwoza wa ɓe da wo n lúulúu əmisnidaí nakwoyii shi, wa zè kwo kpe n əwo tukwo, woi myima tu ń tebwul.<verse eid="MAT 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />She amwutuyi ɓə gye ɓəye, ɓa kwu zhi n kpukpurukpui. Ɓa nyaɓo, “Knyi nu zhni ai zhni ənya ye agbma a? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />A ɓə ɓa kwnu əmisnidaí ye n gyiwyei mwa, a ɓwa a ga awyekwoyi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yeisu wa kwu əɓa ɓənubwozhni kpeye, wa gna ɓa, “Knyiyi nu zhni fyei gna nyikwo ye gnagna a? Wo kwu əɓo bmyabmyai zhni ga mi. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Awyekwoyi n kwnusnu lo n fyei ciici, ama fye taa ɓwa əmi ciici m. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />She wa ze əmisnidaí ye kpe ń əmi nayi, wa zhni kwo woi la pita ntu əmi byibyi ɓo nu. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, abahobahoi ń a zhni waazi nabagyi manai ye nya vnyanya n anyì, əɓo n wo kwu zhni nyi a ɓə da kwo ɓo ai pá əwo ɓo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahuda la ye wa ɓwu Yeisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Nlonu zaknayi n Awoceaba; əwo n a ɓə yi ge Yahuda Iskariyoti nyi; wa lo da apirisiti tukwoda <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />wa nyaɓo, “Fye n knyiyi nu lo fya ga mi, ń ma dna fye wo n əfye akwnu a?” Nlonu ɓa ba azulufa shiita ga wo. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Ənya n kwo ɓə laka nsayii, Yahuda wa ya zokwo znashni shi wo ɓa ta wo ya ga ɓa.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dagayi wyeshe nyagyi kpmasnui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />N nyipyei kpmisnui Awyefna Biledi Tnayisti nya, amwutuyi ɓa ɓe da Yeisu, ɓa nyaɓo, “Ho ncei pma ya lo yii zhni Gnanaznu nyagyi gyi aba ga ho ń nanu a?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Fye lofyi n əzhiyaakwo, fya lo da əzaho fye gna wo, ‘Nyawuyi wa gna: Əmi əsa n a cei shi mi nyi, kwo la wo vyivyiwyi. Mi ye ma nya Gnanaznu agbmada nu n kwnusnu n əmi amwutuyii dna ń əho pwuwa.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Nlonu amwutuyi ɓa zhni shi Yeisu ɓə ga ɓa əgbe jesnu ɓaa zhni Gnanaznu nyagyi zhniaba shi.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />She wyeshe ɓə she, Yeisu waa sasetu ń myima n tebwul n kwnusnu n Awoceabai. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Ɓai kpe ɓai gyi nyagyi, wa gna, “Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, zaknayi n əfye wo ɓə ɓwu mi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Bwugba kwa wnu ɓa jesnu ɓa ya ɓai nya wo əɓo gbmanyigbmanyi, “Ɓəhnihni Dagayi, ho da əmi nu ɓo”?<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Əza ń wo la əwo əɓwa kwnudna n mii n əbwe nyi, əwo nu ɓa ɓwu mi. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Əza Nugwnu ɓa lo n ɓwasnu shi a ncei kafyilo ntu əwo ɓo nu. Ama owii n əza yii ń wo nu ɓwu Əza Nugwnu nyi! Kwo ɓəə ɓa wo du ngye to ai ma wo m.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Nlonu Yahuda, əza ń wo ɓə ye wa ɓwu wo nyi, wa gna, “Ɓəhnihni ho da əmi nu, Rabyi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ho kwu da lonu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Ɓai ye kpe ɓai gyi nyagyi, Yeisu wa la biledi, she wo ɓə kwu Shekwoyi saami, wa sa kwo ya jesnu wa ga əwo amwutuyi, woi gna, “Fye gwo fya gyi; dəye nu zhni əmi nayi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Nlonu wa la bwoɓyi, jesnu woi kwu Shekwoyi saami, wa ga ɓa kwo, woi gna, “Əfye vnyanya fye sni kwo. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Dəye nu zhni əmi ami ɓəgbeshi nya, ń a la zeya ntu ń bəgyé ɓo ntu ń aleifyi zo ɓo nyi. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Mi gna fye, mi to ɓə ye je anam wnunuyi gyigyii ye sni m; ənya n kwo laka nsaiye kwoi lo abye, akpəge n əwyi yii, ń mi ɓə sni kwo n woiwoyii n kwnusnu n fyei dna n əmi Dada əbemi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />She ɓa ɓə kwu anyí kwo, ɓa kwnuya ɓa lo Zaitu Əpe.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu pma Byitusu aɓəna əɓo da</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Nlonu Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Dna n sukwo ye, əfye vnyanya fye ɓə la myiya ntu n əmi ɓo, ntuge a kafyilo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">“ ‘Mi ɓə znu knyiknayi ənya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">jesnu aknyi gəluce ɓə la gnamyi.’<verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Ama shi mi ɓə la laka, mi ɓə la gyi lo n əfye abye lo Gəlili.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Byitusu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Kwo n aza vnyanya ɓa ɓə la myiya ntu ń əho ɓo, mi to ɓə myiya m, nanyinanyi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ɓəhnihni mi gna fye, dna ń sukwo ye, Pisenugba ɓə snu n kwo cekwu, hoi la əmi aɓəna, aɓwa ngwnu-ata.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Ama Byitusu wa gna, “Kwo n mi ɓa fyí nu n kwnusnu n hoi, mi taa na ho aɓo m, nanyinanyi.” Njesnu amwutuyi aje vnyanya ɓa ɓwa əɓo gbmanyigbmanyi nu da.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gesemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Nlonu Yeisu wa kwnulo n əwo amwutuyi aba n a ɓə yi ge Gesemani nyi, jesnu wa gna ɓa, “Fye kwu sase zhi n ya, ma zhnignyi n ɓwaayi mii zhniaduwa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Wa kwu Byitusu n kwnusnu n Zebədi anugwnui ngwnu-aba ɓa lo, jesnu wa ya bwugbawnu n azhnìgyei. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Nlonu wa gna ɓa, “Əmi wyewyeyi n nunui lo n bwugbawnui kwoi to n əfyii. Fye kwu zhi n ya, fya kwu zhigwu n kwnusnu n mii.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Wa ceta lo n abyei fyewyi, wa sheyazhi n awyebai wu n əknyi wa zhniaduwa, “Əmi Dada, ngye kwo ɓa yezhni, fa aa bwoɓyi azhnìgye nya ye gbmi n əmi akwnu. Dudulonu toge əmi ɓəye m, ama shi ho ye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Nlonu wa jezeɓe da əwo amwutuyi, wa gye ɓa zhi ɓai wnagye. Wa nya Byitusu əɓo, “Fye to myi fya kwu zhigwu n kwnusnu ń mii snukna gbmanyi m? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Fye kwu zhigwu jesnu fya zhniaduwa, nabai n fye taa lofyi n mwumwu m. Zafnu ncei ye lo, ama nayi ń gbakalá gbàgbài lo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Wa laka lo əɓwa baayi wa zhniaduwa, “Əmi Dada, ngye kwo taa yezhni a gbmi mi bwoɓyi azhnìgye nya ye n əmi akwnu m, sai ma sni kwo, akpəge əho ɓəye kwo zhni.”<verse eid="MAT 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />She wo ɓə jezeɓe, wa je ɓa wyegye n zhi ɓai wnagye, ntuge əɓa awye ɓə kwu woshna. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Ntulonu wa laka n əɓa aba jesnu wa lo wa zhniaduwa əɓwa taayi, woi ɓwa əɓo gbmanyigbmanyi nu da.<verse eid="MAT 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Nlonu wa jezelo da amwutuyi wa gna ɓa, “Fye ye zhi lo fyei wnagye nu jesnu fyei snu u? Fye shiawye, əsa la si, a la Əza Nugwnu taya dna n aleifyizhniyi akwnu. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Fye kwuka! Yii lo! Əmi ɓwuyi nu ɓə nu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A la Yeisu wna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yeisu wo ye gnyi woi daɓo, Yahuda, zaknayi ń Awoceaba yi, wa si n ɓo. Deeji yaakwo ɓa ɓe n əɓahnii pmapmai ń kwnusnu n woi n abeyaakwoi shi n abwusii, n apirisiti atukwoda ń abyedai ɓə tnu n ɓai nyi. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Nsayii əzaɓwuyi ɓəə la əznù wu ɓa: “Əza n fya gye ma shewna wo; əwo nu, fye wna wo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Ɓa lo da Yeisu n əsagbmanyii, Yahuda wa gna, “Gəizha, Rabyi!” Wa shewna wo.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Nugwnudo, zhni əɓo n kwa ɓe n hoi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Nlonu aza ɓa kwnu da wo, ɓa taɓwashi wo, ɓa wna wo. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />She Yeisu amwutuyi ɓə gye nlonu, zaknayi ń ɓa, wa wa əwo əbeyaakwo, wa znu pirisiti tukwoda tnutnuyi, waa tnubwa ka wo ya.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Yeisu wa gna wo, “La əho əbeyaakwo dna ń əkwo apwi. Ntuge zahozahoyi n wa zhniapma n əbeyaakwoi, wo ɓə fyí n əbeyaakwoi nu. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Ho zhninubwo lo nge mi taa myi ma yi əmi Dada, jesnu n əsagbmanyii wa tnu mi n amaləkai agwodo awoceabai nu m? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Ama kwo ɓa yezhni n wuna Anyakagyigyiyi ɓa nu, n ɓa da nge ɓəshishi nu ɓa zhni n zokwo ye a?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Nsayii Yeisu wa gna deeji, “Mi zhni kalákpei tukwoda nu, n fye gnyi fyei ɓe da mi n abeyaakwoi n abwusii, fya wna mi i? Nyipyei dəhodəhoi mi ɓə zhni maa sase dna n kwnusnu n fyei n Dagayipwuwa ashilagyí, mii wunya, ama to fya wna mi m. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Ama adəye ɓə zhni lonu nabai sheaɓəgwognayi anyaka ɓa nú nu.” Nlonu amwutuyi vnyanya ɓa fa wo, jesnu ɓa bwusi.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu gnyi n Sahindiri abye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Aza yi n ɓa ɓə wna Yeisu nyi, ɓa lo n woi ń Kayafas pirisiti dnagbmai aba, aba n owa anyawuyi n abyedai ɓəə la yezhi nyi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Ama Byitusu wa lo woi vyi wo ń tagnyi, waa si pirisiti dnagbmai bwokwnu ashilagyí. Wa lodna waa kwnu sasetu n abagwuyii, nabai wa gye əɓo ń kwo ɓa zhni.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Apirisiti atukwoda n Sahindiri abwokwnudai vnyanya ɓa zna ɓəgyi katá nya shni tu ń Yeisu nabai ɓa wu wo. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Ama to ɓa ɓwa dəho m, kwo shikwonyi aɓəkwnuyi akatá nya bəgyé ɓə la kwnuzhi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:60">N kpmasnu, aza ngwnu-aba ɓa kwnuzhi <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />jesnu ɓa gna, “Əza ye ɓə gna, ‘Mi ɓa myì maa Dagayipwuwa Shekwoyi nya ye myiya, jesnu ma je kwo mi dna ń anyipyei ngwnu-ata.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Nlonu Pirisiti dnagbmai wa laka gnyi wa gna Yeisu, “Ho taa dnaɓəgbe m? Knyi ɓəgbmi nu n aza ye gbmi tu n əho tukwo nyi a?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Ama Yeisu waa gnyi pyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:63">Pirisiti dnagbmai wa gna, “Mi gna ho dna ń nyasi n Shekwoyi wyewyeyidai: Gna yi ngye əho nu zhni Masifu, Shekwoyi Nugwnu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ho kwu da lonu. Ama mi gna fye, əfye vnyanya: Ənya ń kwo laka nsaiye kwoi lo n abyei, fye ɓə gye Əza Nugwnu ń sasetu ń Dagayi ikwo Duduyi ɓwaizhe ɓwa jesnu woi ɓe n tu ń anyì əshebmana nya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Nsayi pirisiti dnagbmai wa sa əwo əjekpe ya jesnu wa gna, “Wo kwu tukwopmi ɓəda da! Yi shna knyi ɓəgbmiyi nu ye a? Shiawye, nsayi fye kwu tukwopmi ɓəda wo. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Fye zhninubwo lo nge nanu a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Wo kwnuce lo n əfyii.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Nlonu nu ɓa knyiaknyi kpe ń əwo awyeba jesnu ɓa lu wo n akwnui. Azaje ɓa knyi wo agnai apmi <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />jesnu ɓa gna “Da sheɓəgwogna ga yi, Masifu, nyika nu na znu ho ənya a?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byitusu na Yeisu aɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Nsayii Byitusu ɓə sase dna ń ashilagyí, ɓyinyikwoi tnutnuyi wa ɓe da wo. Wa gna, “Əhohni ce ho ɓə kwnusnu n Yeisu Gəliliyi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Ama wa naɓo ń aza abye vnyanya. Wa gna, “Mi ta kpe əɓo əye lo n ho gnyi hoi da m.”<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Nlonu wa gbmiya lo abwokwnumi, aba ń ɓyinyikwoi tnutnuyi ədo ɓə gye wo, wa gna aza n ɓa ɓə zhi abaayi nyi: “Əza ye ɓə kwnusnu n Yeisui Nazeretiyi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Wa je aɓəna n nyasísii: “Mi ta kpe əza ye əye lo m!”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Əsa snu fyewyi, aza n ɓa ɓə gnyiagnyi zhi n ɓo, ɓa lo da Byitusu ɓa gna, “Ɓəhnihni ho zhni gbmanyi nu dna n ɓa; əho nyitala aɓəda kwo la ho kná.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Nlonu wa ya aknyi yi kpe əwohni, jesnu wa sí nyasi ga ɓa, “Mi ta kpe əza ye əye lo m!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">N əsagbmanyii pisenugba kwa cekwu. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Nlonu Byitusu wa pá ɓədagbma ń Yeisu ɓəə kwu da. “Pisenugba ɓə snu n kwo cekwu, hoi la əmi aɓo na aɓwa ngwnu-ata.” Njesnu wa gbmiya lo əbmyi wa ciɓwi bwugbazhii nya.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yahuda gyi əwohni tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />N labmilabmii, apirisiti atukwoda vnyanya n abyedai ɓa pakwúlu shi ɓa ɓá wu Yeisu n wú. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Ntulonu ɓa pa wo, ɓa gbmiya lo n woi jesnu ɓaa wo taya ga Gwomna Byilatusu.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Shi Yahuda, əza n wo ɓə ɓwu wo nyi, ɓə gye nge a la əfyi owa znutu Yeisu, bwugba kwa wnu wo dəidəi, wa jezelo n azulufa shiitai ga apirisiti tukwoda n abyedai. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Wa gna, “Mi kwu leifyi zhni, ntuge mi la əza ɓwu n əwo ami to n ɓəgyii lo m.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Yii gye əyi anuwna a? Dəye ce əho ɓəzhnizhni nu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Nlonu Yahuda wa she agyiwye yi ya zhi n Dagayipwuwa wa laka. Nlonu wa lo waa əwohni gyitu.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Apirisiti atukwoda ɓa kwu gyiwye azhnanai ɓa gna, “Owa to ncei ye lo ge a ya gyiwye ye fyi n nyaɓwasofyiba m, shikwonyi kwo zhni ami gyiwye nu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ntulonu ɓa kwu gbegwnu, ɓa zhniapma n gyiwye yii ɓa si shakwnumiyi əknyi, ɓaa kwo zè avnyigwo azhiɓeyi abyi ba. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Cenuzhni ai yi abaayi nge Əknyi Ami nya, nya n naiye. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Nlonu əɓo n sheɓəgwognayi Irimyiya ɓə da nyi, kwa kwu nu: “Ɓa kwu azulufa azhnanai shiita, gyiwye əwo kwnúkwnú nya n Israila aza ɓə znutu n əwo tukwo, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />jesnu ɓa si shakwnumiyi əknyi, ngye shi Dagayi ɓə tu mi əgbe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu gnyi n Byilatusu abye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Əsa fyewyi Yeisu wa gnyiagnyi n gwomna abye, jesnu gwomna wa nya wo əɓo, “Əho nu zhni Ayahudiyi əsu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Wa dnaɓəgbe, “Ho kwu da lonu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />She apirisiti atukwoda n abyedai ɓə tu wo əɓo lonu, to wa dnaɓəgbe m. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Nlonu Byilatusu wa nya wo əɓo, “Ho ta wo ɓəgbmi ye lo n ɓa ɓe ncei tu n əho tukwo nyi m?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Ama to Yeisu wa dnaɓəgbe m; kwo tu n ɓətu gbmanyi m, kwaa zè ɓəwowoi yaakwo n gwomna aba.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />N əsayii kwo ɓə zhni Gwomna kwnunu nu, ń awyefna əsa yi, wa lo zhaluda ya n deeji la knyi nyi. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Dna n əsayii, ɓa ɓə n zhaluda tawoɓoi, ai kpe wo ye, n wnadna n zhalu, ai yi əwo nge Barabas. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ntulonu she deeji ɓəə la yezhi, Byilatusu wa nya ɓa əɓo, “Nyika nu n fye ye a loya ga fye a: Barabas kwo Yeisu n a yi Kirisiti nyi a?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Ntuge wo ɓə kwu kpe ge shewo nu ɓə zhni ɓa, ɓaa Yeisu dna n əwo akwnu.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Əsa n Byilatusu ɓə sasetu n owada shnikpegye, əwo nyikwo wa tnu wo n ɓəda yei: “To zhni ɓəhoɓəhoi tu ń tnaɓətuyi ye tukwo m, ntuge mi kwu azhnì yaakwo gyewye n naiye n ənanu ntu n əwo əɓo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Ama apirisiti atukwoda n abyedai ɓa tna deejii aɓwa nge ɓa nya Barabas nu ɓo jesnu nge a la Yeisu wu.<verse eid="MAT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Gwomna wa nyaɓo, “Nyika nu n aza ngwnu-aba ye n fye ncei pma a loya ga fye a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Ɓa dnaɓəgbe əɓa vnyanya, “Barabas.”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Byilatusu wa nya, “Knyiyi nu n mi ɓa zhni, nsayi, n Yeisui, n a yi Kirisiti nyi a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Əɓa vnyanya ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “A la wo Znudu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Byilatusu wa nyaɓo, “Ntu n knyiɓei a? Knyi əɓogalai nu n wo kwu zhni a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Ama ɓa ɓəwyi əɓa vnyanya n əgbei latu, “A la wo znudu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />She Byilatusu ɓə gye nge ɓəda ye taa si n woi n ɓwaho m, ama n əkwoɓwi ɓa ya wyiɓe, wa la nuwna, wa na əwo aɓwa n bəgyé abye. Wa gna, “Əmi aɓwa to fyilo n za ye ami ɓo m. Əfye ɓəzhnizhni nu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Aza vnyanya ɓa dnaɓəgbe, “Əwo ami ɓa la tu n əyi ɓədo n əyi aɓyii!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Nlonu wa lo Barabas ya ga ɓa. Ama wa zhni a ɓye Yeisu ya, jesnu waa wo taya ga ɓa, a lo ə la wo znudu.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akwnuyi kpe Yeisu agyè</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Nlonu Gwomna akwnuyi, ɓa la Yeisu lo ncei n bwokwnu jesnu ɓa ye akwnuyi zhi vnyanya ɓa kwu shekna əwo. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Ɓa kpma wo aje ya jesnu ɓa kpe wo əje-byeibyei kpadalai, <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />nlonu ɓa pmyi fnunyi aknawui nya ɓaa kwo kwnu wo n tukwo. Ɓa dna wo bwusi n əwo ɓwaizhe. Nlonu ɓa knyiakwokwo zhi n əwo abye, ɓa kpe wo agyè. Ɓai gna, “Haamwasa, əsu Ayahudiyi nya!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Ɓa knyiaknyí kpe wo, jesnu ɓa la bwusi ɓa znu wo n tukwo, ɓai bmakpe-bmakpe. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Shi ɓa ɓə kwu agyè zo wo kpe, ɓa kpma wo əje-kpadalai ya, ɓa kpe wo əwohni aje. Nlonu ɓa lo n woi ə lo wo znudu.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu znuznudu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />She ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai kwnuya lo, ɓa gye əza woi gbmi n Sireni, ai yi wo ge Sima, ɓa tu wo znudu n akalái. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Ɓa si abaho ai yi ge Gwolgwota (n kwo nu gyi nge “Tukwobwe aba”). <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />N abaayi ɓa ga Yeisu anamnuwna nge wo sni, n gbmiaje n bədobədoi; ama shi wo ɓə la kwo towo, to wa ye kwo sni ɓo m. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />She ɓa ɓə la wo znudu, ɓa gna əwo aje n əbashei. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Ɓa kwu sase zhi, ɓai shi wo awye n abaayi. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Tu n əwo tukwo əshe, ɓa kwu əwo ɓəgyi kakpe ɓaa kwo gyitu:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MAT 27:37">Yeisu nu nyi,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MAT 27:37">Ayahudiyi Əsu.<verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />A kwu akalákpeyi ngwnu-aba znudu kpe n kwnusnu n woi, gbmanyi n ma n əwo ɓwaizheɓwa jesnu gbmanyi n ma n əwo ɓwaipmiɓwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Aza yi n ɓa ɓə duya n səpai, ɓa knyi wo akpmi, ɓai myi atukwo, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />jesnu ɓai gna, “Əho n ho ɓa la Dagayipwuwa ya jesnu ha mi kwo dna n anyipyei ngwnu-ata, gnyi əhohni! Kashi ɓe n znudu, ngye ho zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu nu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />N ɓwasnu nlonu apirisiti atukwoda, ɓədo n owa anyawuyii n abyedai ɓa kpe wo agyè. <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />Ɓa gna, “Wo ɓə la azaje gnyi, ama wo ta myilo n əwohni gnyi m! Əwo nu zhni Israila əsu! Fa wa kashi shnizhi n znudu nsaiye, nabai ya ga wo gaiciya. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Wo kpema lo n Shekwoyi nu. Fa Shekwoyi wa gwo wo ya nsaiye ngye wo ye wo lo, ntuge wo kwu gna, ‘Mi zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu nu.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />N ɓwasnu nlonu, akalákpeyi n a ɓə n ɓai znudu kpe n kwnusnu n woi nyi, ɓa knyi wo akpmi cè.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu fyífyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Ənya n kwo ɓə laka n nyipyei atukwogwnu kwoi lo snukna ngwnu-ata n nyipyei, wyegbma kwa ɓe kpe n əknyii vnyanya. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Əsa ngye snukna ngwnu-ata n nyipyei, Yeisu wa yì n bəgyei latu, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabachthani?” (N əkwo nu gyi nge “Əmi Shekwoyi, əmi Shekwoyi, knyiyi nu zhni ho nyi la mi ya a?”)<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />She aza yi n ɓa ɓə gnyiagnyi zhi n abaayi ɓə wo dəye, ɓa gna, “Wo yi Iliya lo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />N əsayisayii zaknayi n ɓa wa bwusi lo wa ɓe n soosoi. Wa da kwo fyi n anamnuwna mamai, wa pa kwo gyi n bwusi tukwo, wa ga Yeisu əkwo nge wo sni. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Azaje ɓa gna, “Nsaiye fye fa wo. Yi kwu zhi ya gye ngye Iliya ɓa ɓe wa gnyi wo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Njesnu She Yeisu ɓəə kwu əɓwici n bəgyei lawu, wa dna əsnu.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Nsayii əjesa n a ɓə ncei kna, Dagayipwuwa nya kwa gnajeya ngwnu-aba, ənya n kwo laka n əshe kwoi lo snuta. Əknyi kwa jeashna, ape ɓa ɓaya <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />avnyigwo ɓa gwuya. Aza agyigyiyi anayi n ɓa ɓə kwu fyí nyi, ɓaa jezeɓe n wyewyeyi. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Ɓa kwnuɓe n avnyigwo n Yeisu kalala avnu ɓa lo əzhiyaakwo gyigyiyi ɓa kwnuzhi da aza bəgyé.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Əsa n bəzhetagyida n aza yii n ɓa ɓə zhi ɓai gwu Yeisu nyi, ɓə gye əknyi kwoi jeashna, jesnu n aɓo vnyanya n ɓa ɓə zhni nyi, ədna kwa wo ɓa, jesnu ɓa daɓo, “Ɓəhnihni wo ɓə zhni Shekwoyi Nugwnu nu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Anyikwoza n mwa bəgyé ɓe zhi n abaayi, ɓai shiawye n tagnyi. Ɓa ɓə kwnu ń Gəlili nù ɓai vyi Yeisu ɓai wna wo əɓo akna. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />N əɓa atasni, Mariyamwu Magadalayi, Mariyamwu Jemyis əya n Yusufui, jesnu Zebədi anugwnu əyai.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu byibyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Shi wyeshe ɓə gnyi kwoi she, gyiwyeda wa ɓe woi gbmi n Arimatiya, ai yi wo nge Yusufu, əwo n wo ɓə la əwohni ga, waa zè Yeisu mwutuyi nyi. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Wa lo da Byilatusu, wa nya Yeisu nayi əɓo, Byilatusu wa ga əgbe nge a la Yeisu nayi ga wo. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yusufu wa la Yeisu nayi, waa kwo pa dna n əje luweluwei gyigyii. <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Waa kwo dna n əwohni vnyigwo woiwoi n wo ɓəə la nyìi n əpe nyi. Wa pmyi kwuta yaakwo ya tu n vnyigwo aloba jesnu wa lo wo nya. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mariyamwu Magadalayi n Mariyamwu dəyii ɓa ɓə sase kpe n awyei ce n vnyigwo nu.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abagwuyii zhi n vnyigwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />N əfyegyizhii, əwyi n kwo ɓo ya tu Paska nyagyi zhni nya nyi, apirisiti atukwoda jesnu n Afarisiyii ɓa lo da Byilatusu. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Ɓa gna, “Haamwasa, yi pá lo nge əsa n kwocednayi ɓə ye gnyi n wyewyeyi nyi, wo ɓə kwu gna, ‘N anyipyei ngwnu-ata avnu, mi ɓə je kala la.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Ntulonu, ga əgbe a gwu vnyigwo cenyicenyi nya nyipyei ngwnu-ata. Ntolonu m, əwo amwutuyi ɓa myi ɓa lo ɓai wyi əwo nayi jesnu ɓai gna aza nge wo la laka n əfyi. Kwocedna kpmasnui ye ɓə la du kpmisnuyi.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Byilatusu wa dnaɓəgbe, “La abagwuyi kwu. Lo, fye kpe nge vnyigwo n knaknayi lo ngye shi fye ɓa myi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ntulonu, ɓa lo ɓa zhni shi a ɓa gye nge vnyigwo knaknayi lo, ɓaa kwo tu əznù n kwutai jesnu ɓa tnu n azagwuyii zhi n ɓo.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu əfyikalala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />N Sibyiwyi avnu, n fyegyi ɓwai ń nyipyei kpmisnuyi laadi yi nya, Mariyamwu Magadalayi n Mariyamwu dəyii ɓa lo ɓəə gye vnyigwo.<verse eid="MAT 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Əknyi ashnaje yaakwo kwa laka ntuge maləka Dagayi nya ɓə shnizhi ɓe ń əshemi, wa lo vnyigwo, wa pmyi kwuta ya jesnu wa sasetu ń kwo. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Əwo nayi ɓə wu ngye əgbmanabmya nu, jesnu əwo aje n wu bwuibwuii ngye əgbmakwuta. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Əwo ədna kwa wo abagwuyi kwa zhni ɓa vnyi, ɓa kwu zè ngye azafyí.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Maləka wa gna anyikwoza yi, “Ədna to wo fye m. Ntuge mi kpəlo ge fye zna Yeisu nu shni, n a ɓə znu wo du nyi.<verse eid="MAT 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />“Wo to dnalo ń ya m; wo la laka n ɓwasnu shi wo ɓə da nyi. Fye ɓe fya gye aba ń a ɓə n woi shi nyi.<verse eid="MAT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />“Nlonu fye lo ń pyeepye fyei gna əwo amwutuyi: ‘Wo la laka ń əfyi jesnu wo gyilo ń fye abye woi lo Gəlili. N abaayi nu ń fye ɓəə gye wo əwye.’ Nsaiye, mi kwu gna fye.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Ntulonu anyikwoza yi, ɓa gaya ń pyeepye n vnyigwo aba, n ədnai, ama n nunui n agbmadai, jesnu ɓa bwusi lo ɓəə gna əwo amwutuyi. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />N əsagbmanyii Yeisu wa shegwnu ɓa. Wa gna “Sambəlika.” Ɓa ɓe da wo, ɓa shi wo ń apitabwada jesnu ɓa ga wo mwamwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Ntulonu Yeisu wa gna ɓa, “Ədna to wo fye m. Fye lo fye gna əmi azaje nge ɓa lo Gəlili; n abaayi nu ń ɓa ɓəə gye mi əwye.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abagwuyi tnutnu ɓədokwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Shi anyikwoza yi ɓə yee lo n zokwo, abagwuyi hó ɓa lofyi ń əzhiyaakwo ɓa ga apirisiti atukwoda əɓa əɓədokwu ɓəhoɓəhoi ń kwo ɓə kwu zhni. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />She apirisiti atukwoda ɓə yezhi ɓədo n abyedai ɓa pakwúlu, ɓa ga abagwuyi gyiwye yaakwo, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />ɓai gna ɓa, “Fye da aza nge, ‘Əwo amwutuyi ɓəə ɓe n sukwoi ɓa wo wyi, yii kwu wnagye.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />N anabagyi ye ɓə ló gwomna tnubwa, yi kpe əɓo əye lo ń yi ɓə gna wo, ya kwnu fye ya ń azhnìgye.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Ntulonu abagwuyi ɓa gwo gyiwye, ɓa zhni shi a ɓə gna ɓa. Jesnu anabagyi ye ɓaa gnamyiya fyi ń Ayahudiyi, nya nyipyei ye.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tnutnu yaakwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Nlonu amwutuyi awocei-gbmanyi ɓa lo Gəlili, ɓa lo əpe aba ń Yeisu ɓə gna ɓa nge ɓa lo nyi. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />She ɓa ɓə gye wo əwye, ɓa ga wo mwamwa; ama azaho ń ɓa, to ɓa ga gaiciya m. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Nlonu Yeisu wa ɓe da ɓa wa gna, “A la ikwo ga mi vnyanya n əshemi ɓədo n anyìi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Ntucenu fye lo fye kwu aza zhni amwutuyi n anyì vnyanya, fyee zhni ɓa batizima dna ń Dada əye n Nugwnui n Zafnu Gyigyiyii, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />jesnu fyee wunya nge ɓa vyi aɓo vnyanya n mi ɓə tu fye əgbe nyi. Ɓəhnihni mi kwnusnu lo n fyei ciici, nya anyìzo sa.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>